  <para style="h">Yọọn</para>
  <para style="toc1">Yọọn</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yọọn</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yọọn</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yọọn</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JHN 1" />
  <para style="s1">Ikọ Amaakappa Awo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 1:1" />Ke aditọọñọ ikọ akebaaba, ndin ikọ akeba ye Abasi, ikọ akenyʌñ ado Abasi. <verse eid="JHN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 1:2" />Anye akeba ye Abasi ke aditọọñọ. <verse eid="JHN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 1:3" />Ekekama anye enam afịd ñkpọ; ibaaha ñkpọ ndomokeed e-ekenamma i-imiikitooho anye. <verse eid="JHN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 1:4" />Uwem aketo anye, ndin uwem ado akedo unwana afịd awo. <verse eid="JHN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 1:5" />Unwana ami a-ayamma ke ekịm, ndin ekịm ikanna anye.<verse eid="JHN 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 1:6" />A-aba awo keed se Abasi akedọñ nọ adi; anye akekere Yọọn. <verse eid="JHN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 1:7" />Anye akedi nte ntiense, nọ atie ntiense abaña unwana ami, nọ ato ke anye afịd awo enịm ke akpanikọ. <verse eid="JHN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 1:8" />Idooho Yọọn ke idem amọ akedo unwana ado; anye akedi nte ntiense anọ unwana ado.<verse eid="JHN 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 1:9" />Ataa akpan unwana a-ayammake anọ afịd awo akedʌk adi ke ederimbod. <verse eid="JHN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 1:10" />Anye amaaba ke ederimbod, ndin akpesʌkado e-ekenamma ederimbod eto anye, ederimbod ikidiọọñọke anye. <verse eid="JHN 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 1:11" />Anye amaadi ubon ammọ, ado mbon ubon ammọ ikidaarake anye. <verse eid="JHN 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 1:12" />Ado afịd mbon e-ekedaarake anye, mbon e-ekenịmme anyịñ amọ ke akpanikọ, anye amaanọ ammọ ayọhọ unen adikappa ndo nditọ Abasi, <verse eid="JHN 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 1:13" />nditọ i-imiikimanake ito uduud awo, me ke unyịmme abʌkidem, me uduak ebe, ado emana eto Abasi.<verse eid="JHN 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 1:14" />Ikọ amaakappa ado awo anyʌñ adʌñ ke atu ñnyịn. Ñnyịn imikịt ubọọñ amọ, ubọọñ a-ñkukweeñe Ayịn Abasi a-aketooho Ete adi, ayọhọ ye mfọn ye akpanikọ.<verse eid="JHN 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 1:15" />(Yọọn amaatie ntiense abaña anye. Anye amaabọñ anwa-anwa ate, “Anye ami ado anye a-ami ñketañña mbaña, idahami ñkebooho, ‘Anye añkeeneke miin ke edem a-akpon añkan miin, sia anye amaababa ke ataa anyan ini mbemiso ami mba.’ ”) <verse eid="JHN 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 1:16" />Ato ke ntak ayọhọ mfọn amọ, afịd ñnyịn imibọ mfọn keed me aken. <verse eid="JHN 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 1:17" />Sia ekenọ mbed eto Moses; mfọn ye akpanikọ eketo Yisọs Krais. <verse eid="JHN 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 1:18" />Akenam awo ndomokeed ikịtte Abasi, ibọhọke ukweeñe Ayịn keed, a-anye ke idem amọ adooho Abasi anyʌñ aba ke ataa eti ndaha ewuana ye Ete, a-anam nọ ediọọñọ anye.<verse eid="JHN 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nsuukidem Yọọn Aduọkmmọọñ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 1:19" />Yọọn amaanọ ntiense ini a-mme adaaha mme Yuu ekedọññọ mme aku ye mme Lifai eto Yeruselem ekebịp anye me anye ado anie. <verse eid="JHN 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 1:20" />Anye amaatañ anwa-anwa ate, “Ami ndooho Krais.”<verse eid="JHN 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 1:21" />Ammọ emaebịp anye ete, “Ndin afo ado anie? Afo ado Elaiya?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">Anye amaabọọrọ, “Ami ndooho.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">“Afo ado Prọfed?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">Anye amaabọọrọ, “Iyoo.”<verse eid="JHN 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 1:22" />Ke akpatre ammọ emaemaana ebịp anye ete, “Ndin afo ado anie? Idọkkọ ñnyịn sia ana iben ibọọrọ isọk mbon e-ekidọññọ ñnyịn. Nsoo ke afo anie aditañ mbaña idem mfo?”<verse eid="JHN 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 1:23" />Yọọn amaabọọrọ ke ikọ prọfed Aisaiya ate, “Ami ndo uyio awo a-adaaha ke anaan akoot, ‘Ineeñe usʌñ inịm inọ Abọọñ.’ ”<verse eid="JHN 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 1:24" />Ndin mme Farisi e-ekesioho edọñ <verse eid="JHN 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 1:25" />emaebịp anye ete, “Nsoo inam nọ afo aduọk mme awo mmọọñ akpedo afo udooho Krais, udooho Elaiya, unyʌññọ udo Prọfed?”<verse eid="JHN 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 1:26" />Yọọn amaabọọrọ ammọ ate, “Ami ñkama mmọọñ nnịm uduọkmmọọñ, ado a-aba awo ke atu ndufo, a-ndufo imiidiọọñọke. <verse eid="JHN 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 1:27" />Anye ado awo añkeeneke miin ke edem, a-adooho ami ndotto aditat udʌk ikpaukod amọ.”<verse eid="JHN 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 1:28" />Afịd mme ñkpọ ami eketịppe ke Betani, idʌñ a-abaaha ke edem inyañ Yọdan, itie a-Yọọn akenịmme uduọkmmọọñ.<verse eid="JHN 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yọọn Atie Ntiense Abaña Yisọs</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 1:29" />Edem usen, Yọọn amaakịt Yisọs nte asaña abịne anye, anye amaanyʌñ abo ate, “Se Ayịn Edọñ Abasi a-abenne idiọọkñkpọ ederimbod afep! <verse eid="JHN 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 1:30" />Anye ado awo a-ami ñketañña mbaña idaha ami ñkebooho, ‘Awo añkeeneke miin ke edem a-akponno añkan miin asʌk adi, sia anye amaababa ke ataa anyan ini mbemiso ami.’ <verse eid="JHN 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 1:31" />Ami ke idem mmi ñkidiọọñọke anye, ado ntak a-ami ñkekamake mmọọñ nnịm uduọkmmọọñ akedo nọ eben anye ewọt Isrel anwa-anwa.”<verse eid="JHN 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 1:32" />Ndin Yọọn amaanọ ikọ ntiense anwa-anwa ate: “Ami mmaakịt Adisana Sịbidịd naña asọiyọ ato hefịn nte ibiom adidoro anye ke idem. <verse eid="JHN 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 1:33" />Ami ke idem mmi ñkidiọọñọke anye, ado anye a-akendọññọ miin nọ ndiduọk mmọọñ akendọkkọ miin ate, ‘Awo a-afo akịtte naña Adisana Sịbidịd adidoro ke idem ado anye a-adiikama Adisana Sịbidịd inịm uduọkmmọọñ.’ <verse eid="JHN 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 1:34" />Ami mmekịt ñnyʌñ ndo ntiense ke anye ado Adimek Ayịn Abasi.”<verse eid="JHN 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mme Mbed Yọọn Ekeene Yisọs</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 1:35" />Edem usen Yọọn amaamaana akeda do ye mbed amọ iba. <verse eid="JHN 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 1:36" />Yọọn akekịt naña Yisọs adisaña aboiyo, amaabo, “Se se, Ayịn Edọñ Abasi!”<verse eid="JHN 1:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 1:37" />Ke ini mbed iba ami ekekoppo se Yọọn aketañ ammọ emaekeene Yisọs. <verse eid="JHN 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 1:38" />Yisọs amaakanna iso, akịt naña ammọ ekeene anye anyʌñ abịp ammọ ate, <char style="wj">“Nsoo ke ndufo eyem?”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:38">Ammọ emaebịp anye ete, “Andikpeeb, afo adʌñ ke mmọọ?”<verse eid="JHN 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 1:39" />Anye amaabọọrọ ammọ ate, <char style="wj">“Idi ke eyaekekịt.”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:39">Ndin ammọ emaekaa enyʌñ ekekịt nte anye akedʌñ, enyʌñ eba ye anye usen ado. Akedo ñkpọ nte ñkanika inaañ uweemeayio.<verse eid="JHN 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 1:40" />Keed ke atu awo iba e-ekekappake edo mbed Yisọs ke emaekekop se Yọọn aketañ akedo Andru, ayịneka Saimọn Pita. <verse eid="JHN 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 1:41" />Akpa ñkpọ se Andru akenam akedo adikiyem ayịneka amọ Saimọn ñnyʌñ ndọkkọ anye mbo, “Ñnyịn imikịt Krais.” <verse eid="JHN 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 1:42" />Ndin anye amaaben Saimọn abịne Yisọs.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:42">Yisọs amaase anye anyʌñ abo, <char style="wj">“Afo ado Saimọn, ayịn Yọọn. Eduukoot fiin Kefas”</char> (awuọñọke Pita<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:42 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Pita </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ado usem Greek ado </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kefas</char><char style="ft" closed="false">ado usem Aramaik, naña ikọ iba awuọñọ </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">itiad.</char></note>).<verse eid="JHN 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisọs Akoot Filib ye Natandiel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 1:43" />Edem usen, Yisọs amaabiide adika Kalili. Anye akekịt Filib, amaabo anye ate, <char style="wj">“Ñkeene miin.”</char><verse eid="JHN 1:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 1:44" />Filib aketo Bedsaida, idʌñ keed mme Andru ye Pita. <verse eid="JHN 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 1:45" />Filib amaakịt Natandiel anyʌñ abo anye, “Ñnyịn imikịt anye ake Moses akewette abaña ke ñwed Mbed, ye anye a-mme prọfed ekewette ebaña, anye ado Yisọs ayịn Yosef, a-atooho Nasared.”<verse eid="JHN 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 1:46" />Natandiel amaabịp anye ate, “Ato Nasared? Nte eti ñkpọ akeme ito Nasared?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:46">Filib amaabọọrọ anye, “Kap di dise.”<verse eid="JHN 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 1:47" />Ke ini Yisọs akekịtte Natandiel nte adi, anye amaabo, <char style="wj">“Ataa ayịn Isrel ado ami, abiaña ndomokeed isịneke anye ke idem.”</char><verse eid="JHN 1:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 1:48" />Natandiel amaabịp anye ate, “Afo andiọọñọ miin die?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:48">Yisọs amaabọọrọ, <char style="wj">“Mbemiso Filib akedukoot fiin, ami mmaukekịt fiin ke idak eto fik.”</char><verse eid="JHN 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 1:49" />Natandiel amaabọọrọ ate, “Andikpeeb, afo ado Ayịn Abasi; afo ado adidem Isrel.”<verse eid="JHN 1:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 1:50" />Yisọs amaabo anye, <char style="wj">“Afo annịm miin ke akpanikọ sia ami mmaubo ke mmaukịt fiin ke idak eto fik. Afo ayaakịt mme ñkpọ se ikpokpoon ikan ado.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 1:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 1:51" />Ndin, Yisọs amaamaana adian, ate: <char style="wj">“Ke ataa akpanikọ ke ami udọkkọ fiin,</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:51 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke usem Greek ado uwak</char></note> <char style="wj">afo ayaakịt nte hefịn abeere, anyʌñ akịt mme enyere Abasi nte edọdọọk enyʌñ esọsọiyọ Ayịn Awo ke idem.”</char><verse eid="JHN 1:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JHN 2" />
  <para style="s1">Yisọs Anam Mmọọñ Akappa Ukọd</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 2:1" />Ke usen ita amaakeboiyo usọrọ ndọ amaaba ke Kana ke Kalili. Eka Yisọs amaakaa, <verse eid="JHN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 2:2" />emaenyʌñ ekoot Yisọs ye mme mbed amọ. <verse eid="JHN 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 2:3" />Ke ukọd se mme anam usọrọ ndọ ekenie amaakekweeñe, eka Yisọs amaakebo anye, “Ammọ inieghe ukọd aba.”<verse eid="JHN 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 2:4" />Yisọs amaabọọrọ anye, <char style="wj">“Mma, nsoo ido ndubeghe mmi? Ini mmi ikemme diin.”</char><verse eid="JHN 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 2:5" />Ado eka amọ amaabo mme akamaisen ndọ ate, “Inam se anye ibo ndufo enam.”<verse eid="JHN 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 2:6" />Abañ mmọọñ itiokeed emaediọhọ ekpere do, utọ se mme Yuu ekesikama ke ini usọrọ adinam idem asana akeene ido ammọ; abañ keed amaakeme adidọñọ ñkpọ nte kalọn<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte lita 75 awuọ ñkpọ nte lita 115</char></note> mmọọñ edịb awuọ edịb mme duob.<verse eid="JHN 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 2:7" />Yisọs amaabo mme akamaisen ndọ ate, <char style="wj">“Idọñ mmọọñ ke mme abañ ado nọ ayọhọ.”</char> Ndin ammọ emaedọñ mmọọñ ke mme abañ ado tutu ayọhọ asịm inua.<verse eid="JHN 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 2:8" />Akem Yisọs amaabo ammọ, <char style="wj">“Ikoi ubaak iben isọk ekamba akama usọrọ.”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 2:8">Ammọ emaenam ntoro; <verse eid="JHN 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 2:9" />ndin ekamba akama usọrọ amaatʌm mmọọñ e-ekenamma nọ akappa ukọd. Anye ikidiọọñọke nte aketo me nte ekedat, sʌk mme akamaisen ekediọọñọ. Ndin ekamba akama usọrọ amaakoot ebendọ ada nsan-nsan, <verse eid="JHN 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 2:10" />anyʌñ abo anye ate, “Afịd awo esito edeeme ataa inem ukọd ndin edideeme anye i-imiinemme ke mme isenawo emaekenwọnwọñ inem ado nọ ayʌkkọ; ado afo atịmme anịm ataa inem ukọd tutu idahami.”<verse eid="JHN 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 2:11" />Utịppeñkpọ a-Yisọs akenamma mi ke Kana ke Kalili akedo akpa ke atu mme idiọọñọ a-anye akedatta ayaara ubọọñ amọ, ndin mme mbed amọ emaenịm anye ke akpanikọ.<verse eid="JHN 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 2:12" />Usọrọ ndọ ami akekweeñe, anye amaakpọñ akaa Kapanum ye eka amọ, nditọeka amọ ideen, ye mme mbed amọ. Ammọ emaekeba do ke ibad-ibad usen.<verse eid="JHN 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisọs Abịn mme Awo Asio ke Tembịd</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 2:13" />Ke ini Usọrọ Nsaña Mboiyo mme Yuu amaakedikpere, Yisọs amaakaa Yeruselem. <verse eid="JHN 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 2:14" />Anye amaakịt naña mme awo enyaam enañ, edọñ ye ibiom, akịt mbon ukpəho akʌk naña etie ekanna akpokoro ke mme akwere tembịd esʌk ekpəho akʌk. <verse eid="JHN 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 2:15" />Yisọs amaadat udʌk anam ikpa, abịne afịd awo asịññe ke mme afe tembịd, abịne mme edọñ ye mme enañ ñko; anye amaasuan akʌk mme akpəho akʌk ke isọñ, anyʌñ anyui mme akpokoro ammọ aduọọñọ. <verse eid="JHN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 2:16" />Anye amaabo mme anyam ibiom ate, <char style="wj">“Ikoono ñkpọ ami isịññe mi! Itre adiben ufọk Ete mmi nnịm itie unyam udua!”</char> <verse eid="JHN 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 2:17" />Ndin mme mbed amọ emaetoiyo ikọ prọfesi e-ewette ebo: “Akpọsọñ ima a-ami nnieghe nnọ ufọk mfo iyakka mbọ emem.”<verse eid="JHN 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 2:18" />Ndin mme Yuu emaebịp anye, “Nsoo idiọọñọ ke afo akeme iwọt ñnyịn adisọọñọ ke afo amenie adudu adinam afịd ñkpọ ami?”<verse eid="JHN 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 2:19" />Yisọs amaabọọrọ ammọ ate, <char style="wj">“Iwuut tembịd ami, ndin ami ñyaamaana mbọp anye ke usen ita.”</char><verse eid="JHN 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 2:20" />Mme Yuu emaebọọrọ ete, “Ekedat isua aba mme itiokeed ebọp tembịd ami, ndin afo ayaabọp anye ke usen ita?” <verse eid="JHN 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 2:21" />Ado tembịd a-anye aketañña abaña akedo idem amọ. <verse eid="JHN 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 2:22" />Ke Yisọs amaakeset ke ñkpa, mme mbed amọ emaetoiyo se anye aketañ. Ndin ammọ emaenịm ikọ Abasi ye se Yisọs aketañ ke akpanikọ.<verse eid="JHN 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 2:23" />Ke ini anye akebaaha ke Yeruselem ke ntak Usọrọ Nsaña Mboiyo, uwak awo emaenịm anye ke akpanikọ ke ini ammọ ekekịtte mme idiọọñọ se anye akenam. <verse eid="JHN 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 2:24" />Ado Yisọs ikiiyakka idem inọ ammọ, sia anye amaadiọọñọ se afịd awo edo. <verse eid="JHN 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 2:25" />Anye ikiyemme ntiense ito awo ndomokeed, sia anye amaadiọọñọ akikere esịd awo keedekeed.<verse eid="JHN 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JHN 3" />
  <para style="s1">Yisọs Akpeep Nikodemọs Ñkpọ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 3:1" />Amaaba awo Farisi keed a-akekereke Nikodemọs, a-akedooho keed ke atu akwa esob ukara mme Yuu. <verse eid="JHN 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 3:2" />Anye amaadi adisoobo Yisọs akonayio anyʌñ abo anye ate, “Andikpeeb, ñnyịn imidiọọñọ ke afo ado andikpeeb a-atooho Abasi. Sia awo ndomokeed ikpikanna inam mme utịppe idiọọñọ a-afo anamma adieke Abasi imiikpibaaha ye anye.”<verse eid="JHN 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 3:3" />Yisọs amaabọọrọ anye ate, <char style="wj">“Ataa akpanikọ ke ami ntañ unọọ fiin, ibọhọke awo atịmme amana ufa, anye idiikanna ikịt abioubọọñ Abasi.”</char><verse eid="JHN 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 3:4" />Nikodemọs amaabịp anye ate, “Awo akeme die adimaana mmana ke ini anye amaakesọñ? Ke aditʌm ntañ, anye idiikanna itịmme ikidʌk idịb eka amọ ayọhọ akañ iba ikimaana imana!”<verse eid="JHN 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 3:5" />Yisọs amaabọọrọ anye ate, <char style="wj">“Ataa akpanikọ ke ami ntañ unọọ fiin, ibọhọke awo amana ato mmọọñ ye Sịbidịd, anye idiikanna idʌk abioubọọñ Abasi.</char> <verse eid="JHN 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 3:6" /><char style="wj">Abʌkidem aman abʌkidem, ado Sịbidịd aman sịbidịd.</char> <verse eid="JHN 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 3:7" /><char style="wj">Ikpinaaha ukpa fiin</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke usem Greek ado uwak</char></note> <char style="wj">idem ke ami adibo, ‘Ana afo amaana amana ufa.’</char> <verse eid="JHN 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 3:8" /><char style="wj">Afịm afịme aka nte anye ama. Afo amekeme adikop uyom amọ, ado ukanna utañ nte anye ato me nte anye aka. Kpa ntoro ke ado ye afịd awo e-emanake eto Sịbidịd.”</char><verse eid="JHN 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 3:9" />Nikodemọs amaabịp anye ate “Die ke ami akeme aditịppe?”<verse eid="JHN 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 3:10" />Yisọs amaabo anye, <char style="wj">“Afo ado andikpeeb ke Isrel, ndin afo udiọọñọke mme ñkpọ ami?</char> <verse eid="JHN 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 3:11" /><char style="wj">Ataa akpanikọ ke ami ntañ unọọ fiin, ñnyịn itañ se ñnyịn idiọọñọ, inyʌñ itie ntiense ibaña se ñnyịn ikịt, ado mme awo isʌkkọ inyenyịmme ikọ ntiense ñnyịn.</char> <verse eid="JHN 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 3:12" /><char style="wj">Ami mmetañ mme ñkpọ ederimbod unọ fiin ado afo unịmme ke akpanikọ; die ndin ke afo uduunịm ke akpanikọ adieke ami ntañña mme ñkpọ e-ebañake hefịn?</char> <verse eid="JHN 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 3:13" /><char style="wj">Kpaanam awo ndomokeed ikaaha hefịn ibọhọke anye a-aketooho hefịn adi, a-adooho Ayịn Awo.</char> <verse eid="JHN 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 3:14" /><char style="wj">Kpa naña Moses akebenne udʌkikọd ke anyọñ ke anaan, kpa ntoro ke ana ebenne Ayịn Awo ke anyọñ,</char> <verse eid="JHN 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 3:15" /><char style="wj">nọ afịd awo e-enịmme anye ke akpanikọ enie nsi-nsi uwem ke anye.</char><verse eid="JHN 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 3:16" />“Sia Abasi akeneenekke ama ederimbod asịn anye akenọ ukweeñe Ayịn keed a-anye anieghe nọ awo akeedodo a-anịmme anye ke akpanikọ akuutak ado anie nsi-nsi uwem. <verse eid="JHN 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 3:17" />Sia Abasi ikinọọhọ Ayịn amọ adi ederimbod adibiom ederimbod ikpe, ado nọ adinyaaña ederimbod ato ke anye. <verse eid="JHN 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 3:18" />Awo akeedodo anịmme anye ke akpanikọ, awo idiibiommo anye ikpe, ado awo akeedodo i-imiinịmme anye ke akpanikọ, e-ekap ebobiom anye ikpe, sia ammọ inieghe mbuọdidem ke anyịñ ukweeñe Ayịn keed a-Abasi anieghe. <verse eid="JHN 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 3:19" />Anye ami ado ubiideikpe: Unwana a-adi ederimbod, ado mme awo ema ekịm ekan unwana, sia se ammọ enañña edo ndiọi. <verse eid="JHN 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 3:20" />Afịd awo se inam idiọọkñkpọ esuasua unwana ndin idiidʌkkọ unwana mbaak ediyaara mme idiọọkñkpọ ammọ. <verse eid="JHN 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 3:21" />Ado awo akeedodo aduuho uwem akpanikọ a-adʌk unwana, nọ ekịt anwa-anwa ke se ammọ enam ado ke iso Abasi.”<verse eid="JHN 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yọọn Amaana Atie Ntiense Abaña Yisọs</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 3:22" />Ke ñkpọ ami amaakeboiyo, Yisọs ye mme mbed amọ emaekaiya esịd idʌñ Yudia akeba ye ammọ etək ini anyʌñ aduọk mme awo mmọọñ. <verse eid="JHN 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 3:23" />Yọọn ñko akesʌk aduọk mme awo mmọọñ ke Anọn a-akpereke Salịm, sia mmọọñ amaanekke aba ke udo, ndin mme awo emaesidi do edibọ uduọkmmọọñ. <verse eid="JHN 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 3:24" />Ami aketịppe mbemiso ekesịn Yọọn ke ufọk ñkpakọb. <verse eid="JHN 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 3:25" />Mfaaña amaatọọñọ ke ufọọd usʌk mme mbed Yọọn ye awo Yuu keed ke abaña edu adinam idem asana. <verse eid="JHN 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 3:26" />Ndin ammọ emaebịne Yọọn enyʌñ ekebo anye ate, “Andikpeeb, awo a-akebaaha ye afo ke edem inyañ Yọdan uko, anye a-afo akenọọhọ ikọ ntiense abaña, asʌk aduọk mmọọñ ndin afịd awo ekịppe ebịne anye.”<verse eid="JHN 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 3:27" />Yọọn amaabọọrọ ammọ, “Awo akeme adibọ enọ a-atooho hefịn kpọd. <verse eid="JHN 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 3:28" />Ndufo ke idem ndufo emekeme ido ntiense ke mmaabo, ‘Ami ndooho Krais ado endọọdọñ ebo mbem anye iso ndi.’ <verse eid="JHN 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 3:29" />Anwaanndọ anie ebendọ. Ufan a-aseeghe ñkpọ abaña ebendọ ami atietie anyʌñ akpañ utọñ anọ anye, esịd anyʌñ ayọhọ anye ye idaara ke anye amaakop uyio ebendọ. Inemesịd ado ado ake mmi, ndin idahami esịd mmi ayọhọ ye idaara. <verse eid="JHN 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 3:30" />Ana anye akpon añkan miin; ana nte ami nsesịp.<verse eid="JHN 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 3:31" />“Anye a-atooho anyọñ adi, a-akpon akan afịd awo; anye a-atooho ederimbod anie ederimbod, anyʌñ atañ ikọ nte awo a-atooho ederimbod. Anye a-atooho hefịn ado andikoñ ñkan afịd awo. <verse eid="JHN 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 3:32" />Anye ado ntiense anọ se anye akịt anyʌñ akop, ado awo ndomokeed inịmme ikọ ntiense amọ ke akpanikọ. <verse eid="JHN 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 3:33" />Awo akeedodo a-anịmme ikọ ntiense ami ke akpanikọ asọọñọ anyịmme ke Abasi ado akpanikọ. <verse eid="JHN 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 3:34" />Sia awo se Abasi adọñ, atañ ikọ a-atooho Abasi, sia Abasi anọ Sịbidịd ayọhọ-ayọhọ. <verse eid="JHN 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 3:35" />Ete a-ama Ayịn ndin ayaak afịd ñkpọ asịn anye ke ubọk. <verse eid="JHN 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 3:36" />Awo akeedodo a-anịmme Ayịn ke akpanikọ a-anie nsi-nsi uwem, ado awo keed akeedodo a-asịnne Ayịn idiikịtte uwem, sia iyadesịd Abasi adoro anye ke idem.”<verse eid="JHN 3:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JHN 4" />
  <para style="s1">Yisọs Aneme Nneme ye Awonwaan Sameria</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 4:1" />Yisọs amaadidiọọñọ ke mme Farisi emaekop ke mme mbed Yisọs esʌk ewak ndin ke anye a-aduọk mme awo mmọọñ akan Yọọn Aduọkmmọọñ, <verse eid="JHN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 4:2" />akpesʌkado ke aditʌm ntañ, ikidooho Yisọs akeduọk mmọọñ, akekap ado mme mbed amọ. <verse eid="JHN 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 4:3" />Ke ntoro anye amaakpọñ Yudia, amaana atịmme akaa Kalili ini keed mfen.<verse eid="JHN 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 4:4" />Akena Yisọs asaña aboiyo ke Sameria, <verse eid="JHN 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 4:5" />ndin anye amaadisịm abio keed ke Sameria a-akereke Sika, a-akekpereke isọñ a-Yekọb akenọọhọ ayịn amọ Yosef. <verse eid="JHN 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 4:6" />Ube mmọọñ Yekọb amaaba do, ndin sia idem amaakemem Yisọs ato anyan isañ, anye amaasuuk atie akpere ube mmọọñ ado. Akedo ñkpọ nte ñkanika duob mme iba ufọọd uweemeayio.<verse eid="JHN 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 4:7" />Ke ini awonwaan Sameria keed akediighe adikoi mmọọñ, Yisọs amaabo anye, <char style="wj">“Mbọk afo ayannọ miin ñnwọñ?”</char> <verse eid="JHN 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 4:8" />(Mme mbed amọ emaedʌk abio ekaa adikidep ndidia.)<verse eid="JHN 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 4:9" />Awonwaan Sameria ado amaabo anye, “Afo ado Yuu ndin ami ndo awonwaan Sameria. Afo anam die ambeeñe miin mmọọñ adinwọñ?” (Sia mme Yuu inieghe ewuana ye mbon Sameria.)<verse eid="JHN 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 4:10" />Yisọs amaabọọrọ anye ate, <char style="wj">“Akpedo afo amediọọñọ enọ Abasi ye awo u-ubeeñeke fiin mmọọñ, afo akpaakebeeñe anye ndin anye akpaakunọ fiin mmọọñ uwem.”</char><verse eid="JHN 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 4:11" />Awonwaan ado amaabo, “Ete, afo unieghe ñkpọ se akama akoi mmọọñ, ñko ube mmọọñ ami atəño. Ke mmọọ ke afo akeme adibọ mmọọñ uwem ami? <verse eid="JHN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 4:12" />Nte afo amekpon akan ete ñnyịn Yekọb, a-akinọọhọ ñnyịn ube mmọọñ ami, a-anye ke idem amọ akesinyʌññọ anwọñ mmọọñ ato ube ami, kpa ye nditọ ideen amọ ye mme ufene amọ?”<verse eid="JHN 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 4:13" />Yisọs amaabọọrọ anye ate, <char style="wj">“Awo keed akeedodo anwọññọ mmọọñ ami, itọñ ayaamaana asat anye,</char> <verse eid="JHN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 4:14" /><char style="wj">ado awo akeedodo a-anwọññọ mmọọñ a-ami ndiinọ, itọñ idiisatta ammọ aba. Ke akpanikọ, mmọọñ a-ami nnọọhọ ammọ ayaakappa ado idịm mmọọñ ke esịd idem ammọ adiidat ikisịm uwem nsi-nsi.”</char><verse eid="JHN 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 4:15" />Awonwaan ado amaabo anye, “Ete, nnọ miin mmọọñ ami mbaak itọñ aditịmme ansat miin aba, ami ndinyʌñ ntịmme ndi ukoi mmọọñ mi.”<verse eid="JHN 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 4:16" />Yisọs amaabọọrọ anye ate, <char style="wj">“Kaa kekoot ebe mfo tịmme di.”</char><verse eid="JHN 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 4:17" />Anye amaabọọrọ ate, “Ami nnieghe ebe.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 4:17">Yisọs amaabo anye, <char style="wj">“Afo amenen naña abo ke imọ inieghe ebe.</char> <verse eid="JHN 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 4:18" /><char style="wj">Akpanikọ ado ke afo amaanenie ebe ition ndin awodeen a-afo anieghe idahami idooho ebe mfo. Se afo asʌk atañ idahado ado ataa akpanikọ.”</char><verse eid="JHN 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 4:19" />Awonwaan ado amaabo ate, “Ete, ami mmekịt ke afo ado prọfed. <verse eid="JHN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 4:20" />Mme eteete ñnyịn ekesikpono Abasi ke anyọñ abod ami, ado ndufo mme Yuu ebo ke Yeruselem ado itie a-anaaha ñnyịn ikpono Abasi.”<verse eid="JHN 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 4:21" />Yisọs amaabo anye, <char style="wj">“Awonwaan, nnịm miin ke akpanikọ, ini asʌk adi a-ndufo imiidiikponoke Abasi aba ke abod ami, me ke Yeruselem.</char> <verse eid="JHN 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 4:22" /><char style="wj">Ndufo mbon Sameria ekpono se ndufo imiidiọọñọke; ado ñnyịn ikpono se idiọọñọ, sia adinyaaña ato mme Yuu.</char> <verse eid="JHN 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 4:23" /><char style="wj">Ado ini asʌk adi, anyʌñ adidi ama, ake ataa mme andikpono Abasi ediikpono Ete ke Sịbidịd ye ke akpanikọ, sia ammọ edoñño utọ mme andikpono Abasi e-Ete ayemme.</char> <verse eid="JHN 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 4:24" /><char style="wj">Abasi ado sịbidịd, ndin mbon e-ekponoke anye ana ekpono ke Sịbidịd ye ke akpanikọ.”</char><verse eid="JHN 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 4:25" />Akem awonwaan ado amaabo, “Mmediọọñọ mbo ke Mesaiya” (e-ekoodo Krais) “asʌk adi. Anye amaadi, anye ayaanam afịd ñkpọ inwaña ñnyịn.”<verse eid="JHN 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 4:26" />Ndin Yisọs amaabo, <char style="wj">“Ami ansʌkkọ ntañ ikọ ye afo mi, ami ndo anye.”</char><verse eid="JHN 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mme Mbed Editịmme Ebịne Yisọs</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 4:27" />Kpa ke ini ado mme mbed amọ emaenyọñ edi, idem amaanyʌñ akpa ammọ adikịt naña anye atañ ikọ ye awonwaan. Ado awo ndomokeed ikibịppe ibo, “Nsoo ke afo ayem?” me “Ntak a-afo atañña ikọ ye anye-e?”<verse eid="JHN 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 4:28" />Ndin awonwaan ado amaakpọñ abañ mmọọñ amọ atịmme akaa esịd abio aketañ anọ mme awo ate, <verse eid="JHN 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 4:29" />“Idi, idise awo a-atañña afịd ñkpọ se ñkenanam annọọ. Me anye akap ado Krais?” <verse eid="JHN 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 4:30" />Ammọ emaewuọñọ eto abio esaña ebịne anye.<verse eid="JHN 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 4:31" />Ke ini ami, mme mbed amọ ekesʌk ekpeiye anye ete, “Andikpeeb, dia ñkpọ.”<verse eid="JHN 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 4:32" />Ado anye amaabo ammọ, <char style="wj">“Ami mmenie ndidia adidia a-ndufo imiidiọọñọke ibaña.”</char><verse eid="JHN 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 4:33" />Ndin mme mbed amọ emaebiime idem ammọ ete, “Me awo amaadat ndidia asọk anye?”<verse eid="JHN 4:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 4:34" />Yisọs amaabo, <char style="wj">“Ndidia mmi ado adinam uduak andikindọñ miin ñnyʌñ ñkweeñe utom amọ.</char> <verse eid="JHN 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 4:35" /><char style="wj">Nte ndufo isibooho, ‘Ayak afiọñ inaañ mbemiso ini idọk?’ Ami ntañ inọ ndufo, itat anyen ndufo, iseet mme inwañ! Ini idọk a-akem.</char> <verse eid="JHN 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 4:36" /><char style="wj">E-etọtọọñọ adikpe adọkidọk akʌkutom amọ, ndin anye adọk mfịd nsi-nsi uwem nọ anditọtọ ye andidọdọk edaara keed.</char> <verse eid="JHN 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 4:37" /><char style="wj">Ado asịn ñke ami, ‘Awo keed atọtọ, mfen adọdọk’ ado akpanikọ.</char> <verse eid="JHN 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 4:38" /><char style="wj">Ami ñkidọñ ndufo ekedọk se ndufo imiikinamma inịm. Mbon mfen emaenam akpọsọñ utom ado, ndin ndufo emedibọ ufọn utom ammọ.”</char><verse eid="JHN 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Uwak Mbon Sameria Enịm Yisọs ke Akpanikọ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 4:39" />Uwak mbon Sameria se ikito abio ado emaenịm Yisọs ke akpanikọ ke ntak ikọ ntiense awonwaan ado, a-akekaaha ntom: “Anye amaatañ afịd ñkpọ se ami ñkenanam annọ.” <verse eid="JHN 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 4:40" />Ndin ke ini mbon Sameria ekedikịtte anye, ammọ emaekpeiye anye ete aba ye ammọ. Ndin anye amaatie usen iba ye ammọ. <verse eid="JHN 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 4:41" />Ke ntak ikọ amọ, uwak mbon mfen emaekappa esịd enyʌñ edo mme andinịm ke akpanikọ.<verse eid="JHN 4:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 4:42" />Ammọ emaebo awonwaan ado, “Ñnyịn inịmme ke akpanikọ ke ntak se afo aketañ ikpọọñ, sia idahami ñnyịn imikop ke utọñ ñnyịn, inyʌñ idiọọñọ ke awo ami ado Andinyaaña ederimbod ke akpanikọ.”<verse eid="JHN 4:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisọs Akọk Ayịn Adaaha Udọñọ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 4:43" />Ke usen iba amaakeboiyo, anye amaakpọñ akaa Kalili. <verse eid="JHN 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 4:44" />(Yisọs ke idem amọ amaasio atañ ke prọfed inieghe ukpono ke abio amọ.) <verse eid="JHN 4:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 4:45" />Ke anye amaakedisịm Kalili, mbon Kalili emaedaara anye. Ammọ emaekịt afịd ñkpọ se anye akenam ke Yeruselem ke Usọrọ Nsaña Mboiyo, sia ammọ emaeba do.<verse eid="JHN 4:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 4:46" />Anye amaamaana akaa Kana ke Kalili ini keed mfen, itie a-anye akenamma mmọọñ akappa ukọd. Ndin amaaba ekamba awo keed ke Kapanum i-idem akebiakka ayịn amọ awodeen. <verse eid="JHN 4:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 4:47" />Ke ini awo ami akekoppo ke Yisọs amaato Yudia adisịm Kalili, anye amaabịne anye anyʌñ akekpeiye anye ate adi adikọk ayịn imọ udọñọ, sia amaakpere ñkpa.<verse eid="JHN 4:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 4:48" />Yisọs amaabo anye, <char style="wj">“Ibọhọke ndufo e-ekịt mme idiọọñọ utịppeñkpọ ye ñkpọ ñkpaidem, ndufo idiinịmme ke akpanikọ.”</char><verse eid="JHN 4:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 4:49" />Ekamba adaaha ami amaabo, “Ete, mbọk di mbemiso ayịn mmi akpa.”<verse eid="JHN 4:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 4:50" />Yisọs amaabọọrọ ate, <char style="wj">“Kaa, ayịn mfo ayaadu uwem.”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 4:50">Awo ami amaanịm se Yisọs aketañ anyʌñ anyọñ. <verse eid="JHN 4:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 4:51" />Ke ini adaaha ado akesʌkkọ asaña ke usʌñ unyọñọ, nditọufọk amọ emaedisoobo anye enyʌñ edọkkọ ke ayịn amọ a-adu uwem. <verse eid="JHN 4:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 4:52" />Ke ini anye akebịppe adidiọọñọ ini se idem akesọñ ayịn amọ, ammọ emaebo anye, “Ufiob idem ado akekpọñ anye ñkpọñ a-akeboiyoke ke ñkanika keed uweemeayio.”<verse eid="JHN 4:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 4:53" />Ndin ete ayịn ami amaadiọọñọ ke ini ado akedo ukem ini a-Yisọs akebooho anye, <char style="wj">“Ayịn mfo ayaadu uwem.”</char> Ndin anye ye afịd ufọk amọ emaenịm Yisọs ke akpanikọ.<verse eid="JHN 4:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 4:54" />Anye ami akedo ayọhọ idiọọñọ iba a-Yisọs akenamma, ke anye amaaketo Yudia adiwuọ Kalili.<verse eid="JHN 4:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JHN 5" />
  <para style="s1">Ukọk Udọñọ ke Ñkpọdiọhọ Mmọọñ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 5:1" />Etək ini amaakeboiyo, Yisọs amaakaa Yeruselem ke ntak usọrọ mme Yuu. <verse eid="JHN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 5:2" />Ke Yeruselem ñkpọdiọhọ mmọọñ keed amaaba a-akpereke Inuaatob Edọñ, e-ekekoodo ke usem Aramaik Betesda<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Usʌk mme ikpañwed ewet </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Bedsata</char><char style="ft" closed="false">; usʌk ñko ewet </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Betsaida</char></note>, a-mme abai ition ekenyʌññọ edudak ekanna anye ekʌk. <verse eid="JHN 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 5:3" />Mi ke ataa uwak mbon ñkpọnnam ekesidunam, mme nnan, mbʌñọ ye mme akpaubeñ. <verse eid="JHN 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 5:4" />Ke ini ke ini, enyere Abọọñ amaasidi adibəkko mmọọñ ami. Ndin awo keed akeedodo a-aketooho adʌk mmọọñ ami, emaebəkko ntom, amaasibọ nsọñidem akpekọm se udọñọ ikidọñ anye. <verse eid="JHN 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 5:5" />Amaaba awo keed do a-akedọñọke isua edịb mme duob mme itiaita. <verse eid="JHN 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 5:6" />Ke ini Yisọs akekịtte anye naña ana do anyʌñ adiọọñọ ke anye amaabọ ufen ado akpeene, amaabịp anye ate, <char style="wj">“Nte afo ameyem idem usọñ?”</char><verse eid="JHN 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 5:7" />Awo udọñọ ado amaabọọrọ ate, “Ete, ami nnieghe awo se imben isịn ke ñkpọdiọhọ mmọọñ ami ke emaebəkko mmọọñ. Ke ini ami ndomoke ukeme adidʌk, awo mfen ambebem miin adʌk.”<verse eid="JHN 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 5:8" />Yisọs amaabo anye, <char style="wj">“Dakka da! Ben mbịd mfo nyʌñ saña.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 5:9" />Inikeed-inikeed, idem amaasọñ awo ado; anye amaanyʌñ aben mbịd amọ asaña.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 5:9">Ñkpọ ami aketịppeke ke usen Sabad. <verse eid="JHN 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 5:10" />Ndin mme Yuu emaebo awo e-ekekọkkọ udọñọ ete, “mfịn ado Sabad, mbed ukpan fiin adiben mbịd mfo nsaña.”<verse eid="JHN 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 5:11" />Ado anye amaabọọrọ ate, “Awo a-akenamma idem ansọñ akembo, <char style="wj">‘Ben mbịd mfo nyʌñ saña.’</char> ”<verse eid="JHN 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 5:12" />Ndin ammọ emaebịp anye, “Anie awo ido awo a-akubooho yak aben mbịd mfo asaña?”<verse eid="JHN 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 5:13" />Awo e-ekekọkkọ udọñọ ikinieghe ifiọk ndomokeed mme anye akedo anie awo, sia Yisọs amaadʌk atu mme awo e-ekebaaha do asop.<verse eid="JHN 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 5:14" />Akema Yisọs amaadikịt anye ke tembịd anyʌñ abo anye, <char style="wj">“Sese, idem amaana usọñ. Kuunam idiọọkñkpọ aba, mmiidooho ntoro ñkpọ adiọọhọ akan ado akeme aditịppe unọọ fiin.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 5:15" />Awo ami amaanyọñ anyʌñ akedọkkọ mbọọñ Yuu ke Yisọs akenam nọ idem imọ asọñ.<verse eid="JHN 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Adudu a-Ayịn Anieghe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 5:16" />Sia Yisọs akenañña mme ñkpọ ami ke Sabad, mbọọñ mme Yuu emaetọọñọ adikọbọ anye. <verse eid="JHN 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 5:17" />Ke adifak idem Yisọs amaabo ammọ ate, <char style="wj">“Ete mmi anam utom afịd-afịd ini, ami ñko nsʌk nnam utom.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 5:18" />Ntak ami akenam nọ mme Yuu enekke eyem adiwot anye sia anye ikiyʌkkọke ke adibiat Sabad ikpọọñ, ado amaakoot Abasi Ete amọ, anịm idem amọ ñka-ñka ye Abasi.<verse eid="JHN 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 5:19" />Yisọs amaabọọrọ ate, <char style="wj">“Ke ataa akpanikọ ami ntañ inọọ ndufo, Ayịn ikemeke inam ñkpọ ndomokeed ke idem amọ; ukweeñe se anye akeme inam ado se anye akịt naña Ete amọ anam, sia ñkpọ keed akeedodo e-Ete anamma, kpa ado ke Ayịn anam.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 5:20" /><char style="wj">Sia Ete a-ama Ayịn, anyʌñ awọt anye afịd ñkpọ se anye anam ke idem amọ, ayaanyʌñ awọt anye kpa mme ñkpọ se ikpoon ikan mbon ami, mme utom e-ediikpa ndufo idem.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 5:21" /><char style="wj">Ke ntom, kpa naña Ete anam mme akpañkpa eset anyʌñ anọ ammọ uwem, kpa ntoro ke Ayịn anọ awo akeedodo anye amekke uwem.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 5:22" /><char style="wj">Ke akanna ado, Ete ibiereke ikpe awo ndomokeed. Ado anye akappa afịd ubiideikpe anọ Ayịn amọ,</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 5:23" /><char style="wj">nọ afịd awo ekpono Ayịn naña ammọ ekpono Ete. Awo akeedodo i-idiikponoke Ayịn ikponoke Ete a-akedọññọ anye.</char><verse eid="JHN 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 5:24" />
    <char style="wj">“Ke ataa akpanikọ ami ntañ inọ ndufo, awo keed akeedodo a-akpañña utọñ anọ ikọ mmi anyʌñ anịm awo a-akendọññọ ke akpanikọ a-anie nsi-nsi uwem ndin awo idiinyʌññọ ibiom anye ikpe, ado anye awuọ ke ñkpa adʌk uwem.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 5:25" /><char style="wj">Ke ataa akpanikọ ami ntañ inọ ndufo, ini asʌk adi, ke aditʌm ntañ a-adedi, a-mme akpañkpa ediikop uyio Ayịn Abasi ndin afịd awo se ikop uyio amọ eyaedu uwem.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 5:26" /><char style="wj">Sia kpa naña Ete anie uwem ke idem amọ, anye ñko a-anọ Ayịn ukeme adinie uwem ke idem amọ.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 5:27" /><char style="wj">Ñko anye a-anọ ayịn adudu adibiide ikpe, sia anye ado Ayịn Awo.</char><verse eid="JHN 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 5:28" />
    <char style="wj">“Ikiiyak ñkpọ ami ikpa ndufo idem, sia ini asʌk adi a-afịd mme akpañkpa ediikop uyio amọ ke udi ammọ,</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 5:29" /><char style="wj">enyʌñ ewuọñọ edi. Mbon e-ekenaññake nti ñkpọ eyaeset edu uwem, ado mbon e-ekenaññake ndiọiñkpọ eyaeset edʌk ke ubiomikpe.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 5:30" /><char style="wj">Ami ñkemeke adinam ñkpọ ndomokeed ke idem mmi; ami mbiere ikpe ñkeene se ami ñkop, ndin ubiideikpe mmi ado unen, sia ami ñyemme adinem idem mmi esịd ado ñyem adinem anye a-akendọññọ miin esịd.</char><verse eid="JHN 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mme Ikọ Ntiense a-Abañake Yisọs</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 5:31" />
    <char style="wj">“Adieke ami ntieghe ntiense mbaña idem mmi, ntiense mmi idooho akpanikọ.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 5:32" /><char style="wj">Ado aba awo mfen a-anọọhọ ikọ ntiense ambaña miin, ndin ami mmediọọñọ ke ntiense amọ ado akpanikọ.</char><verse eid="JHN 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 5:33" />
    <char style="wj">“Ndufo emaedọñ mme isʌñutom ebịne Yọọn ndin anye amaatie ntiense anọ akpanikọ.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 5:34" /><char style="wj">Idooho nte ke ami mmenyịmme ntiense awo, ado ntañ ami nọ ndufo ebọ adinyaaña.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 5:35" /><char style="wj">Yọọn akedo utuenikañ a-akesakka anyʌñ anọ unwana, ndin ndufo emaemek edikop inem ikañ a-anye akenọọhọ ke etək ini.</char><verse eid="JHN 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 5:36" />
    <char style="wj">“Ado ntiense mmi a-akpon akan ake Yọọn. Sia kpa mme utom e-Ete annọọhọ miin abo nnam mma, a-adooho ammọ ke nsʌk nnam, edo ntiense a-awọttọ ke Ete akendọñ miin.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 5:37" /><char style="wj">Ñko, Ete a-akendọññọ miin amaatie ntiense ke idem amọ ambaña miin. Akenaanam ndufo ikoppo uyio amọ, inyʌññọ ikịt naña anye aba,</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 5:38" /><char style="wj">ikọ amọ inyʌññọ idʌñ ke esịd ndufo, sia ndufo inịmme anye a-anye akedọññọ ke akpanikọ.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 5:39" /><char style="wj">Ndufo etọọtʌm ekpeep ikọ Abasi, sia ndufo ekere ke iminie nsi-nsi uwem ito ikọ Abasi. Kpa mme ikọ Abasi ami etie ntiense embaña miin,</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 5:40" /><char style="wj">kpayeado ndufo emesịn adimbịne miin nọ enie uwem.</char><verse eid="JHN 5:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 5:41" />
    <char style="wj">“Ami ñyemme itooro nto awo,</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 5:42" /><char style="wj">ado ami mmidiọọñọ ndufo. Ami mmediọọñọ ke ndufo inieghe ima Abasi ke esịd ndufo.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 5:43" /><char style="wj">Ami mmedi ke anyịñ Ete mmi, ado ndufo iñnyịmmeke miin. Ado awo mfen akpedi ke anyịñ idem amọ, ndufo eyaenyịmme anye ado.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 5:44" /><char style="wj">Ndufo ekeme die edinịm ke akpanikọ ke ini ndufo edubọiyọke itooro eto emọ-emọ, ado inamma ñkpọ edibọ itooro a-atooho ukweeñe-ukweeñe Abasi?</char><verse eid="JHN 5:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 5:45" />
    <char style="wj">“Ado ikiikere ke ami ñyaidot ndufo uyio ke iso Ete. Andidot ndufo uyio ado Moses, adooho awo a-ndufo edotto anyen.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 5:46" /><char style="wj">Adieke ndufo ekenịmme Moses ke akpanikọ, ekpaennịm miin ñko ke akpanikọ sia anye amaawet ambaña miin.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 5:47" /><char style="wj">Ado sia ndufo miinịmme se anye akewet ke akpanikọ, ediinam die inịm se ami ntañ?”</char><verse eid="JHN 5:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JHN 6" />
  <para style="s1">Yisọs Anọ Awo Tọsịn Ition Ndidia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 6:1" />Etək ini amaakeboiyo, Yisọs amaaboiyo akaa mben Akpainyañ Kalili, edem inyañ uko, a-adooho Akpainyañ Taiberia. <verse eid="JHN 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 6:2" />Ekamba atu awo emaekeene anye sia ammọ emaekịt mme idiọọñọ a-anye akenamma ke adikọk mbon udọñọ. <verse eid="JHN 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 6:3" />Ndin Yisọs amaadọọk abod aketie ye mbed amọ. <verse eid="JHN 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 6:4" />Usọrọ Nsaña Mboiyo mme Yuu amaakpere.<verse eid="JHN 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 6:5" />Yisọs akedịppe anyen akịt ekamba atu awo nana edi ebịne anye, anye amaabo Filib, <char style="wj">“Ke mmọọ ke ñnyịn idiidep ndidia inọ ibon ami nọ edia?”</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 6:6" />Anye akebịp ami adidomo anye nse, sia anye amaanenie ke akikere amọ se anye akeyem adinam.<verse eid="JHN 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 6:7" />Filib amaabọọrọ anye ate, “Akʌk utom afiọñ itiokeed<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke usem Greek ado </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">denari 200</char></note> ikpikanna idep ndidia nọ akem awo keedekeed se adia etək-etək.”<verse eid="JHN 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 6:8" />Mbed amọ keed mfen, Andru, ayịneka Saimọn Pita, amaasio uyio abo, <verse eid="JHN 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 6:9" />“Se etək akparawa mi ye ntək uyo baali ition ye iyak iba. Ado ami adiikem awo ifañ ke utọ se ewak ami?”<verse eid="JHN 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 6:10" />Yisọs amaabo ammọ, <char style="wj">“Nam mme awo esuuk etie.”</char> Mbid amaaba ke itie ado, ndin ammọ emaesuuk etie (ndin ideen se ikiba ke ndo ekedo ñkpọ nte tọsịn ition.) <verse eid="JHN 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 6:11" />Yisọs ndin amaaben uyo ition ado anọ ekọọm anyʌñ adeeme anọ mbon e-eketieghe do. Ndin ammọ emaeta naña ammọ ekeyeyem. Amaanyʌñ anam ukem ado ye iyak.<verse eid="JHN 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 6:12" />Ke afịd ammọ emaekedia eyʌkkọ, anye amaabo mbed amọ ate, <char style="wj">“Ikoono mme mbeñe se iyọhọ isʌhọ. Ikiibaha ñkpọ ndomokeed.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 6:13" />Ammọ emaekoono se ikiyọhọ isʌhọ ito uyo baali ition a-mme awo eketaaha eyọhọ akpasa duob mme iba.<verse eid="JHN 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 6:14" />Ke mme awo emaekekịt mme idiọọñọ a-Yisọs akenamma, ammọ emaetọọñọ adibo, “Ke akpanikọ awo ami ado Prọfed a-anaaha nte adi ke ederimbod.” <verse eid="JHN 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 6:15" />Sia Yisọs amaakedidiọọñọ ke ammọ ekeyem adinam anye adidem ke amaaha ye imiimaaha, anye amaadakka akaa ekamba abod akeba do ke idem amọ ikpọọñ.<verse eid="JHN 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisọs Asaña ke Anyọñ Mmọọñ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 6:16" />Akekem ndubiayio, mme mbed amọ emaesọiyọ ekaa ibiok, ndin <verse eid="JHN 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 6:17" />ammọ emaedʌk ubom eboiyo ekaa Kapanum. Ayio amaakịm, ndin Yisọs ikibịneke ammọ diin. <verse eid="JHN 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 6:18" />Ekamba ayobio akesʌk afịme, ndin mmọọñ amaatọọñọ adibəkko. <verse eid="JHN 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 6:19" />Ke ammọ emaekewat ubom ke ñkpọ nte itiad ita me inaañ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte kilomita 5 me 6</char></note>, ammọ emaekịt naña Yisọs asaña ke anyọñ mmọọñ abịne ubom, ndin idem amaanyeñ ammọ ataa eti-eti. <verse eid="JHN 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 6:20" />Ado anye amaabo ammọ, <char style="wj">“Ami ke ado; ikiifeghe ndịk.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 6:21" />Ndin ammọ emaenyịmme adiben anye nsịn ke ubom, ndin ikikpeenekekpeene ubom amaakewuọ esʌk mbeghe a-ammọ ekekaaha.<verse eid="JHN 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 6:22" />Ke edem usen mme atu awo e-eketieghe ke edem ibiok uko emaedidiọọñọ ke ubom keed akeba do, ndin ke Yisọs ikidʌkkọ ubom ye mme mbed amọ, ado ke ammọ ekedakka sʌk ammọ-ammọ. <verse eid="JHN 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 6:23" />Ndin usʌk ubom e-eketooho Taiberia emaekebeghe ekpere itie a-mme awo eketaaha uyo ke Abọọñ amaakenọ ekọọm. <verse eid="JHN 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 6:24" />Ke mme awo emaekediọọñọ ke Yisọs ikibaaha do, mme mbed amọ ñko ikinyʌññọ iba do, ammọ emaedọñọ ubom edaaña Kapanum adikiyem Yisọs.<verse eid="JHN 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisọs Ado Uyo Uwem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 6:25" />Ke ini ammọ emaekekịt anye ke edem ibiok uko, ammọ emaebịp anye, “Andikpeeb, afo akediwuọ umi idaha akee?”<verse eid="JHN 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 6:26" />Yisọs amaabọọrọ ammọ: <char style="wj">“Ke ataa akpanikọ ami ntañ inọ ndufo, ndufo eñyem miin, idooho sia ndufo emaekịt mme idiọọñọ a-ami ñkenamma, ado sia ndufo emaeta uyo enyʌñ ekop uyʌkkọ.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 6:27" /><char style="wj">Ndufo ikiinam utom inọọ ndidia a-adooho ayaabiara, ado inam inọ ndidia a-adiidat ikisịm nsi-nsi uwem, a-Ayịn Awo adiinọ ndufo ke idem amọ. Sia Abasi Ete ke idem amọ amaawuuk idiọọñọ ke imọ imimek anye.”</char><verse eid="JHN 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 6:28" />Ndin ammọ emaebịp anye, “Nsoo ke ana ñnyịn inam nọ inam utom a-Abasi ayemme?”<verse eid="JHN 6:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 6:29" />Yisọs amaabo ammọ, <char style="wj">“Utom Abasi ado ami: Adinịm anye a-anye akedọññọ ke akpanikọ.”</char><verse eid="JHN 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 6:30" />Ñko ammọ emaebịp anye ebo, “Nsoo idiọọñọ ke afo uduunọ ñnyịn nọ ñnyịn ikịt inyʌñ unịm fiin ke akpanikọ? Nsoo ke afo uduunam? <verse eid="JHN 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 6:31" />Mme eteete ñnyịn emaeta mana ke anaan, naña ekewet ete: ‘Anye amaanọ ammọ uyo a-atooho hefịn eta.’ ”<verse eid="JHN 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 6:32" />Yisọs amaabo ammọ ate, <char style="wj">“Ke ataa akpanikọ ami ntañ inọ ndufo, idooho Moses akinọọ ndufo uyo atooho hefịn, ado Ete mmi anọ ataa uyo a-atooho hefịn.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 6:33" /><char style="wj">Sia uyo Abasi ado uyo a-atooho hefịn adi anyʌñ anọ ederimbod uwem.</char>”<verse eid="JHN 6:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 6:34" />Ammọ emaebo “Ete, kaa iso inọ ñnyịn uyo ami afịd ini.”<verse eid="JHN 6:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 6:35" />Ndin Yisọs amaasọọñọ abo ammọ ate, <char style="wj">“Ami ndo uyo uwem. Abiọọñ idiidọññọ awo ndomokeed a-adiighe ambịne miin. Awo anyʌññọ annịm miin ke akpanikọ idiikoppo nsaditọñ tutu amama.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 6:36" /><char style="wj">Ado naña ami mmaakidọkkọ ndufo, ndufo emeñkịt miin ado isʌkkọ inịm ke akpanikọ.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 6:37" /><char style="wj">Afịd awo se Ete annọ miin eyaedi embịne, ndin ami ndiibịneke awo ndomokeed a-adiighe ambịne miin.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 6:38" /><char style="wj">Sia ami nto hefịn ndi adinam uduak a-Abasi akendọññọ, idooho adinam uduak idem mmi.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 6:39" /><char style="wj">Ndin uduak se anye akendọñ miin ado, ke ami ñyaak awo ndomokeed ke atu mbon a-anye akennọọhọ asop, ado nnam ammọ eset ke akpatre usen.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 6:40" /><char style="wj">Sia uduak Ete mmi ado ke awo akeedodo a-akịtte Ayịn anyʌññọ anịm anye ke akpanikọ ayaanie nsi-nsi uwem, ndin ami ñyaanam anye aset ke akpatre usen.”</char><verse eid="JHN 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 6:41" />Mme Yuu e-ekebaaha do emaetọọñọ edukuunọ ebaña anye sia anye amaabo, <char style="wj">“Ami ndo uyo a-aketooho hefịn asọiyọ adi.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 6:42" />Ammọ emaebo, “Idooho Yisọs ayịn Yosef, a-ñnyịn idiọọñọke ete ye eka amọ ado ami? Die ke anye akeme adibo, <char style="wj">‘Ami ñketo hefịn ndi?’ ”</char><verse eid="JHN 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 6:43" />Yisọs, ke ibọọrọ amaabo ammọ, <char style="wj">“Itre ndukuunọ ke atu idem ndufo.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 6:44" /><char style="wj">Awo ndomokeed ikemeke adiñkeene miin ibọhọke Ete a-akendọññọ miin adʌt anye, ñko ami ñyaanam ammọ eset ke akpatre usen.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 6:45" /><char style="wj">E-ewet ke ñwed mme Prọfed: ‘Abasi adiido andikpeeb afịd ammọ.’ Afịd mbon e-ekoppo ikọ Ete enyʌñ ebọ ukpeebñkpọ eto anye, e-edi embịne miin.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 6:46" /><char style="wj">Kpaanam awo ndomokeed ikịtte Ete ibọhọke anye a-atooho Abasi; anye ikpọọñ akịt Ete.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 6:47" /><char style="wj">Ke ataa akpanikọ ami ntañ inọ ndufo, awo a-anịmme ke akpanikọ anie nsi-nsi uwem.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 6:48" /><char style="wj">Ami ndo uyo uwem.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 6:49" /><char style="wj">Mme eteete ndufo emaeta mana ke anaan ado ekesʌk ekpakpañña.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 6:50" /><char style="wj">Ado anye ami ado uyo a-atooho hefịn asọiyọ adi, a-adooho awo akeedodo akeme adita ndin ikpaaha aba.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 6:51" /><char style="wj">Ami ndo uyo uwem a-aketooho hefịn asọiyọ adi. Awo akeedodo a-ataaha uyo ami ayaadu uwem ke nsi-nsi. Uyo ami ado ikpọkidem mmi, a-ami ndiinọ nọ ederimbod anie uwem.”</char><verse eid="JHN 6:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 6:52" />Ndin mme Yuu emaetọọñọ adifaaña mbiaak-mbiaak ke atu ammọ ete, “Die ke awo ami akeme adinọọ ñnyịn ikpọkidem amọ nọ ita?”<verse eid="JHN 6:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 6:53" />Yisọs amaabọọrọ ammọ: <char style="wj">“Ke ataa akpanikọ ke ami ntañ inọọ ndufo, adieke ndufo imiitaaha ikpọkidem Ayịn Awo inyʌñ inwọñ iyiib amọ, ndufo idiinieghe uwem ke idem ndufo.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 6:54" /><char style="wj">Awo akeedodo a-ataaha ikpọkidem mmi anyʌñ anwọñ iyiib mmi a-anie uwem nsi-nsi, ndin ami ñyaanam anye aset ke akpatre usen.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 6:55" /><char style="wj">Sia ikpọkidem mmi ado ataa ndidia, iyiib mmi anyʌñ ado ataa adinwọñ ñkpọ.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 6:56" /><char style="wj">Awo akeedodo a-ataaha ikpọkidem mmi anyʌñ anwọñ iyiib mmi a-aba ye ami, ami ñko ñnyʌñ mba ye anye.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 6:57" /><char style="wj">Kpa naña Ete andidu uwem akendọñ miin ndin ami ñnyʌñ ndu uwem nto Ete, kpa ntoro ke awo akeedodo a-ntaaha miin adiidu uwem ke ntak mmi.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 6:58" /><char style="wj">Anye ami ado uyo a-aketooho hefịn asọiyọ adi. Mme eteete ndufo emaeta mana enyʌñ ekpañña, ado awo a-ataaha uyo ami ayaadu uwem ke nsi-nsi.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 6:59" />Yisọs aketañ mme ikọ ami ke idaha a-anye akekpeebe ñkpọ ke sinakọk ke Kapanum.<verse eid="JHN 6:59" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Uwak mme Mbed Ekpọñ Yisọs</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="JHN 6:60" />Ke emaekekop mme ikọ ami ema, uwak mme mbed se ikikeene anye emaebo, “Ukpeebñkpọ anye ami a-asọñ eti-eti. Die ke awo ndomokeed akan anyịmme utọ ukpeebñkpọ ami?”<verse eid="JHN 6:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="JHN 6:61" />Sia Yisọs amaakediọọñọ ke mme mbed amọ ekesʌk edukuunọ, anye amaabịp ammọ, <char style="wj">“Nte ukpeebñkpọ ami iyat ndufo esịd?</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JHN 6:62" /><char style="wj">Nsoo ke ekpenam adieke ndufo ekpekịtte Ayịn Awo naña adọọk aka itie a-anye akebaaha akpa!</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="JHN 6:63" /><char style="wj">Sịbidịd anọ uwem; abʌkidem idooho ñkpọ ndomokeed. Mme ikọ se ami ntañ inọọ ndufo eyọhọ ye Sịbidịd ye uwem.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="JHN 6:64" /><char style="wj">Kpayeado aba mme awo ke atu ndufo i-imiinịmme.”</char> Sia Yisọs amaadọdiọọñọ tọọñọ ke aditọọñọ awo i-imiikinịmme ye awo adiinyʌñ itap anye. <verse eid="JHN 6:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="JHN 6:65" />Anye amaakaa iso atañ, <char style="wj">“Ntak ado ke ami ñkibo ndufo ke awo ndomokeed ikemeke adidi imbịne miin ibọhọke Ete anọ anye ukeme.”</char><verse eid="JHN 6:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="JHN 6:66" />Ke ami amaakeboiyo, uwak mme mbed amọ emaedaaña enyọñọ, ikeeneke anye aba.<verse eid="JHN 6:66" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="JHN 6:67" />Ndin Yisọs amaabịp mme mbed duob mme iba ate, <char style="wj">“Ndufo-o? Emeyem edinyọñọ ñko?”</char><verse eid="JHN 6:67" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="JHN 6:68" />Saimọn Pita amaabọọrọ, “Abọọñ, anie ke ñnyịn idiibịne? Afo anie ikọ uwem nsi-nsi. <verse eid="JHN 6:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="JHN 6:69" />Ñnyịn imidinịm ke akpanikọ inyʌñ ididiọọñọ ke afo ado Adisana Awo a-atooho Abasi.”<verse eid="JHN 6:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="JHN 6:70" />Yisọs amaabọọrọ ate, <char style="wj">“Nte ami ñkimekke ndufo awo duob mme iba? Ado keed ke atu ndufo ado andidiọọk!”</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="JHN 6:71" />(Anye aketañ ami abaña Yudas, ayịn Saimọn Iskariọd, sia akpesʌkado a-anye akedooho keed ke atu mme mbed duob mme iba, anye akeditap Yisọs ke ini iso.)<verse eid="JHN 6:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JHN 7" />
  <para style="s1">Yisọs Akaa Usọrọ Tabanakịd</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 7:1" />Ke ami amaakeboiyo, Yisọs amaanam isañ akanna Kalili. Anye ikiyemme isaaña ke Yudia, sia mme adaidaha ke atu mme Yuu ekeyeeyem adiwot anye. <verse eid="JHN 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 7:2" />Nte Usọrọ Tabanakịd mme Yuu akekpereke, <verse eid="JHN 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 7:3" />nditọeka Yisọs ideen emaebo anye ate, “Kpọñ Kalili nyʌñ kaa Yudia, nọ mme mbed mfo e-ebaññake ke udo enyʌñ ekekịt mme utom a-afo anamma. <verse eid="JHN 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 7:4" />Awo ndomokeed a-ayemme adido awuọiso awo inamma ñkpọ ke ndịbe. Sia afo anamma mme ñkpọ ami, akpena afo ayaara idem mfo anọ afịd ederimbod!” <verse eid="JHN 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 7:5" />Sia idem nditọeka amọ ikinịmme anye ke akpanikọ.<verse eid="JHN 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 7:6" />Yisọs amaabọọrọ ate, <char style="wj">“Ini mmi idiwuọhọ diin, ado amaado ndufo, ini akeedodo ado eti ini inọ ndufo.</char> <verse eid="JHN 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 7:7" /><char style="wj">Ederimbod ikemeke adisua ndufo, ado e-ensua miin, sia mmenọ ikọ ntiense mbo ke usʌñ ammọ inenne.</char> <verse eid="JHN 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 7:8" /><char style="wj">Ndufo iboiyo ikaa usọrọ ke idem ndufo. Ami ndiikaaha usọrọ, sia ini mmi ikemme diin ayọhọ-ayọhọ.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 7:9" />Ke anye amaaketañ ami ama, anye amaatịmme atie ke Kalili.<verse eid="JHN 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 7:10" />Ado ke nditọeka amọ ideen emaekedaaña usọrọ, anye ñko amaadidedịbe akaa, iyakka awo adiọọñọ. <verse eid="JHN 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 7:11" />Ke itie usọrọ ado mme adaidaha ke atu mme Yuu emaeyem anye, enyʌñ ebịp ete, “Anye awo ado-o?”<verse eid="JHN 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 7:12" />Emaetañ uwak ikọ ebaña anye eti-eti ke atu awo. Ubaak awo emaebo, “Anye ado eti awo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 7:12">Ubaak emaebo, “Iyoo, anye ababiaña mme awo.” <verse eid="JHN 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 7:13" />Ado awo ndomokeed ikitañña ikọ ibaña anye anwa-anwa, mbaak mme ikpọawo mme Yuu.<verse eid="JHN 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisọs Akpeep Ñkpọ ke Itie Usọrọ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 7:14" />Akedo enanam usọrọ esịm mbakka iba ke Yisọs akewuọ aka aketọọñọ adikpeep ñkpọ ke afe tembịd. <verse eid="JHN 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 7:15" />Idem amaakpa mme Yuu, anam ammọ emaebịp ete, “Awo ami akenam die anie utọ ifiọk ami ke ini anye imiikibọọhọ ukpeebñkpọ?”<verse eid="JHN 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 7:16" />Yisọs amaabọọrọ ammọ ate: <char style="wj">“Ukpeebñkpọ mmi intooho miin. Ato anye a-akendọññọ.</char> <verse eid="JHN 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 7:17" /><char style="wj">Awo akeedodo a-abeeñeke idem adinam uduak Abasi ayaadiọọñọ me ukpeebñkpọ mmi ato Abasi, me ami ntañ ikọ idem mmi.</char> <verse eid="JHN 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 7:18" /><char style="wj">Awo amaatañ ikọ idem amọ, ayem ukpono anọ idem amọ, ado anye a-ayemme ukpono anọ awo a-akedọññọ anye, anye ado awo akpanikọ; inyʌññọ inie abiaña ndomokeed.</char> <verse eid="JHN 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 7:19" /><char style="wj">Nte Moses ikinọọhọ ndufo mbed? Ado ndufo ndomokeed inịmme mbed ado! Ntak a-ndufo eyemme usʌñ adiñwot miin-e?”</char><verse eid="JHN 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 7:20" />Atu awo emaebọọrọ, “Afo amenie dimọn ke idem! Anie awo iyem aduwot fiin?”<verse eid="JHN 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 7:21" />Yisọs amaabo ammọ ate, <char style="wj">“Utịppeñkpọ keed ke ami ñkenam ndin afịd ndufo eba ke ñkpaidem.</char> <verse eid="JHN 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 7:22" /><char style="wj">Ado sia Moses amaakenyịmme ufọọrọ edʌd inọ ndufo (akpesʌkado idooho nte ke ufọọrọ edʌd aketo Moses, ado aketo mme nsọbom), ndufo efọọrọ ayịn edʌd ke Sabad.</char> <verse eid="JHN 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 7:23" /><char style="wj">Adieke ekemeke adifọọrọ ayịn awodeen edʌd ke Sabad mbaak awo adibiat mbed Moses, ntak a-ndufo eyatta esịd ye ami naña nnam nọ idem asọñ awo ke Sabad-a?</char> <verse eid="JHN 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 7:24" /><char style="wj">Ndufo ikiibiere ikpe ikeene se ekịt ke anyen, ado ikpe nnen-nnen ikpe.”</char><verse eid="JHN 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ubakka ke Atu mme Awo ke Ntak Yisọs</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 7:25" />Ke ini ado, usʌk mbon Yeruselem emaebịp ebo, “Idooho awo ammọ e-eyemme adiwot ado ami? <verse eid="JHN 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 7:26" />Ñkọ anye ado ami, asʌk atañ ikọ anwa-anwa, ndin awo inieghe kpak se etañ me enam anye! Nte ado akpanikọ ke ukara ebiere ebo ke anye ado Krais? <verse eid="JHN 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 7:27" />Ado afịd ñnyịn imidiọọñọ nte anye ato, ado Krais amaadi, awo ndomokeed idiidiọọñọke nte anye ato.”<verse eid="JHN 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 7:28" />Ndin ke ini Yisọs akesʌkkọ akpeep ñkpọ ke afe tembịd, anye amaabọñ ke akpọsọñ uyio ate: <char style="wj">“Ii, emendiọọñọ miin, emenyʌñ ediọọñọ nte nto, ado ami mbaaha mi ke adudu idem mmi; anye a-akendọññọ miin ado akpanikọ. Ndufo idiọọñọke anye,</char> <verse eid="JHN 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 7:29" /><char style="wj">ado ami mmediọọñọ anye sia nto ke anye ndi, ñko anye akendọñ miin.”</char><verse eid="JHN 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 7:30" />Ammọ emaeyem adimʌm anye idahado, ado sia ini amọ imiikikemme, awo ndomokeed ikituuhọ anye. <verse eid="JHN 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 7:31" />Kpayeado, uwak mme awo e-ekebaaha emaenịm anye ke akpanikọ. Ammọ emaebo ete, “Krais amaadi, anye ayaanam idiọọñọ awak akan se awo ami anam?”<verse eid="JHN 7:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 7:32" />Ke ini mme Farisi emaekekop ke mme atu awo ekesʌk esuan utọ ikọ ami ebaña anye, mme ñkpoon aku ye mme Farisi emaedọñ mme akpeme tembịd ete ekemʌm anye.<verse eid="JHN 7:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 7:33" />Ndin Yisọs amaabo: <char style="wj">“Ami ndiiba ye ndufo ke etək-etək ini, ndin ñyaatịmme mbịne anye a-akendọññọ miin.</char> <verse eid="JHN 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 7:34" /><char style="wj">Ndufo eyaeñyem miin ado idiiñkịtte; ndin itie nte ami mba, ndufo idiikanna idi.”</char><verse eid="JHN 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 7:35" />Anam mme Yuu emaebịp idem ammọ ete, “Ete ami aduak adika uke nọ ñnyịn imiidikanna ikịt anye? Me anye aduak ika mbịne mbon ñnyịn e-emaekesuana ekedʌñ ke atu mbon Greek inyʌñ ikpeep mbon Greek ñkpọ? <verse eid="JHN 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 7:36" />Nsoo ke awuọñọ ke anye adibo, <char style="wj">‘Ndufo eyaeñyem miin ado ndufo idiiñkịtte miin,’ ye ‘Itie nte ami mba ndufo idiikanna idi’?”</char><verse eid="JHN 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 7:37" />Ke akpatre ñkpon ñkan usen usọrọ, Yisọs amaawuọ ada anyʌñ atañ ke akpọsọñ uyio ate: <char style="wj">“Adieke itọñ asatta awo, yak anye adi ambịne miin adinwọñ mmọọñ!</char> <verse eid="JHN 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 7:38" /><char style="wj">Awo akeedodo annịmme miin ke akpanikọ, nte ikọ Ñwed Abasi amaatatañ, idịm mmọọñ uwem ayaasakka ato idem amọ.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 7:39" />Anye aketañ ami abaña Sịbidịd a-mbon e-ekenịmme anye ke akpanikọ ekenaaha nte ebọ. Sia tutu akewuọ idahado awo ikinọọhọ awo ndomokeed Sịbidịd diin, ke ntak a-Yisọs imiikidʌkkọ ubọọñ amọ diin.<verse eid="JHN 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 7:40" />Usʌk mbon e-ekekpañña utọñ ekop se anye aketañ emaebo, “Ke akpanikọ awo ami ado Prọfed.”<verse eid="JHN 7:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 7:41" />Ado usʌk awo emaebo, “Anye ado Krais.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 7:41">Kpayeado ubaak awo emaebịp, “Krais akpenam die ato Kalili? <verse eid="JHN 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 7:42" />Nte Ñwed Abasi ibooho ke Krais adiito ubon Defid anyʌñ ato abio Betlehem, idʌñ a-Defid akedʌññọ?” <verse eid="JHN 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 7:43" />Ke ntoro, mme awo emaebakka edudak ke ntak amọ. <verse eid="JHN 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 7:44" />Usʌk awo emaeyem adimʌm anye, ado awo ndomokeed ikituuhọ anye.<verse eid="JHN 7:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Unana Mbuọdidem mme Adadusʌñ mme Yuu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 7:45" />Ke akpatre mme akpeme tembịd emaetịmme ebịne mme ñkpoon aku ye mme Farisi e-ekebịppe ammọ ebo, “Ntak a-ndufo imiikimʌmmọ anye idi-e?”<verse eid="JHN 7:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 7:46" />Mme akpeme tembịd emaebọọrọ ete, “Akenaanam awo ndomokeed itañña ikọ ke utọ usʌñ e-ete ami atañña.”<verse eid="JHN 7:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 7:47" />Mme Farisi emaebọọrọ ete, “Awuọ anye anyʌñ itịn ndufo usʌñ ñko? <verse eid="JHN 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 7:48" />Aba awo ke atu ukara mme Farisi a-anịmme anye ke akpanikọ? <verse eid="JHN 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 7:49" />Iyoo! Sʌk ntʌn atu awo ami imiidiọọñọke ñkpọ ndomokeed ibaña mbed, adooho isuuñọ asịm ammọ.”<verse eid="JHN 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 7:50" />Nikodemọs, a-amaakedaadak aka abịne Yisọs, a-akenyʌññọ ado keed ke atu ammọ amaabịp ammọ ate, <verse eid="JHN 7:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 7:51" />“Nte mbed ñnyịn a-abiomo awo ikpe ke ini imiibemme iso ikpañ utọñ inọ awo ado, inyʌñ idiọọñọ se anye anam?”<verse eid="JHN 7:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 7:52" />Ammọ emaebọọrọ ete, “Afo ñko ado awo Kalili? Duuñọ ñkpọ ami ke idem mfo se ndin afo ayaakịt ke prọfed isitooho Kalili.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:52 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mme uwak ñwed emaekememịñ ye mme ntiense esed inieghe mme ufañ usʌkkeed tutu asịm edịb <char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 7:53-8:11">Yọọn 7:53–8:11</ref></char>.</char></note><verse eid="JHN 7:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 7:53" />Akem afịd ammọ emaedaaña enyọñọ.<verse eid="JHN 7:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JHN 8" />
  <para style="s1">Yisọs Atua Awonwaan Asịn Efịbe Mbọm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 8:1" />Ado Yisọs amaadakka akaa abod Ọlif.<verse eid="JHN 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 8:2" />Ke usiere, anye amaatịmme akaa afe tembịd. Afịd awo emaekanna anye ekʌk, ndin anye amaasuuk atie anyʌñ atọọñọ adikpeep ammọ ñkpọ. <verse eid="JHN 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 8:3" />Mme andikpeeb mbed ye mme Farisi emaeben awonwaan keed edi e-ekemʌmmọ naña asịn efịbe. Ammọ emaenam anye adada ke iso ammọ, <verse eid="JHN 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 8:4" />enyʌñ ebo Yisọs, “Andikpeeb, ekemʌm mma ami naña asịn efịbe. <verse eid="JHN 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 8:5" />Ke ñwed Mbed, Moses amaanọ ewʌhọ ate yak ñnyịn itọọñ utọ ibaan ado ke itiad. Ndin afo abo die?” <verse eid="JHN 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 8:6" />Ammọ ekebịp ami adidomo anye nse me ayaaba se ammọ ediidat idot anye uyio.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:6">Ado Yisọs amaanʌhọ akama nnuun ubọk amọ atọọñọ adiwet ñkpọ ke isọñ. <verse eid="JHN 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 8:7" />Sia ammọ ekesʌkkọ eyiire ebịp anye mbuume ami, anye amaanekke ada anyʌñ abo, <char style="wj">“Yak awo keed ke atu ndufo imiinamma idiọọkñkpọ kpaanam ato aben itiad atọ mma ami.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 8:8" />Akema anye amaamaana anʌhọ akaiso awet ñkpọ ke isọñ.<verse eid="JHN 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 8:9" />Ke ammọ emaekekop ami ammọ emaedaaña keedekeed, tọọñọ ke ñkpoon awo tutu asịm akpatre, adisʌhọ Yisọs ikpọọñ ye mma ado akesʌkkọ ada ke nte anye akeda. <verse eid="JHN 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 8:10" />Ndin Yisọs amaamaana adakka ada anyʌñ abo anye, <char style="wj">“Awonwaan, ammọ eba mọọ? Ibaaha awo ndomokeed u-ubiommo fiin ikpe?”</char><verse eid="JHN 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 8:11" />Anye amaabọọrọ ate, <char style="it">“Awo ibaaha, Ete.”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:11">Yisọs amaabo anye, <char style="it"><char style="wj">“Ami ñko ubiommo fiin ikpe. Nyọñ idahami, nyʌñ kpọñ uwem idiọọkñkpọ mfo.”</char></char><verse eid="JHN 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mfaaña ke Abaña Ikọ Ntiense Yisọs</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 8:12" />Ke ini Yisọs akemaanake atañ ikọ anọ mme awo, anye amaabo: <char style="wj">“Ami ndo unwana ederimbod. Awo akeedodo añkeeneke miin idiisañake ke ekịm, ado ayaanie unwana uwem”</char><verse eid="JHN 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 8:13" />Mme Farisi ekekop ami, ammọ emaebo anye, “Afo atie ntiense anọ idem mfo, ikọ ntiense mfo isọọñọke ida.”<verse eid="JHN 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 8:14" />Yisọs amaabọọrọ ammọ, <char style="wj">“Akpekọm ami ñkpetie ntiense mbaña idem mmi, ikọ ntiense mmi ado akpanikọ, sia ami mmediọọñọ nte ami ñketo ndi ye itie nte ami ñka. Ado ndufo inieghe ifiọk ibaña itie nte ami nto ndi me itie nte ami ñka.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 8:15" /><char style="wj">Ndufo ebiere ikpe ekeene ubonoñkpọ awo; ami mbiereke ikpe nnọ awo ndomokeed.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 8:16" /><char style="wj">Ado adieke ami ñkpeeghe ikpe, mme ubiideikpe mmi edo akpanikọ, sia ami ndaaha ikpọọñ. Ami nda ye Ete, a-akendọññọ miin.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 8:17" /><char style="wj">Ke Mbed ndufo e-ewet ke ikọ ntiense awo iba ado akpanikọ.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 8:18" /><char style="wj">Ami nnọ ntiense mbaña idem mmi, ado Ete a-akendọññọ miin atie ntiense ambaña miin ñko.”</char><verse eid="JHN 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 8:19" />Ndin ammọ emaebịp anye ete, “Ete mfo aba ke uke?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:19">Yisọs amaabọọrọ, <char style="wj">“Ndufo indiọọñọke miin, inyʌññọ idiọọñọ Ete mmi, adieke ekpekendiọọñọke miin, ekpaekediọọñọ Ete mmi ñko.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 8:20" />Yisọs aketañ ikọ ami ke ini anye akekpeebe ñkpọ ke mme afe tembịd ke ñkpere itie unịm akʌk. Ado awo ndomokeed ikimʌmmọ anye, sia ini amọ ikikemme diin.<verse eid="JHN 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mfaaña me Yisọs Ado Anie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 8:21" />Anye amaamaana abo ammọ: <char style="wj">“Ami ñyaanyọñ, ndufo eyaeñyem miin, ndin ndufo eyaenyʌñ ekpañña ke idiọọkñkpọ ndufo. Itie nte ami ñka ndufo idiikanna idi.”</char><verse eid="JHN 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 8:22" />Ndin mme Yuu emaebiime idem ammọ ete, “Me anye ayaakewot idem amọ nọ anye abo, <char style="wj">‘Itie nte ami ñka, ndufo idiikanna idi?’ ”</char><verse eid="JHN 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 8:23" />Yisọs amaakaa iso atañ: <char style="wj">“Ndufo eto isọñ, ami nto anyọñ. Ndufo edoñño ake ederimbod ami, ami ndooho ake ederimbod.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 8:24" /><char style="wj">Ami mmidọdọkkọ ndufo, eyaekpañña ke idiọọkñkpọ ndufo; ii, adieke ndufo miinịmme ke akpanikọ ke ami ndo anye, ndufo eyaekpañña ke idiọọkñkpọ ndufo.”</char><verse eid="JHN 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 8:25" />Do ndin ammọ emaebịp anye ete, “Afo ado anie?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:25">Yisọs amaabọọrọ ammọ ate: <char style="wj">“Kpa se ami ñkesidọkkọ ndufo tọọñọ ke aditọọñọ.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 8:26" /><char style="wj">Ami mmenie uwak ñkpọ aditañ ke ubiideikpe ibaña ndufo. Ado anye a-akendọññọ miin nọ ndi ado anam akpanikọ, ndin se ami ñkop nto anye ado se ami ntañ nnọ ederimbod.”</char><verse eid="JHN 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 8:27" />Ikinwañake ammọ ke anye akidọkkọ mmimọ abaña Abasi, Ete amọ. <verse eid="JHN 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 8:28" />Ndin Yisọs amaabo ammọ: <char style="wj">“Ndufo imaibenne Ayịn Awo ke anyọñ, ndufo eyaediọọñọ ke ami ndo awo ado, ñko ke ami nnamma ñkpọ ndomokeed ke adudu idem mmi, ado ntañ se Ete akeñkpeep miin.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 8:29" /><char style="wj">Anye a-akendọññọ ndi mmọdo ye ami, anye inyʌññọ insaana miin iyaak ikpọọñ, sia afịd ini ami nsinam se inem anye esịd.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 8:30" />Naña anye akesʌkkọ atañ ikọ ami, uwak awo emaenịm anye ke akpanikọ.<verse eid="JHN 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mfaaña ke Abaña Nditọ Ebraham</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 8:31" />Yisọs amaabo mme Yuu e-ekenịmme anye ke akpanikọ ate: <char style="wj">“Adieke ndufo emʌmmọ ikọ mmi ekama nọ idʌñ ndufo ke idem, ke akpanikọ ndufo edo mme mbed mmi.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 8:32" /><char style="wj">Ndufo eyaediọọñọ akpanikọ, ndin akpanikọ ayaanam ndufo ebọkkọ.”</char><verse eid="JHN 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 8:33" />Ammọ emaebọọrọ anye ete, “Ñnyịn ito ubon Ebraham ñko tọọñọ akenaanam ñnyịn idoññoke ifʌn inọ awo ndomokeed, awuọñọ die afo adibo, eyaenam ndufo ebọkkọ?”<verse eid="JHN 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 8:34" />Yisọs amaabọọrọ: <char style="wj">“Ke ataa akpanikọ ke ami ntañ inọọ ndufo, awo akeedodo a-anamma idiọọkñkpọ adʌk afʌn anọ idiọọkñkpọ.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 8:35" /><char style="wj">Ndin afʌn inieghe akpan itie ke ubon, ado ayịn anie itie ke ubon ke nsi-nsi.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 8:36" /><char style="wj">Ndin adieke Ayịn Awo anamma nọ ndufo ebọkkọ, ndufo eyaebọkkọ ke akpanikọ.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 8:37" /><char style="wj">Ami mmediọọñọ ke ndufo eto ubon Ebraham ado ndufo eyem adiñwot miin sia ikọ mmi inieghe itie ke idem ndufo.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 8:38" /><char style="wj">Ami idọkkọ ndufo se ami ñkịt ke iso Ete mmi, ndufo ñko enyʌñ enam se ndufo ekekpeep eto ete ndufo.”</char><verse eid="JHN 8:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 8:39" />Mme Yuu emaebọọrọ, “Ebraham ado ete ñnyịn.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:39">Yisọs amaabọọrọ ammọ, <char style="wj">“Adieke ndufo ekpedooho nditọ Ebraham, ndufo ekpaenam se Ebraham akenam.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 8:40" /><char style="wj">Naña aba ado, ndufo eyem usʌñ adiñwot miin, awo se idọkkọ ndufo akpanikọ kpa ukem naña ami ñkekop nto Abasi. Ebraham ikinamma mme utọ ñkpọ ado.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 8:41" /><char style="wj">Ndufo enam mme utom ete ndufo.”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:41">Ammọ emaebọọrọ, “Ñnyịn idooho nditọ akpara i-imiinieghe ete. Ukweeñe Ete se ñnyịn inie ado Abasi ke idem amọ.”<verse eid="JHN 8:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 8:42" />Yisọs amaabọọrọ, <char style="wj">“Adieke Abasi akpedooho Ete ndufo, ndufo ekpaemma miin, sia ami nto Abasi ndi. Ami ñkidiighe ke uduak idem mmi, ado abasi akendọñ miin.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 8:43" /><char style="wj">Ntak i-ikọ mmi imiinwañake ndufo-o? Sia ndufo ikanna adikpañ utọñ inọọ se ami ntañ.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 8:44" /><char style="wj">Ndufo eto ete ndufo, a-adooho setan, ñko ndufo eyem adinam uduak ete ndufo. Anye akedo awodawo tọọñọ ke editọọñọ, akenam anye itañña akpanikọ, sia mbeñe akpanikọ ndomokeed ibaaha anye ke idem. Anye amaasʌhọ nsu, anye ado asaña akekem ke ataa uduud amọ, sia anye ado asʌhọ nsu anyʌñ ado ete afịd nsu.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 8:45" /><char style="wj">Ado sia ami mmetañ akpanikọ, ndufo innịmme miin ke akpanikọ!</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 8:46" /><char style="wj">Anie ke atu ndufo akeme itañ ke imimmʌm miin ke idiọọkñkpọ ndomokeed? Adieke ami ntañña akpanikọ, nsoo ido ke ndufo inịm se ami ntañ?</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 8:47" /><char style="wj">Awo akeedodo a-atooho Abasi a-akop se Abasi atañ. Ntak a-ndufo imiikoppo se ntañ ado sia ndufo idooho ake Abasi.”</char><verse eid="JHN 8:47" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Se Yisọs Atañ Abaña Idem Amọ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 8:48" />Mme Yuu emaebọọrọ anye ete, “Nte ñnyịn inenne adibo ke afo ado awo Sameria ye awo a-dimọn asọppọ?”<verse eid="JHN 8:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 8:49" />Yisọs amaabọọrọ ammọ ate, <char style="wj">“Dimọn insọppọ miin, ami ñkpono Ete mmi ado ndufo iñkponoke miin</char>. <verse eid="JHN 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 8:50" /><char style="wj">Ami ñyemme itooro nnọ idem mmi, ado Abasi ayem itooro, ñko anye ado abiideikpe.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 8:51" /><char style="wj">Ke ataa akpanikọ ke ami ntañ inọọ ndufo, awo akeedodo a-anịmme ikọ mmi, idiikịtte ñkpa ke nsi-nsi.”</char><verse eid="JHN 8:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 8:52" />Mme Yuu emaetañ ke akpọsọñ uyio ete, “Idahami ñnyịn imidiọọñọ ke afo ado awo ñkpọnsọb. Ebraham amaakpa, mme prọfed emaekpañña ñko, ado afo abo ke awo akeedodo a-anịmme ikọ mfo idiikpaaha ke nsi-nsi. <verse eid="JHN 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 8:53" />Nte afo amekpon akan ete ñnyịn Ebraham? Anye amaakpa, ukem nte mme prọfed ekekpaññake. Afo akere ke imọ ido anie?”<verse eid="JHN 8:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 8:54" />Yisọs amaabọọrọ ate, <char style="wj">“Adieke ami ñkpeyemme ubọọñ idem mmi, ubọọñ ado ikpiwuọñọke ñkpọ ndomokeed. Ke adinekke ntañ, Ete mmi, a-ndufo edatta nte Abasi ndufo, ado andinnọọ miin ubọọñ.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 8:55" /><char style="wj">Akpesʌkado nte ndufo imiidiọọñọke anye, ami mmediọọñọ anye. Adieke ñkpebooho ke ami ndiọọñọke anye, ami ñkpedo asʌhọ nsu nte ndufo, ado ami mmediọọñọ anye ñnyʌñ nnam ikọ amọ.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 8:56" /><char style="wj">Ete ndufo Ebraham amaadaara ke adikere ke imọ iyaikịt usen mmi; anye amaakịt amaanyʌñ adaara.”</char><verse eid="JHN 8:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 8:57" />Mme Yuu emaebo anye, “Afo uyọhọke isua aba mme duob diin ado afo abo ke imikịt Ebraham.”<verse eid="JHN 8:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 8:58" />Yisọs amaabọọrọ ammọ ate, <char style="wj">“Ke ataa akpanikọ ke ami ntañ inọọ ndufo, mbemiso Ebraham adimana, ami mmebaba.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 8:59" />Ke adikop ami, ammọ emaekoono itiad eyem editọọñ anye, ado Yisọs amaafiọnnọ awuọ akpọñ efaak tembịd.<verse eid="JHN 8:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JHN 9" />
  <para style="s1">Yisọs Akọk Awodeen A-akemanake Nnan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 9:1" />Nte anye akesʌkkọ asaña aka, anye amaakịt awo keed a-akedooho nnan tọọñọ ke emana. <verse eid="JHN 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 9:2" />Mme mbed amọ emaebịp anye ete, “Andikpeeb, anie ikinam idiọọkñkpọ nọ anye adimana nnan, awo ami me ete ye eka amọ?”<verse eid="JHN 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 9:3" />Yisọs amaabọọrọ ate, <char style="wj">“Idooho anye, inyʌññọ ido ete me eka amọ akenam idiọọkñkpọ; anye akemana nnan nọ ato do utom Abasi ayaara ke idem amọ.</char> <verse eid="JHN 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 9:4" /><char style="wj">Adaña nte usen akaaha iso, ana ñnyịn inam utom andikindọñ miin. Akonayio asʌk adi, a-awo ndomokeed imiidiikanna inam utom.</char> <verse eid="JHN 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 9:5" /><char style="wj">Ke adaña ini ami mbaaha ke ederimbod, ami ndo unwana ederimbod.”</char><verse eid="JHN 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 9:6" />Ke anye amaaketañ ami ama, anye amaafiat etab ke isọñ, awuaak ye ntan, aben afiọññọ awo nnan ado ke anyen. <verse eid="JHN 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 9:7" />Ndin anye amaabo anye, <char style="wj">“Kaa keyie idem ke Ñkpọdiọhọ mmọọñ Silọm”</char> (anyịñ ado awuọ, “Emaedọñ”). Anye amaadakka akaa akeyie, anyʌñ akịt usʌñ, ndin atịmme anyọñ ufọk amọ.<verse eid="JHN 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 9:8" />Mme mbọhọidʌñ amọ ye mbon mfen e-ekekịtte anye naña abeeñe ebeeñe emaebo, “Idooho awo a-akesitieghe abeeñe ebeeñe ado ami?” <verse eid="JHN 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 9:9" />Ubaak ammọ emaebo ke anye ke ado.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:9">Mbon mfen emaebo, “Iyoo, anyʌñ abebit anye.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:9">Ado awo ado ke idem amọ amaasọọñọ ate, “Ami ndo awo ado.”<verse eid="JHN 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 9:10" />Ammọ emaebịp anye ete, “Anyen mfo akenam die atara ndin?”<verse eid="JHN 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 9:11" />Anye amaabọọrọ ate, “Ete a-mme awo ekoodo Yisọs akenam mbad, adọppọ añyeet ke anyen. Anye amambo miin yak ñka ñkeyie idem ke Silọm. Ndin ami mmaakaa ñnyʌñ ñkeyie, ndin ami mmemọọnọ ñkpọ.”<verse eid="JHN 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 9:12" />Ammọ emaebịp anye ate, “Anye awo ado-o?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:12">Anye amaabọọrọ, “Ndiọọñọke.”<verse eid="JHN 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mme Farisi Eduuñọ Ukọk Udọñọ Yisọs</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 9:13" />Ammọ emaeben ete a-akedooho nnan do ebịne mme Farisi. <verse eid="JHN 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 9:14" />Akedo ke usen Sabad ke Yisọs akenam mbad atat nnan ado anyen. <verse eid="JHN 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 9:15" />Ke ntoro mme Farisi emaebịp anye naña anye akenam akịt usʌñ. Anye amaabo, “Anye akedọppọ mbad añyeet ke anyen, akema ami ñkeyie nsio, ndin idahami mmekịt usʌñ.”<verse eid="JHN 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 9:16" />Ubaak mme Farisi emaebo, “Awo ami itooho Abasi, sia anye inịmme mbed Sabad.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:16">Ado mbon mfen emaebo, “Die ke awo anam idiọọkñkpọ akeme adinañña mme utọ idiọọñọ ami?” Ndin ubakka amaaba ke ufọọd ammọ.<verse eid="JHN 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 9:17" />Ammọ ndin emaemaana ebịp awo nnan ado ete, “Nsoo ke afo ke idem mfo anie aditañ mbaña anye, sia anyen mfo ke anye aketat?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:17">Awo ado amaabọọrọ ate, “Anye ado prọfed.”<verse eid="JHN 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 9:18" />Kpayeado, mme Yuu ikisʌkkọ inenịm ke awo ado akedo nnan tutu ekekoot ete ye eka amọ. <verse eid="JHN 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 9:19" />Ndin emaebịp ammọ, “Nte awo ami ado ataa ayịn ndufo e-ebooho ke akemana nnan? Anye anam die akịt usʌñ idahami?”<verse eid="JHN 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 9:20" />Ete ye eka amọ emaebọọrọ, “Ñnyịn imidiọọñọ ke anye ado ayịn ñnyịn, iminyʌñ idiọọñọ ke anye akemana nnan. <verse eid="JHN 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 9:21" />Ado naña anye anam akịt usʌñ, me awo a-aketatta anye anyen, ñnyịn idiọọñọke. Ibịp anye; anye a-akpon akem se atañ ikọ idem amọ.” <verse eid="JHN 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 9:22" />Ete ye eka amọ eketañ ami sia ammọ emaenie ndịk ebaaña ikpọ mme adadusʌñ mme Yuu, e-emaekebebiere adibịn awo ndomokeed a-abooho ke Yisọs ado Krais nsio ke sinakọk. <verse eid="JHN 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 9:23" />Ntak ado akenam ete ye eka amọ ebo, “Anye akpon akem; ibịp anye.”<verse eid="JHN 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 9:24" />Anam mme Yuu emaemaana edọñ ekekoot ete a-akedooho nnan enyʌñ ebo anye ete, “Nọ Abasi ubọọñ ke aditañ akpanikọ. Ñnyịn imidiọọñọ ke awo ami ado anam idiọọkñkpọ.”<verse eid="JHN 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 9:25" />Awo ado amaabọọrọ ate, “Me anye ado anam idiọọkñkpọ, miidooho, ami ndiọọñọke. Ukweeñe se ami ndiọọñọ ado ke ñkedo nnan ado idahami mmekịt usʌñ.”<verse eid="JHN 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 9:26" />Ammọ emaemaana ebịp anye ete, “Nsoo ke anye akunam fiin? Anye akenam die utat fiin anyen?”<verse eid="JHN 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 9:27" />Anye amaabọọrọ, “Ami mmidọdọkkọ ndufo, ado ndufo ikikpañña utọñ. Ntak a-ndufo eyemme adimaana ñkop-o? Ndufo ke idem ndufo eyem edikappa ndo mme mbed amọ ñko?”<verse eid="JHN 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 9:28" />Ammọ ndin emaesueeñ anye, ete “Afo ado mbed amọ, ñnyịn ido mbed Moses! <verse eid="JHN 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 9:29" />Ñnyịn imidiọọñọ ke Abasi amaatañ ikọ anọ Moses, ado amaado awo ami, ñnyịn idiọọñọke nte anye ato.”<verse eid="JHN 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 9:30" />Awo ado amaabọọrọ ate, “Ataa ñkpọ ñkpaidem adodo! Ndufo idiọọñọke nte anye ato, ado anye amantat miin anyen! <verse eid="JHN 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 9:31" />Ñnyịn imidiọọñọ ke Abasi isikpañña utọñ inọ mme anam idiọọkñkpọ. Abasi akpañ utọñ anọ mbon etʌmmọ ekpono anye enyʌñ enam uduak amọ. <verse eid="JHN 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 9:32" />Tọọñọ ederimbod aketọọñọ awo ikoppo nte ebo ke awo atat awo a-akemanake nnan anyen. <verse eid="JHN 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 9:33" />Akpedo awo ami ikitooho Abasi, anye ikpikanna inam ñkpọ ndomokeed.”<verse eid="JHN 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 9:34" />Ammọ ekekop ami, emaebọọrọ anye ete, “Afo akpenam die ikpeep ñnyịn, afo a-adooho akenyeenyịne ke idiọọkñkpọ tọọñọ ke emana!” Ndin ammọ emaebịne anye esio.<verse eid="JHN 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nnan ke Sịbidịd</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 9:35" />Yisọs amaakop ke ammọ emaebịne anye esio, ndin ke ini Yisọs amaakedikịt anye, Yisọs amaabo anye ate, <char style="wj">“Afo amenịm Ayịn Awo ke akpanikọ?”</char><verse eid="JHN 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 9:36" />Awo ado amaabịp, “Ete, ndọkkọ me anye ado anie awo, nọ ami nnịm anye ke akpanikọ.”<verse eid="JHN 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 9:37" />Yisọs amaabo, <char style="wj">“Afo amekịt anye idahami; ke akpanikọ, anye ado anditañ ikọ ye afo.”</char><verse eid="JHN 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 9:38" />Awo ado amaabo, “Abọọñ, mmenịm,” anyʌñ akpono anye.<verse eid="JHN 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 9:39" />Yisọs amaabo anye: <char style="wj">“Ado ke ntak ubiideikpe ke ami ndi ederimbod, nọ ato do nnan ekịt usʌñ, mbon e-ekịtte usʌñ eforo nnan.”</char><verse eid="JHN 9:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 9:40" />Ke adikop ami, ubaak mme Farisi e-ekebaaha do emaebịp anye, “Kọm abo die? Awuọ ñnyịn ñko idoñño nnan?”<verse eid="JHN 9:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 9:41" />Yisọs amaabo ammọ: <char style="wj">“Akpedo ekedo nnan, ikpe idiọọkñkpọ ikpitịppe ndufo; ado sia ndufo ebooho ke mmimọ imikịt usʌñ, ikpe i-itịp ndufo.”</char><verse eid="JHN 9:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JHN 10" />
  <para style="s1">Eti Akpemeedọñ ye mme Edọñ Amọ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 10:1" />
    <char style="wj">“Ke ataa akpanikọ, ami ntañ inọ ndufo mme Farisi, awo akeedodo i-imiisañake inuaatob idʌk ufọk edọñ, ado asaña usʌñ mfen adʌk, ado inọ ye awo ñwo.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 10:2" /><char style="wj">Anye a-asañake inuaatob adʌk ado akpemeedọñ.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 10:3" /><char style="wj">Akpeme inuaatob akʌkkọ usʌñ anọ anye adʌk, ndin mme edọñ ekpañ utọñ ekop uyio amọ. Anye akoot edọñ amọ ke anyịñ anyʌñ akoono ammọ awuọ esiin.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 10:4" /><char style="wj">Ke anye amaakesio afịd edọñ se ido ake amọ, anye adat ammọ usʌñ, ndin mme edọñ ekeene anye sia ediọọñọ uyio amọ.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 10:5" /><char style="wj">Ado ammọ idiikeeneke asenawo. Ke adinekke ntañ, ammọ ediifefeghe ikpọñ anye, sia ammọ idiọọñọke uyio asenawo.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 10:6" />Yisọs amaatañ ñke ami anọ mme Farisi ado ikinwañake ammọ se anye aketañ abaña.<verse eid="JHN 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 10:7" />Anam Yisọs amaamaana abo ammọ ate: <char style="wj">“Ke ataa akpanikọ, ami ntañ inọ ndufo, ami ndo inuaatob atu edọñ.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 10:8" /><char style="wj">Afịd mbon se ikimbem miin iso idi ekedoñño inọ ye ñwo, ado mme edọñ ikikpañña utọñ inọ ammọ.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 10:9" /><char style="wj">Ami ndo inuaatob; awo a-asañake anto miin adʌk ayaabọ adinyaaña. Utọ awo ado ayaadʌk anyʌñ awuọ anyʌñ akịt ikịm ufene.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 10:10" /><char style="wj">Inọ adi adiyịp ñkpọ ñnyʌñ ñwot ñnyʌñ nsobo kpọd; ado ami ndi nọ ato do ammọ enie uwem, enyʌñ enie uwem ayọhọ-ayọhọ.</char><verse eid="JHN 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 10:11" />
    <char style="wj">“Ami ndo eti akpemeedọñ. Eti akpemeedọñ ayaak uwem amọ anọ ke ntak mme edọñ.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 10:12" /><char style="wj">Anye e-ekpeeghekpe, idooho akpemeedọñ, inyʌññọ ido anye anie edọñ. Ke ntoro, anye afeghe akpọñ edọñ ke ini anye akịtte ewaikọd naña adi. Ndin ewaikọd akịm mme edọñ anyʌñ asuan ammọ.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 10:13" /><char style="wj">Awo ado afeghe sia ekpekpe anye, anam anye ikereke ñkpọ ndomokeed ibaña mme edọñ.</char><verse eid="JHN 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 10:14" />
    <char style="wj">“Ami ndo eti akpemeedọñ. Ami mmediọọñọ mme edọñ mmi, mme edọñ mmi enyʌñ endiọọñọ miin,</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 10:15" /><char style="wj">kpa naña Ete andiọọñọ miin, ami ñko ñnyʌñ ndiọọñọ Ete; ñnyʌñ ñyaak uwem mmi nnọ mme edọñ.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 10:16" /><char style="wj">Ami mmenie mme edọñ mfen i-imiisịneke ke atu abaedọñ anye ami. Ndin ana ami mben ammọ ndi ñko. Ammọ ñko eyaekpañ utọñ ekop uyio mmi, ndin atu edọñ keed ye akpemeedọñ keed adiiba.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 10:17" /><char style="wj">Ntak e-Ete mmi ammaaha miin ado ke mmeduọọk uwem mmi nọ ato do mmaana mben anye.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 10:18" /><char style="wj">Awo ndomokeed imbọọhọ uwem mmi, ado ami nduọọk anye ke unyịmme esịd mmi. Ami mmenie adudu adiduọọk anye, mmenyʌñ nnie adudu adimaana mben anye; ndin ami ado ewʌhọ a-ami ñkebọọhọ nto Ete mmi.”</char><verse eid="JHN 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 10:19" />Mme ikọ ami amaamaana asịn ubakka ke atu mme Yuu. <verse eid="JHN 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 10:20" />Uwak ammọ emaebo, “Anye ado awo ñkpọnsọb a-dimọn amʌmmọ, ataa uyaha idaad. Ntak a-ndufo ekpañña utọñ enọọ anye-e?”<verse eid="JHN 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 10:21" />Mbon mfen emaebo, “Mme ikọ ami idooho ikọ awo ñkpọnsọb a-dimọn amʌmmọ. Nte dimọn akeme aditat nnan anyen?”<verse eid="JHN 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mme Ntuaha Mfen ke Abaña Ikọ Yisọs</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 10:22" />Ini usọrọ Adimaana Ñyaak Tembịd Nnọọ Abasi ke Yeruselem amaadikem. Akedo ini ekarika, <verse eid="JHN 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 10:23" />ndin Yisọs akeba ke afe tembịd, asaaña ke Mben Esa Sọlọmọn. <verse eid="JHN 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 10:24" />Mme Yuu emaedikanna anye ekʌk enyʌñ ebo anye, “Afo adiinịm ñnyịn ke eyịghe ikpeene die? Akpedo afo ado Krais, tañ inọ ñnyịn anwa-anwa.”<verse eid="JHN 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 10:25" />Yisọs amaabọọrọ ate: <char style="wj">“Ami mmetañ inọ ndufo, ado ndufo inịmme. Mme utom a-ami nnamma ke anyịñ Ete mmi edo ntiense ennọ miin,</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 10:26" /><char style="wj">ado ndufo innịmme miin ke akpanikọ sia ndufo idooho mme edọñ mmi.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 10:27" /><char style="wj">Mme edọñ mmi e-ekpañ utọñ ekop uyio mmi; ami mmediọọñọ ammọ, ammọ enyʌñ eñkeene miin.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 10:28" /><char style="wj">Ami nnọ ammọ nsi-nsi uwem, ammọ idiisoppo tutu amama; ñko awo ndomokeed idiiwappake ammọ insio miin ke ubọk.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 10:29" /><char style="wj">Ete mmi, a-akennọọhọ ammọ, akpon akan afịd awo, ñko awo ndomokeed ikanna adiwappa ammọ nsio ke ubọk Ete mmi.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 10:30" /><char style="wj">Ami ye Ete ido keed.”</char><verse eid="JHN 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 10:31" />Mme Yuu emaemaana ekoono itiad aditọọñ anye, <verse eid="JHN 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 10:32" />ado Yisọs amaabo ammọ, <char style="wj">“Ami mmiwọt ndufo uwak nti utom a-atooho Ete mmi. Akee ke atu ami anam nọ ndufo entọọñ ke itiad?”</char><verse eid="JHN 10:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 10:33" />Mme Yuu emaebọọrọ, “Ñnyịn utọọñọ fiin ke itiad ke ntak nti utom mfo, ado sia asuuk Abasi uyio. Afo ado ñkaña awo, ado abo ke ido Abasi.”<verse eid="JHN 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 10:34" />Yisọs amaabọọrọ ammọ ate, <char style="wj">“Nte iwereke ke Mbed ndufo, ‘Ami mmebo ke ndufo edoñño mme “abasi” ’?</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 10:35" /><char style="wj">Adieke anye akekoodo ammọ, ‘mme abasi,’ mbon e-ekewette ikọ Abasi enọ, ndin awo ikemeke ikpọnnọ ikọ Abasi inịm,</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 10:36" /><char style="wj">nwa-nwa dise ndin anye a-Abasi akesioho anịm asaña-asaña nte akemọ anyʌñ anọ adi ke ederimbod? Ntak a-ndufo ebooho ke ami mmesappa anyịñ Abasi ke ami adibo, ‘Ami ndo Ayịn Abasi-e’?</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 10:37" /><char style="wj">Ikinnịm miin ke akpanikọ ibọhọke ami nnam utom Ete mmi.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 10:38" /><char style="wj">Ado akpedo mmenam, akpesʌkado a-ndufo idinnịmme miin ke akpanikọ, isʌk ikap inịm mme utịppe utom a-ami nnamma ke akpanikọ, nọ ndufo ediọọñọ enyʌñ enie ifiọk ke Ete aba ke ami, ami ñko ñnyʌñ mba ke Ete.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 10:39" />Ammọ emaemaana eyem adimʌm anye, ado anye amaafiọnnọ abọkkọ ammọ.<verse eid="JHN 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 10:40" />Ndin Yisọs amaatịmme akaa edem Yọdan utịd ñkañ a-Yọọn akesiduọkkọ mme awo mmọọñ ke ntọọñọ. Anye amaaba do, <verse eid="JHN 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 10:41" />ndin uwak awo emaedi ebịne anye. Ammọ emaebo anye ete, “Akpesʌkado a-Yọọn imiikinọọhọ idiọọñọ ndomokeed, afịd se Yọọn aketañ abaña ete ami akedo akpanikọ.” <verse eid="JHN 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 10:42" />Ndin uwak ammọ emaenịm Yisọs ke akpanikọ.<verse eid="JHN 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JHN 11" />
  <para style="s1">Ñkpa Lasọrọs</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 11:1" />Ete keed a-akekereke Lasọrọs amaadọñọ. Anye aketo Betani, idʌñ a-Mmeri ye ayịneka amọ Mmata eketooho. <verse eid="JHN 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 11:2" />(Mmeri ami, a-ayịneka amọ Lasọrọs akedọñọke ado ukem awonwaan a-akefiọññọke Yisọs inem ufịk pefium anyʌñ adat ided amọ akwokko ñkpad amọ.) <verse eid="JHN 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 11:3" />Nditọeka ibaan Lasọrọs emaedọñ utom enọ Yisọs ete, “Abọọñ, awo a-afo amaaha adọdọñọ.”<verse eid="JHN 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 11:4" />Ke ini Yisọs akekoppo anye amaabo, <char style="wj">“Udọñọ ami idiikiwuọhọ ke ñkpa. Ado nọ Abasi abọ ubọọñ, Ayịn Abasi ñko abọ ubọọñ ato do.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 11:5" />Yisọs amaama Mmata ye nditọeka amọ, Mmeri ye Lasọrọs. <verse eid="JHN 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 11:6" />Ke anye amaakekop ke idem isọññọ Lasọrọs, anye amaasuuk aba ke itie a-anye akebaaha usen iba mfen <verse eid="JHN 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 11:7" />mbemiso anye abo mme mbed, <char style="wj">“Yak ñnyịn itịmme ika Yudia.”</char><verse eid="JHN 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 11:8" />Mme mbed emaebo anye, “Andikpeeb, ke etək-etək ini a-akeboiyoke ko, mme Yuu emaenwana adutọọñ fiin ke itiad, ndin afo ayem itịmme ñka do?”<verse eid="JHN 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 11:9" />Yisọs amaabọọrọ, <char style="wj">“Nte idooho awa duob mme iba eba ke uweemeayio? Awo a-asañake ke uweemeayio idiikọbọke iduọ, sia unwana ederimbod ami anam anye akịt usʌñ.</char> <verse eid="JHN 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 11:10" /><char style="wj">Ado anye amaasaña ke akonayio akeme adikọbọ nduọ sia unwana ibaaha.”</char><verse eid="JHN 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 11:11" />Anye amaaketañ ami ama, amaatịmme abo ammọ, <char style="wj">“Ufan ñnyịn Lasọrọs adadaiya, ado ami ñyaaka do ñketọi anye.”</char><verse eid="JHN 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 11:12" />Mme mbed emaebọọrọ anye ate, “Abọọñ akpedo anye adadaiya, idem ayaasọñ anye.” <verse eid="JHN 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 11:13" />Yisọs aketañ abaña ñkpa Lasọrọs, ado mme mbed ekekere ke anye aketañ abaña ñkaña adidaiya idab.<verse eid="JHN 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 11:14" />Ado amaanam Yisọs atañ anọ ammọ inwañ-inwañ ate, <char style="wj">“Lasọrọs a-akpa;</char> <verse eid="JHN 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 11:15" /><char style="wj">ndin ke ntak ndufo, esịd annem miin ke ñkibaaha do, nọ ndufo enịm ke akpanikọ. Ado yak ñnyịn ika ibịne anye.”</char><verse eid="JHN 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 11:16" />Ndin Tọmọs, (e-ekenyʌññọ esikoot Didimọs) amaabo mme mbed mbon ñko ate, “Yak ñnyịn ñko ikeene, nọ ikikpa ye anye.”<verse eid="JHN 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisọs Adọñ Nditọeka Ibaan Lasọrọs Esịd</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 11:17" />Yisọs amaakediwuọ, anye amaakịt ke Lasọrọs amaasesịne ke udi usen inaañ. <verse eid="JHN 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 11:18" />Tọọñọ ke Betani kaa Yeruselem ikiyọhọke itiad iba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte kilomita 3</char></note>, <verse eid="JHN 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 11:19" />ñko uwak mme Yuu emaekaa adikidọñ Mmata ye Mmeri esịd ke ntak ñkpa ayịneka ammọ. <verse eid="JHN 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 11:20" />Ke ini Mmata akekoppo ke Yisọs asʌk adi, anye amaawuọ akesoobo Yisọs, ado Mmeri amaasuuk aba ke ufọk.<verse eid="JHN 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 11:21" />Mmata amaabo Yisọs, “Abọọñ, akpedo afo amaaba mi ayịneka mmi ikpikikpaaha. <verse eid="JHN 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 11:22" />Ado ami mmediọọñọ mbo ñkọm idahami ke Abasi ayaunọ fiin se afo akpebebịp.”<verse eid="JHN 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 11:23" />Yisọs amaabo anye, <char style="wj">“Ayịneka mfo ayaamaana aset.”</char><verse eid="JHN 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 11:24" />Mmata amaabọọrọ, “Ami mmediọọñọ ke anye ayaaset ke ini adised ke ñkpa ke akpatre usen.”<verse eid="JHN 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 11:25" />Yisọs amaabo anye, <char style="wj">“Ami ndo adised ke ñkpa ye uwem. Awo annịmme miin ke akpanikọ ayaadu uwem akpesʌkado a-anye akpaaha;</char> <verse eid="JHN 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 11:26" /><char style="wj">ñko awo akeedodo aduuho uwem anyʌñ annịm miin ke akpanikọ idiikpaaha ke nsi-nsi. Nte afo amenịm ami?”</char><verse eid="JHN 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 11:27" />Anye amaabo Yisọs, “Ii Abọọñ, mmenịm mbo ke afo ado Krais Ayịn Abasi a-anaaha adi ke ederimbod.”<verse eid="JHN 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 11:28" />Ke Mmata amaaketañ ami ama, anye amaadakka akekoot Mmeri ayịneka amọ asịkke ada. Ndin Mmata amaabo Mmeri, “Andikpeeb mmọ mi, asʌk abịp ubaña fiin.” <verse eid="JHN 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 11:29" />Ke ini Mmeri akekoppo ami, anye amaasọsọp adakka akesoobo anye. <verse eid="JHN 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 11:30" />Yisọs akesʌk aba ke itie a-Mmata akesooboke anye, ikidiwuọhọ Betani diin. <verse eid="JHN 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 11:31" />Ke ini mme Yuu e-ekebaaha ke ufọk ye Mmeri edọñ anye esịd ekekịtte naña anye asọsọp adakka awuọ esiin, ammọ emaekeene anye sia ammọ ekekere ke anye aka itie udi adikitua ayịd.<verse eid="JHN 11:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 11:32" />Ke Mmeri amaakewuọ itie a-Yisọs akebaaha akịt anye, anye amaaduọ ke ukod amọ abo, “Abọọñ, akpedo afo amaaba mi, ayịneka mmi ikpikikpaaha.”<verse eid="JHN 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 11:33" />Ke ini Yisọs akekịtte ke anye ye mme Yuu e-ekesañake ye anye esʌk etua, amaanekke afịna Yisọs ke sịbidịd. <verse eid="JHN 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 11:34" />Anye amaabịp, <char style="wj">“Ndufo enịm anye ke mmọọ?”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 11:34">Ammọ emaebọọrọ, “Abọọñ, di dise.”<verse eid="JHN 11:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 11:35" />Yisọs amaatua.<verse eid="JHN 11:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 11:36" />Ado amaanam mme Yuu ebo, “Se naña anye akema anye!”<verse eid="JHN 11:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 11:37" />Ado usʌk ammọ emaebo, “Nte anye a-akenamma nọ nnan akịt usʌñ ikpikinamma nọ ete ami akuukpa.”<verse eid="JHN 11:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisọs Anam Lasọrọs Aset ke Ñkpa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 11:38" />Esịd amaamaana abʌññọ Yisọs ke anye amaakediwuọ itie udi. Udi akedo abaitiad e-emaekeben itiad ekwe ke inua. <verse eid="JHN 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 11:39" />Yisọs amaabo ammọ, <char style="wj">“Iwere itiad ami isio.”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 11:39">Mmata, ayịneka akpañkpa amaabo, “Abọọñ, akpo amọ atọọñọ aditebe idahami, sia anye ana do usen inaañ.”<verse eid="JHN 11:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 11:40" />Yisọs amaabo ate, <char style="wj">“Ado nte ami ñkitañña inọ ndufo mbo ke ekpenịm ke akpanikọ ndufo eyaekịt ubọọñ Abasi?”</char><verse eid="JHN 11:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 11:41" />Ammọ emaewere itiad esio ndin Yisọs amaadịppe anyen ke anyọñ abo ate, <char style="wj">“Ete, ami mmukọọm fiin sia afo amekop uyio mmi.</char> <verse eid="JHN 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 11:42" /><char style="wj">Ami mmaadiọọñọ ke afo amesikop uyio mmi afịd ini, ado ami ñketañ ami ke ufọn mbon e-ebaññake mi, nọ ammọ enịm ke afo akendọñ miin.”</char><verse eid="JHN 11:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 11:43" />Ke Yisọs amaaketañ ami ama, anye amaakoot ke akpọsọñ uyio ate, <char style="wj">“Lasọrọs, wuọ di.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 11:44" />Akpañkpa amaawuọ adi ye naña ekenyʌñ ewañ anye mbai linen, ye afọñ ke ubọk ye ukod ye iso.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 11:44">Yisọs amaabo ammọ, <char style="wj">“Ikpọk anye afọñ udi, inyʌñ iyaak anye aka.”</char><verse eid="JHN 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Edioomo Adiwot Yisọs</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 11:45" />Uwak mme Yuu e-ekediighe edise Mmeri, ekenyʌññọ ekịt se Yisọs akenam, emaenịm anye ke akpanikọ. <verse eid="JHN 11:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 11:46" />Ado usʌk ammọ emaekebʌk enọ mme Farisi se Yisọs akenam. <verse eid="JHN 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 11:47" />Ndin mme ñkpoon aku ye mme Farisi emaekoot mbono esob Sanhidrin.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 11:47">Ammọ emaebịp ebo “Nsoo ke ñnyịn idiinam? Se naña awo ami aka iso anam mme idiọọñọ. <verse eid="JHN 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 11:48" />Ñnyịn ikpiyak anye aka iso ntom, afịd awo eyaenịm anye ke akpanikọ ndin mbon Rom eyaedibọ ñnyịn tembịd ye idịd ñnyịn.”<verse eid="JHN 11:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 11:49" />Awo keed ke atu ammọ a-akekereke Kaifas, a-akedooho ekamba aku isua ado amaabo, “Ndufo idiọọñọke ñkpọ ndomokeed. <verse eid="JHN 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 11:50" />Ndufo ikịtte ke a-afọn awo keed adikpa nnọọ afịd awo ñkan afịd idịd aditak.”<verse eid="JHN 11:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 11:51" />Anye ikitañña ami nte ikọ idem amọ, ado nte ekamba aku ke isua ado anye amaatañ prọfesi abo ke Yisọs ayaakpa ke iwuod afịd abio mme Yuu, <verse eid="JHN 11:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 11:52" />inyʌññọ ido idịd ado ikpọọñ, ado ayaakpa anọ nditọ Abasi e-ekesuanake eyọhọ afịd itie, adibok ammọ nọ ammọ ekappa edo keed. <verse eid="JHN 11:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 11:53" />Ndin tọọñọ ke usen ado ammọ emaedʌk edioomo naña ekpedat uwem Yisọs.<verse eid="JHN 11:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 11:54" />Ado amaanam Yisọs ikisiwuọñọke aba isaaña anwa-anwa ke ufọọd mbon Yudia. Anye amaakeba ye mme mbed amọ ke esịd idʌñ a-akereke Ifrem, a-akpereke anaan.<verse eid="JHN 11:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 11:55" />Ke amaakekpere ini usọrọ mme Yuu e-ekoodo Usọrọ Nsaña Mboiyo, uwak awo emaeto esịdidʌñ ekaa Yeruselem adinam idem ammọ asana ke mbeeñe idem Usọrọ Nsaña Mboiyo. <verse eid="JHN 11:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 11:56" />Ammọ emaekaa iso eyem Yisọs, ndin naña ammọ ekedaaha ke mme afe tembịd ammọ emaebịp emọ-emọ ete, “Nsoo ke afo akere? Ado nte anye idiidiighe usọrọ ami?” <verse eid="JHN 11:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 11:57" />Ado mme ñkpoon aku ye mme Farisi emaenọ ewʌhọ ete emaekịt nte Yisọs aba yak edidọkkọ mmimọ nọ ammọ ekemʌm anye.<verse eid="JHN 11:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JHN 12" />
  <para style="s1">Eyet Yisọs Adan ke Betani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 12:1" />Usen itiokeed akesʌhọ mbemiso ini Usọrọ Nsaña Mboiyo, Yisọs amaakaa Betani, itie a-Lasọrọs, awo Yisọs akenamma aset ke ñkpa, akedʌññọ. <verse eid="JHN 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 12:2" />Emaenam usọrọ ndidia ndubi do adikpono Yisọs. Mmata akedo andideeme ndidia ke ini Lasọrọs akedooho keed ke atu mbon se ikitie ke akpokoro ye Yisọs. <verse eid="JHN 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 12:3" />Ndin Mmeri amaaben ataa nsọñudua pefium aduọk Yisọs ke ukod anyʌñ aben ided amọ akwokko anye ukod. Ndin inem ufịk nsọñudua adan naad ado amaayọhọ afịd ufọk.<verse eid="JHN 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 12:4" />Ado keed ke atu mme mbed amọ, a-akekereke Yudas Iskariọd, anye a-akeditappa anye amaasua ñkpọ ami, ndin abo: <verse eid="JHN 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 12:5" />“Ntak awo imiikinyamma pefium ami iben akʌk inọ mme uweene-e? Adan ado amaayọhọ akʌkutom isua keed.” <verse eid="JHN 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 12:6" />Anye ikitañña ami sia anye akemaaha mme uweene, ado sia anye akedo inọ. Nte akama ekpad akʌk, anye amaasisịññe akʌk anwam idem amọ ato se ekesisịn ke ekpad ado.<verse eid="JHN 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 12:7" />Yisọs amaabọọrọ ate, <char style="wj">“Kpọñ anye, akena nte anye anịm inem ufịk adan ami anọ usen se edimbuuk miin.</char> <verse eid="JHN 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 12:8" /><char style="wj">Mbon uweene ediisʌk ibaba ye ndufo, ado ami ndiibaaha ye ndufo afịd ini.”</char><verse eid="JHN 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 12:9" />Uwak mme Yuu emaekop ke Yisọs mmọdo ke ndo, anam ammọ emaedi, idooho adikịt Yisọs ikpọọñ, ado adinyʌñ ñkịt Lasọrọs a-Yisọs akenamma nọ aset ke ñkpa. <verse eid="JHN 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 12:10" />Mme ikpọ aku emaenyʌñ enam akikere adiwot Lasọrọs ñko, <verse eid="JHN 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 12:11" />sia amaato ke ntak amọ uwak mme Yuu ekappa ebịne Yisọs enyʌñ enịm anye ke akpanikọ.<verse eid="JHN 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisọs Adʌk Yeruselem nte Adidem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 12:12" />Edem usen uwak atu awo e-ekediighe usọrọ emaekop ke Yisọs amaadakka Yeruselem. <verse eid="JHN 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 12:13" />Ammọ emaekoono akpịn ayob ewuọ ekaa adikisoobo ye anye enyʌñ ekwaaha ñkpo ete,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:13">“Hosana!”</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JHN 12:13" />
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:13">“Afọfọn anọ anye a-adiighe ke anyịñ Abọọñ!”</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JHN 12:13" />
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:13">“Afọfọn anọ adidem Isrel!”<verse eid="JHN 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 12:14" />Yisọs amaakịt abaak dọñki anyʌñ adọọk atie ke anyọñ kpa naña ewet.<verse eid="JHN 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 12:15" />“Kuufeghe ndịk, Adiaha Saiyọn.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:15">Se, adidem mfo asʌk adi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:15">atie ke abaak dọñki.”<verse eid="JHN 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 12:16" />Ñkpọ ami ikinwañake mme mbed amọ akpa ado. Ado ke emaekeben Yisọs edọọk ke ubọọñ ke akenwaña ammọ nte ke emaewet mme ñkpọ ami ebaña anye, ñko ke ekenyʌñ enam anye afịd mme ñkpọ ami.<verse eid="JHN 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 12:17" />Atu awo e-ekebaaha ye anye ke ini a-anye akekoodo Lasọrọs asio ke udi anyʌñ anam anye aset ke ñkpa emaeka iso enọ ntiense ke adisuan etob ami. <verse eid="JHN 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 12:18" />Mme uwak awo emaeka ebịne anye ke ini emaekekop ke anye akenam utịppe idiọọñọ ami. <verse eid="JHN 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 12:19" />Anam mme Farisi emaebo idem ammọ ete, “Sese, ñkpọ ami idatta ñnyịn ika itie ndomokeed. Se naña afịd ederimbod ewọññọ ebịne anye.”<verse eid="JHN 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisọs Abak Atañ Abaña Ñkpa Amọ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 12:20" />Amaaba usʌk mbon Greek ke atu mbon e-ekekaaha adikpono Abasi ke ini usọrọ ado. <verse eid="JHN 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 12:21" />Ammọ emaedi ebịne Filib a-aketooho Bedsaida ke Kalili, enyʌñ enịm anye ebeeñe ke iso ete, “Ete, ñnyịn ikpaima adikịt Yisọs.” <verse eid="JHN 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 12:22" />Filib amaaketañ anọ Andru; Andru ye Filib emaedakka eketañ enọ Yisọs.<verse eid="JHN 12:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 12:23" />Yisọs amaabọọrọ ate, <char style="wj">“Ini akem e-ebooho inọ Ayịn Awo ubọọñ.</char> <verse eid="JHN 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 12:24" /><char style="wj">Ke ataa akpanikọ ke ami ntañ inọọ ndufo, ibọhọke ñkpasi abakpa aduọ adʌk isọñ anyʌñ akpa, anye adiisʌk ido ñkpasi keed. Ado anye akpekpa, ayaasakka uwak ñkpasi.</char> <verse eid="JHN 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 12:25" /><char style="wj">Awo akeedodo amaaha uwem amọ ayaaduọọk anye, ado awo akeedodo asuaha uwem amọ ke ederimbod ami ayaanie nsi-nsi uwem.</char> <verse eid="JHN 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 12:26" /><char style="wj">Awo akeedodo a-anamma ñkpọ annọ miin ana añkeene miin; ndin itie nte ami mba, mbed mmi ana eba do. Ete mmi ayaakpono awo a-anamma ñkpọ annọọ miin.</char><verse eid="JHN 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 12:27" />
    <char style="wj">“Idahami ukpọñ mmi atịmede, ndin nsoo ke ami ndiitañ? Ete, ‘Mfak miin sio ke awa ami?’ Iyoo, sia ado kpa ke ntak ami ke ami ñkediwuọ awa ami.</char> <verse eid="JHN 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 12:28" /><char style="wj">Ete, nọ anyịñ mfo ubọọñ.”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 12:28">Ndin uyio amaato ke hefịn ate, “Ami mmenọ anye ubọọñ, ndiisʌk mmamaana nnọ.” <verse eid="JHN 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 12:29" />Mme atu awo e-ekebaaha do ekop ñkpọ ami ekebo ke ado aduma; ubaak awo ete ke ado enyere aketañ ikọ ye anye.<verse eid="JHN 12:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 12:30" />Yisọs amaabo, <char style="wj">“Uyio ado akedo ke ufọn ndufo, ikidooho ke ufọn mmi.</char> <verse eid="JHN 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 12:31" /><char style="wj">Idahami ado ini ubiideikpe nnọọ ederimbod ami; idahami eyaebịn akpan abọọñ ederimbod ami esio.</char> <verse eid="JHN 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 12:32" /><char style="wj">Ado ami, ke ini emaemben miin ekpọñ isọñ idọọk ke anyọñ, ñyaakoono afịd awo ndat nnọ idem mmi.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 12:33" />Anye aketañ ami adiwọt utọ ñkpa a-anye adiikpa.<verse eid="JHN 12:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 12:34" />Atu awo emaesio uyio ete, “Ñnyịn imikop ito Mbed ite ke Krais adiiba ke nsi-nsi, afo anam die abo, <char style="wj">‘Eyaeben Ayịn Awo edọọk ke anyọñ’?</char> Anie ido ‘Ayịn Awo’ ami?”<verse eid="JHN 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 12:35" />Ndin Yisọs amaabo ammọ ate, <char style="wj">“Ndufo eyaekaa iso ekịt unwana ke etək-etək ini. Isaña idaha unwana abaaha do, mbemiso ekịm ifʌk ndufo. Awo a-asañake ke ekịm idiọọñọke nte anye aka.</char> <verse eid="JHN 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 12:36" /><char style="wj">Ibuọt idem ke unwana ke ini ndufo enieghe unwana, nọ ato do ndufo ekappa nditọ unwana.” Ke ini Yisọs amaaketañ ikọ ami ama, anye amaakpọñ itie ado anyʌñ asop ammọ ke anyen.</char><verse eid="JHN 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Adinịm ye Unana Adinịm ke Akpanikọ ke Atu mme Yuu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 12:37" />Akpesʌkado a-Yisọs amaakenam afịd utịppeñkpọ ye idiọọñọ ami ke iso ammọ, ammọ ikisʌkkọ inenịm anye ke akpanikọ. <verse eid="JHN 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 12:38" />Ami akedo adinam ikọ prọfed Aisaiya asu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:38">“<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, anie awo inịm mbʌk ñnyịn ke akpanikọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:38">ñko, anie awo ke eyaara ubọk <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ewọt?”<verse eid="JHN 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 12:39" />Ke ntak ami ammọ ikikanna inịm ke akpanikọ sia nte Aisaiya atañña ke itie mfen:<verse eid="JHN 12:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 12:40" />“Anye akịm ammọ anyen, anyʌñ asọñ ammọ esịd,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">anam ammọ ikanna ikịt ñkpọ ke anyen ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">ñkpọ inyʌññọ ikan inwaña ammọ ke esịd ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">inyʌññọ ima ikappa esịd</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">nọ ñkpekọk ammọ.”<verse eid="JHN 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 12:41" />Aisaiya aketañ ikọ ami sia anye amaakịt ubọọñ Yisọs anyʌñ atañ ikọ abaña anye.<verse eid="JHN 12:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 12:42" />Kpayeado uwak awo ke atu mme adaiwuod emaenịm anye ke akpanikọ. Ado ke ntak mme Farisi ammọ ikikanna iwọt mbuọdidem ammọ anwa-anwa mbaak edisio ammọ ke sinakọk, <verse eid="JHN 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 12:43" />sia ammọ ekemaaha itooro awo ekan itooro Abasi.<verse eid="JHN 12:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 12:44" />Ndin Yisọs amaabọọñ ke akpọsọñ uyio ate, <char style="wj">“Awo akeedodo annịmme miin ke akpanikọ, innịmme miin ikpọọñ ke akpanikọ, ado anịm andikindọñ miin ñko ke akpanikọ.</char> <verse eid="JHN 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 12:45" /><char style="wj">Awo añkịtte miin, akịt andikindọñ miin.</char> <verse eid="JHN 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 12:46" /><char style="wj">Ami ndi ke ederimbod nte unwana nọ ato do awo annịmme miin ke akpanikọ akuuba ke ekịm.</char><verse eid="JHN 12:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 12:47" />
    <char style="wj">“Ama ado awo a-akoppo ikọ mmi ado inamma, ami mbiereke ikpe nnọ awo ado. Sia ami ñkidiighe adibiide ikpe nnọọ ederimbod, ado ñkedi adinyaaña ederimbod.</char> <verse eid="JHN 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 12:48" /><char style="wj">Akpeikpe aba anọ awo a-ansịnne miin, i-imiinyʌññọ inịm ikọ mmi ke akpanikọ; kpa mme ikọ a-ami ntañña ediido ubiomikpe inọ ammọ ke akpatre usen.</char> <verse eid="JHN 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 12:49" /><char style="wj">Sia ami ñketañña ke adudu idem mmi, ado Ete a-akendọññọ amannọ miin ewʌhọ ate ntañ afịd se ami ntañ ye naña ntañ anye.</char> <verse eid="JHN 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 12:50" /><char style="wj">Ami mmediọọñọ ke ewʌhọ amọ adat awo akesịm uwem nsi-nsi. Ke ntoro se adodo a-ami ntañña ado se Ete abo yak ntañ.”</char><verse eid="JHN 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JHN 13" />
  <para style="s1">Yisọs Ayet mme Mbed Amọ Ukod</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 13:1" />Akedo ke idaha ekeyemme itọọñọ Usọrọ Nsaña Mboiyo. Yisọs amaadiọọñọ ke ini amaakem anye adikpọñ uwem ami mbịne Ete amọ. Sia anye amaakema ikọd amọ e-ekebaññake ke ederimbod, anye amaama ammọ akewuọ akpatre.<verse eid="JHN 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 13:2" />Ekesʌk edia ndidia ndubi, ndin Setan amaadọdʌk esịd Yudas Iskariọd, ayịn Saimọn aditap Yisọs. <verse eid="JHN 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 13:3" />Yisọs amaadiọọñọ ke Ete amaayaak afịd ñkpọ asịn ke adudu imọ, ñko ke imọ ikito Abasi idi, idiinyʌñ inyọñ ibịne Abasi. <verse eid="JHN 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 13:4" />Ndin anye amaadakka ada ke itie ndidia, asio anyọñ afọñidem, adat tọwịd akịne ke isịn. <verse eid="JHN 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 13:5" />Akema anye amaatọkkọ mmọọñ asịn ke besịn, atọọñọ adiyet mbed amọ ukod keedekeed anyʌñ akama tọwịd a-anye akekịneke ke isịn akwokko ammọ ukod.<verse eid="JHN 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 13:6" />Akediwuọ itie Saimọn Pita, anye amaabịp anye, “Abọọñ, afo ayem iñyet miin ukod?”<verse eid="JHN 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 13:7" />Yisọs amaabọọrọ anye ate, <char style="wj">“Se ami nnam idahami unwañake fiin, ado ke ini iso ayaunwaña.”</char><verse eid="JHN 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 13:8" />Pita amaafaaña ate, “Iyoo, tutu amama, ndiiyakka afo añyet miin ukod.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 13:8">Yisọs amaabọọrọ, <char style="wj">“Ami mmuuyette fiin ukod awuọñọ ke afo unieghe ewuana ndomokeed ye ami.”</char><verse eid="JHN 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 13:9" />Saimọn Pita amaabọọrọ Yisọs ate, “Sia adooho ntoro, Abọọñ, kuñyet ukod kpọd, ado ñyet ubọk mme iwuod kọrọ.”<verse eid="JHN 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 13:10" />Yisọs amaabọọrọ anye ate, <char style="wj">“Mbon e-emaekeyeyie idem inieghe ntak adimaana ñyie afịd idem, eyie ukod kpọd; afịd idem ammọ asasana. Ndin afo amesana, akpesʌkado idooho afịd ndufo esana.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 13:11" />Sia anye amaadiọọñọ awo a-adiitap anye, ntak ado akenam anye abo ke idooho afịd ammọ esana.<verse eid="JHN 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 13:12" />Ke anye amaakeyet ammọ ukod ama, anye amaaben afọñ amọ asịne, atịmme aketie ke itie amọ. Ndin anye amaabịp ammọ ate, <char style="wj">“Inwaña se nnam ado inọọ ndufo?</char> <verse eid="JHN 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 13:13" /><char style="wj">Ndufo eñkoot miin ‘Andikpeeb’ ye ‘Abọọñ,’ emenen ñko sia se ami ndo ado ado.</char> <verse eid="JHN 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 13:14" /><char style="wj">Idahado a-ami, Abọọñ ye Andikpeeb ndufo iyette ndufo ukod, ana ndufo ñko eduyette emọ-emọ ukod.</char> <verse eid="JHN 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 13:15" /><char style="wj">Mminọ ndufo uwọdñkpọ nte enam ukem-ukem naña ami nnam inọọ ndufo.</char> <verse eid="JHN 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 13:16" /><char style="wj">Ke ataa akpanikọ ke ami ntañ inọọ ndufo, ayịnufọk ndomokeed ikponno ikan eteufọk amọ, isʌñutom inyʌññọ ikpon ikan awo andikidọñ anye utom.</char> <verse eid="JHN 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 13:17" /><char style="wj">Idaha ndufo imaidiọọñọ mme ñkpọ ami, eyaidiọñ ndufo imaiben isịn ke adinam.</char><verse eid="JHN 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisọs Ababak Atañ ke Eyaetap Anye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 13:18" />
    <char style="wj">“Idooho afịd ndufo ke ntañ mbaña sia mmediọọñọ mbon se ami mmek. Ado nọ ikọ Abasi e-ekewette asu, ‘Anye a-akewanake ubọk ndidia ye ami akanna ada añnwana miin.’</char><verse eid="JHN 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 13:19" />
    <char style="wj">“Nnam ndufo ediọọñọ idahami, mbaak amaatịppe ndufo enịm ke akpanikọ ke ami ndo anye ami ndooho.</char> <verse eid="JHN 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 13:20" /><char style="wj">Ke ataa akpanikọ ami ntañ inọ ndufo, awo akeedodo a-anyịmmeke awo a-ami ndọññọ añnyịmme miin; awo akeedodo anyʌññọ añnyịmme miin, anyịmme anye a-akendọññọ miin.”</char><verse eid="JHN 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 13:21" />Ke Yisọs amaaketañ ami ama, sịbidịd amọ amaatịmede, ndin anye amaabo, <char style="wj">“Ke ataa akpanikọ ami ntañ inọ ndufo, keed ke atu ndufo ayantap miin.”</char><verse eid="JHN 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 13:22" />Mme mbed amọ emaeduseere emọ-emọ ke ñkpaidem, enyʌñ ekere me anie ke anye atañ abaña. <verse eid="JHN 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 13:23" />Keed ke atu mme mbed, anye a-Yisọs akemaaha, aketie adiana anye. <verse eid="JHN 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 13:24" />Ndin Saimọn Pita amaatappa mbed ado abo anye, “Bịp anye me anie ke anye atañ abaña.”<verse eid="JHN 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 13:25" />Ndin mbed ado akenyʌkkọ abere Yisọs, amaabịp anye ate, “Abọọñ, anie ke ado?”<verse eid="JHN 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 13:26" />Yisọs amaabọọrọ, <char style="wj">“Awo se ami ndiinọ uyo a-ami ndiideep ke usan.”</char> Ndin anye akedeep uyo ke usan amaayaak anọ Yudas, ayịn Saimọn Iskariọd. <verse eid="JHN 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 13:27" />Ke ndo-ndo ado Yudas akebọọhọ uyo, Setan amaadʌk anye idem.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 13:27">Yisọs amaabo Yudas ate, <char style="wj">“Se afo ayem adinam, sọp idem nam.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 13:28" />Ado awo ndomokeed ke itie ndidia ado ikidiọọñọke ntak a-Yisọs aketañña ikọ ami ye anye. <verse eid="JHN 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 13:29" />Sia Yudas akedooho akama ekpad akʌk ammọ, usʌk ammọ ekekere ke Yisọs akebo anye akedep ñkpọ se ediikama inam Usọrọ Nsaña Mboiyo, me adiyem ñkpọ nnọọ mbon uweene. <verse eid="JHN 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 13:30" />Yudas akesʌk abọbọ uyo ado, anye amaawuọ. Ndin ayio amaakịm.<verse eid="JHN 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisọs Ababak Atañ Abaña Pita Adikañ Imọ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 13:31" />Ke Yudas amaakewuọ, Yisọs amaabo, <char style="wj">“Idahami, Ayịn Awo a-abọ ubọọñ, Abasi ñko a-abọ ubọọñ ato anye.</char> <verse eid="JHN 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 13:32" /><char style="wj">Adieke Abasi abọọhọ ubọọñ ato anye,</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ata uwak ñkaan ikpañwed inieghe </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Adieke Abasi abọọhọ ubọọñ ato anye</char></note> <char style="wj">Abasi ayaanọ Ayịn ubọọñ ke idem amọ, ndin ayaanọ anye ubọọñ ado ini keed.</char><verse eid="JHN 13:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 13:33" />
    <char style="wj">“Nditọ mmi, ami ndiiba ye ndufo ke etək-etək ini. Ndufo eyaeñyem miin, ado kpa naña ami ñkedọkkọ mme Yuu, mmidọkkọ ndufo ñko idahami: Itie nte ami ñka ndufo idiikanna idi.</char><verse eid="JHN 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 13:34" />
    <char style="wj">“Ufa ewʌhọ ke ami inọọ ndufo: Ima emọ-emọ. Kpa naña ami ima ndufo, ana ndufo ñko ema emọ-emọ.</char> <verse eid="JHN 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 13:35" /><char style="wj">Imainam ntom, afịd awo eyaediọọñọ ke ndufo edo mme mbed mmi, imaidumakka idem ndufo.”</char><verse eid="JHN 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 13:36" />Saimọn Pita amaabịp anye ate, “Abọọñ, afo ayem adika uke?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 13:36">Yisọs amaabọọrọ ate, <char style="wj">“Itie nte ami ñyem adika, afo uduukanna uñkeene idahami, ado amaamaana ko ayañkeene.”</char><verse eid="JHN 13:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 13:37" />Pita amaabịp anye ate, “Abọọñ, ntak i-imiidooho se ami ñkan ukeene fiin idahami-e? Ami mmebeeñe idem adiduọọk uwem mmi ke ntak mfo.”<verse eid="JHN 13:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 13:38" />Yisọs amaabọọrọ anye, <char style="wj">“Amenekke abeeñe idem adiduọọk uwem mfo ke ntak mmi? Ke ataa akpanikọ ke ami ntañ unọ fiin, mbemiso akikọunen akpọk, afo ayañkañ miin ukpa ita!</char><verse eid="JHN 13:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JHN 14" />
  <para style="s1">Yisọs Adọñ Mbed Amọ Esịd</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 14:1" />
    <char style="wj">“Ikiiyak esịd ndufo atịmede. Ndufo emenịm Abasi ke akpanikọ; innịm miin ñko ke akpanikọ.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 14:2" /><char style="wj">Ke ufọk Ete mmi uwak ubeed ebañña; imiikpidooho ntoro, ami ñkpaakidọkkọ ndufo.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 14:3" /><char style="wj">Ami ñka adikitʌm itie inọọ ndufo, ami ñyaatịmme ndi ndiben ndufo nnọ idem mmi, nọ ndufo eba ye ami ke itie nte ami mba.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 14:4" /><char style="wj">Ndufo emediọọñọ usʌñ itie nte ami ñka.”</char><verse eid="JHN 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisọs Ado Usʌñ e-Esañake Ebịne Ete</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 14:5" />Tọmọs amaabo anye, “Abọọñ, ñnyịn idiọọñọke nte afo akaa, ñnyịn idiinam die idiọọñọ usʌñ?”<verse eid="JHN 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 14:6" />Yisọs amaabọọrọ anye: <char style="wj">“Ami ndo usʌñ ye akpanikọ ye uwem. Awo ndomokeed idiighe ibịne Ete ibọhọke anto miin.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 14:7" /><char style="wj">Adieke ndufo enekkeke endiọọñọ miin, eyaediọọñọ Ete mmi ñko. Tọọñọ ke idahami, ndufo emediọọñọ anye enyʌñ ekịt anye.”</char><verse eid="JHN 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 14:8" />Filib amaabo, “Abọọñ, iwọt ñnyịn Ete, ndin ñnyịn iyaiyʌkkọ.”<verse eid="JHN 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 14:9" />Ndin Yisọs amaabo, <char style="wj">“Nte ami mmekeme iba ye ndufo afịd anyan ini ami, Filib, ndin afo usʌkkọ undiọọñọ miin? Awo akeedodo añkịtte miin akịt Ete, ndin ndufo ekpenam die ebo, ‘Iwọt ñnyịn Ete’?</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 14:10" /><char style="wj">Nte ndufo inịmme ke ami mba ke Ete, Ete aba ñko ke ami? Se ami ntañ inọọ ndufo intooho miin. Ado Ete andʌññọ miin ke idem anam utom amọ.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 14:11" /><char style="wj">Innịm miin ke akpanikọ ami mmaabo ke ami mba ke Ete, Ete ñko anyʌñ aba ke ami, imiidooho inịm ke ntak mme utịppeñkpọ a-ndufo ekịtte.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 14:12" /><char style="wj">Ke ataa akpanikọ ami ntañ inọ ndufo, awo akeedodo annịmme miin ke akpanikọ ayaanam mme ukem utom a-ami nnamma mi, eyaenyʌñ enam mme ñkpọ se ikan ami, sia ami ñka mbịne Ete.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 14:13" /><char style="wj">Ami ñyaanam se idodo a-ndufo ebeeñeke ke anyịñ mmi, nọ ato do Ete abọ itooro ato Ayịn.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 14:14" /><char style="wj">Ndufo emekeme adibeeñe ñkpọ akeedodo ke anyịñ mmi, ndin ami ñyaanam.”</char><verse eid="JHN 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisọs Anwọñọ Adinọ Adisana Sịbidịd</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 14:15" />
    <char style="wj">“Akpedo ndufo ememma miin, inịm mbed mmi.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 14:16" /><char style="wj">Ndin ami ñyaabeeñe Ete, ndin anye ayainọ ndufo idọñesịd mfen adiiba ye ndufo ke nsi-nsi,</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 14:17" /><char style="wj">Sịbidịd akpanikọ. Ederimbod idiiyemme anye, sia ammọ idiọọñọke inyʌññọ ikịt anye. Ado ndufo emediọọñọ anye, sia anye adʌñ ke idem ndufo, anye adiiba ye ndufo ñko.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 14:18" /><char style="wj">Ami ndiikpọññọ ndufo nte nditọ akpa; ami ñyaadi ibịne ndufo.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 14:19" /><char style="wj">Ke etək ini, ederimbod idiiñkịtte miin aba, ado ndufo eyaeñkịt miin. Sia ami mmedu uwem ndin ndufo ñko eyaedu uwem.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 14:20" /><char style="wj">Ke usen ado ndufo eyaediọọñọ ke ami mba ke Ete, kpa naña ndufo eba ke ami, ami ñko mba ke ndufo.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 14:21" /><char style="wj">Awo akeedodo a-abọọhọ mme mbed mmi anyʌñ anịm ammọ, anye ado awo a-ammaaha miin. Awo a-ammaaha miin, Ete mmi ayaama anye, ndin ami ñko ñyaama anye ñnyʌñ ñyaara idem mmi nnọ anye.”</char><verse eid="JHN 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 14:22" />Akem Yudas, (idooho Yudas Iskariọd) amaabo anye, “Abọọñ, nsoo ido nọ afo aduak adiwọt ñnyịn idem ado uwọttọ ederimbod?”<verse eid="JHN 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 14:23" />Yisọs amaabọọrọ ate, <char style="wj">“Awo keed akeedodo ammaaha miin ayaanam ukpeebñkpọ mmi, ndin Ete mmi ayaama ammọ, ndin ñnyịn iyaididʌñ ye ammọ.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 14:24" /><char style="wj">Awo ndomokeed i-imiimmaaha miin idiinịmme ukpeebñkpọ mmi. Mme ikọ a-ndufo ekoppo idooho ake mmi; ado ikọ Ete a-akendọññọ miin.</char><verse eid="JHN 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 14:25" />
    <char style="wj">“Ami mmetañ afịd mme ñkpọ ami inọ ndufo ke ini ami nsʌkkọ mba mi ye ndufo.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 14:26" /><char style="wj">Ado Idọñesịd, Adisana Sịbidịd, ake Ete adiidọñ ke anyịñ mmi ayaikpeep ndufo afịd ñkpọ anyʌñ itoiyo ndufo afịd se ami ñketañ inọọ ndufo.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 14:27" /><char style="wj">Emem ke ami ñkpọñ inọọ ndufo; emem mmi ke ami inọọ ndufo. Ami inọọhọ ndufo naña ederimbod inọọ. Ikiiyak esịd ndufo etịmede, ikiinyʌñ ikop ndịk.</char><verse eid="JHN 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 14:28" />
    <char style="wj">“Ndufo emekop naña ami mbo: ‘Ami ñyaikpọñ, ñyaanyʌñ ntịmme ibịne ndufo.’ Akpedo ndufo emaemma miin, esịd akpainem ndufo ke ami ñka mbịne Ete, sia Ete a-akpon añkan miin.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 14:29" /><char style="wj">Ami mmidọkkọ ndufo idahami, mbemiso ñkpọ ami adat itie, ndin amaatịppe ndufo eyaennịm ke akpanikọ.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 14:30" /><char style="wj">Ami ndiitañña uwak ikọ aba inọ ndufo sia idiọọk adidem ederimbod ami asʌk adi. Anye inieghe adudu ke idem mmi,</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 14:31" /><char style="wj">ado anye adi nọ ederimbod ediọọñọ ke ami mmema Ete ñnyʌñ nnam ukem-ukem se Ete annọ ewʌhọ abo nnam.</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 14:31">
    <char style="wj">“Ndufo idi ndin, yak ñnyịn ika.”</char><verse eid="JHN 14:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JHN 15" />
  <para style="s1">Eto Fain ye mme Ñkọk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 15:1" />
    <char style="wj">“Ami ndo ataa eto fain, ndin Ete mmi ado atọinwañ.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 15:2" /><char style="wj">Anye akpịkke afịd ñkọk ke idem mmi imiinwịmme mfịd, ado afịd ñkọk se inwịm mfịd anye anekke adiọñ</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke usem Greek </char><char style="fq" closed="false">anye anekke adiọñ</char><char style="ft" closed="false">ke ufañ ami asʌk awuọñọ </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">anye anam asana</char></note> <char style="wj">nọ anenekke anwịm uwak mfịd.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 15:3" /><char style="wj">Ndufo emesasana ke ntak ikọ a-ami ñketañña inọọ ndufo.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 15:4" /><char style="wj">Indʌñ miin ke idem, naña ami idʌñ ndufo ke idem. Ñkọk ndomokeed ikemeke adinwịm mfịd ke idem amọ, ibọhọke anye ayịre ke fain. Ndufo ñko idiikanna inwịm mfịd ibọhọke endʌñ miin ke idem.</char><verse eid="JHN 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 15:5" />
    <char style="wj">“Ami ndo eto fain, ndufo edo mme ñkọk. Ndufo ekpedʌñ ke ami, ami ñnyʌñ ndʌñ ke ndufo, eyaenwịm uwak mfịd. Ekpensio miin efep ndufo idiikanna inam ñkpọ ndomokeed.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 15:6" /><char style="wj">Awo akeedodo i-imiidʌññọ ke ami aba nte ñkọk e-ekpịkkeke nọ ana asaat, e-ekoonoke etop edọñ ke ikañ enyʌñ efọọmọ.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 15:7" /><char style="wj">Ndufo ikpidʌñ ke ami ndin ikọ mmi isịne ndufo ke idem, ibeñe se eyeyem ndin eyainọ ndufo.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 15:8" /><char style="wj">Ubọọñ Ete mmi ado ami, ate ndufo enwịm uwak mfịd, ke adiwọt idem ndufo nte mme mbed mmi.</char><verse eid="JHN 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 15:9" />
    <char style="wj">“Naña Ete mmi amma miin, kpa ntoro ke ami ima ndufo, ke ntoro ibono ke ima mmi.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 15:10" /><char style="wj">Ndufo ekpenịm mme mbed mmi, eyaebono ke ima mmi, kpa naña ami nnịm mbed Ete mmi ñnyʌñ mba ke ima amọ.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 15:11" /><char style="wj">Mmetañ ami inọ ndufo nọ idaara mmi aba ye ndufo, ñko nọ idaara ndufo ayọhọ.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 15:12" /><char style="wj">Mbed mmi ado ami: Ima emọ-emọ naña ami ima ndufo.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 15:13" /><char style="wj">Awo ndomokeed inieghe ima a-akponno akan ami: Awo adisaana uwem amọ ñyaak ke ntak mme ufan amọ.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 15:14" /><char style="wj">Ndufo edo mme ufan mmi ikpinam se mbo ndufo enam.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 15:15" /><char style="wj">Ami ikoodo ndufo nditọufọk aba sia ayịnufọk idiọọñọke ndubeghe eteufọk. Ado ami ikoot ndufo mme ufan, sia ami mmenam ndufo ediọọñọ afịd ñkpọ se ñkekpeep nto Ete mmi.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 15:16" /><char style="wj">Idooho ndufo ekemmek miin, ado ami ñkimek ndufo nte ekaiya enyʌñ ekenwịm mfịd, mfịd a-adiikpeene, ndin se ndufo ekpebebeeñe ke anyịñ mmi, Ete mmi ayainọ ndufo.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 15:17" /><char style="wj">Mbed mmi ado: Ima emọ-emọ.”</char><verse eid="JHN 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ederimbod Esuasua mme Mbed</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 15:18" />
    <char style="wj">“Ederimbod akpisua ndufo idiọọñọ ibo ke ederimbod amaatoto ansua miin.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 15:19" /><char style="wj">Akpedo ndufo ekedo mbon ederimbod, ederimbod akpaima ndufo nte ake amọ. Ado ndufo idooho ake ederimbod, sia ami mmimek ndufo nsio ke ederimbod. Ado anam ederimbod isua ndufo.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 15:20" /><char style="wj">Itoiyo ikọ se ami ñketañ inọọ ndufo: ‘Ayịnufọk ikponno ikan eteufọk.’ Adieke ammọ ekeñkọbọke miin, ammọ eyaikọbọ ndufo ñkọ. Adieke ammọ ekekpañña utọñ enọ ukpeebñkpọ mmi, ammọ eyaekpañ utọñ enọ ake ndufo ñko.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 15:21" /><char style="wj">Ammọ ediinam ntom ye ndufo ke ntak anyịñ mmi, sia ammọ idiọọñọke andikindọñ miin.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 15:22" /><char style="wj">Akpedo ami ñkidiighe nditañ nnọ ammọ, ammọ ikpinieghe ubiomikpe ke idiọọkñkpọ; ado idahami, ammọ inieghe mfaaña ndomokeed ibaña idiọọkñkpọ ammọ.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 15:23" /><char style="wj">Awo akeedodo ansuaha miin a-asua Ete mmi ñko.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 15:24" /><char style="wj">Akpedo ami ñkenamma ke ufọọd ammọ se awo mfen imiikinamma, ammọ ikpinieghe ubiomikpe. Ado naña aba ami, ammọ ekịt mme utịppeñkpọ, ado esʌk ensuasua miin ye Ete mmi.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 15:25" /><char style="wj">Ami ado adinam nọ se ewet ke Mbed ammọ asu: ‘Ammọ ekensua miin ke unana ntak.’</char><verse eid="JHN 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Utom Adisana Sịbidịd</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 15:26" />
    <char style="wj">“Ke ini Abọọrọikọnnọọ amaadi, a-ami ndiinọ ato Ete isọk ndufo, Sịbidịd akpanikọ a-atooho Ete awuọ, anye ayaatie ntiense ambaña miin.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 15:27" /><char style="wj">Ndufo ñko ana etie ntiense embaña miin sia ndufo emeba ye ami tọọñọ ke aditọọñọ.”</char><verse eid="JHN 15:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JHN 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 16:1" />
    <char style="wj">“Ami ntañ afịd ami inọ ndufo, mbaak ndufo idiwuọ ikpọñ usʌñ.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 16:2" /><char style="wj">Eyaibịn ndufo esio ke sinakọk. Ke akpanikọ ini ayaadi adiido awo akeedodo a-adiiwot ndufo adiikere ke inam utom Abasi.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 16:3" /><char style="wj">Ammọ ediinam mme ñkpọ ami sia ammọ idiọọñọke Ete, inyʌññọ indiọọñọ miin.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 16:4" /><char style="wj">Ami mmidọkkọ ndufo mme ñkpọ ami, mbaak ini amaakem ndufo etoiyo ke mmaidʌt ndufo utọñ mbaña ammọ. Ami ñkibakka idọkkọ ndufo ke ntọọñọ sia mmọdo ñkeba ye ndufo,</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 16:5" /><char style="wj">ado idahami, ami ñyaanyọñ mbịne anye a-akendọññọ miin, ado ndufo ndomokeed imbịppe miin ibo ‘Afo uduuka uke?’</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 16:6" /><char style="wj">Utu ke ado, esịd ndufo ayọhọ ye mfʌhọ sia mmetañ mme ikọ ami inọ ndufo.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 16:7" /><char style="wj">Ado ke ataa akpanikọ ke ami ntañ inọọ ndufo, ado ke ufọn ndufo ke ami ñka. Ami mmiikpọññọ ndufo, Anọitem idiidiighe ibịne ndufo; ado adieke ami ñkaaha, ami ñyaanọ anye isọk ndufo.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 16:8" /><char style="wj">Anye amaadi, anye ayaanam mbon ederimbod ediọọñọ ke ikiba ke ukwañ ke abaña idiọọkñkpọ ye adinenido ye ubiideikpe:</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 16:9" /><char style="wj">Ke ntak idiọọkñkpọ, sia mme awo innịmme miin ke akpanikọ;</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 16:10" /><char style="wj">ke abaña adinenido sia ami ñyaanyọñ mbịne Ete, ndin ndufo idiiñkịtte miin aba,</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 16:11" /><char style="wj">ñko ke ntak ubiideikpe, sia akpan abọọñ ederimbod ami aba ke ubiomikpe.</char><verse eid="JHN 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 16:12" />
    <char style="wj">“Ami nsʌk nnenie uwak ñkpọ adineme inọọ ndufo, a-awakka akan se ndufo ediikan iyọ idahami.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 16:13" /><char style="wj">Ado Sịbidịd akpanikọ amaadi, anye ayaiwọt usʌñ afịd akpanikọ. Anye idiitañña ikọ idem amọ, adiitañ se anye akop kpọd, anye ayaidọkkọ ndufo se idiidi ke ini iso.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 16:14" /><char style="wj">Anye ayaannọ miin ubọọñ sia anye ayaaben se into miin iwọt ndufo.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 16:15" /><char style="wj">Afịd se inie Ete annie miin. Ntak ado anam ami mbo ke Sịbidịd ayaaben afịd se into miin iwọt ndufo.”</char><verse eid="JHN 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mfʌhọ mme Mbed Ayaakappa Idaara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 16:16" />Akema, Yisọs amaabo ammọ ate <char style="wj">“Ke etək-etək ini ndufo idiñkịtte miin aba, ke etək-etək ini ñko eyaemaana eñkịt miin.”</char><verse eid="JHN 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 16:17" />Usʌk mme mbed emaebo emọ-emọ ete, “Awuọñọ die anye adibo, <char style="wj">‘Ke etək-etək ini ndufo idiñkịtte miin aba, ke etək-etək ini ñko eyaemaana eñkịt miin,’</char> ye adibo, <char style="wj">‘Sia ami ñka mbịne Ete?’ ”</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 16:18" />Ammọ emaekọbọ ebịp, “Nsoo ke anye atañ abaña ke adibo <char style="wj">‘ke etək-etək ini’</char>? Inwañake ñnyịn se anye atañ abaña.”<verse eid="JHN 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 16:19" />Yisọs amaadiọọñọ ke ammọ eyem adimaana ibịp imọ ibaña mme ñkpọ ami, ndin anye amaabo ammọ ate, <char style="wj">“Ndufo ebịp emọ-emọ ebaña se ñketañ mbo, ‘ke etək-etək ini ndufo idiñkịtte miin aba, ndin ke etək-etək ini amaaboiyo ñko ndufo eyaemaana eñkịt’ awuọọñọ?</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 16:20" /><char style="wj">Ke ataa akpanikọ ami ntañ inọ ndufo, ndufo eyaetuaha enyʌñ efʌhọ ke ini mbon ederimbod edarakedaara. Ndufo eyaefʌhọ ado mfʌhọ ndufo ayaakappa ado idaara.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 16:21" /><char style="wj">Awonwaan uman akop ubiak sia ini uman amọ akem, ado ayịn amaamamana anye afre abaña ubiak ado, ke ntak idaara ke ayịn amana adʌk ederimbod.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 16:22" /><char style="wj">Ukem ado ke ado ye ndufo: Idahami ado ini mfʌhọ ke esịd ndufo, ado ñyaamaana ikịt ndufo, ndin ndufo eyaedaara, idiibaaha awo a-adiikan iben idaara ndufo ifep.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 16:23" /><char style="wj">Ini ado amaakem, ndufo idimbịppe miin ñkpọ ndomokeed. Ke ataa akpanikọ, ami ntañ inọ ndufo, Ete mmi ayainọ ndufo ñkpọ akeedodo a-ndufo ebeeñeke ke anyịñ mmi.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 16:24" /><char style="wj">Kpaanam ndufo imbeeñeke ñkpọ ndomokeed ke anyịñ mmi. Ibeeñe ke eyaebọ, ndin idaara ndufo ayaayọhọ</char>.<verse eid="JHN 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 16:25" />
    <char style="wj">“Akpesʌkado a-ami ntañña ikọ inọọ ndufo ke ñke, ini ayaadi a-ami mmiidikamake ñke ntañ ikọ aba, ado ndiitañ inwañ-inwañ inọ ndufo mbaña Ete mmi.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 16:26" /><char style="wj">Ini ado amaakem, ndufo eyaebeeñe ñkpọ ke anyịñ mmi. Mbooho ke ami ndibeeñe Ete inọ ndufo.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 16:27" /><char style="wj">Iyoo, Ete ke idem-idem amọ i-ima ndufo, sia ndufo ememma miin enyʌñ enịm ke ami ñketo Abasi ndi.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 16:28" /><char style="wj">Ami ñketo Ete ndidʌk ederimbod; idahami ami ñyaakpọñ ederimbod ntịmme mbịne Ete mmi.”</char><verse eid="JHN 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 16:29" />Mme mbed Yisọs emaebo anye ete, “Idahami, afo atañ ikọ inwañ-inwañ, utañña ke ñke aba. <verse eid="JHN 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 16:30" />Idahami ñnyịn imikịt ke afo amediọọñọ afịd ñkpọ, ke ufọn ibaaha awo adubịp fiin mbuume. Ami anam ñnyịn inịm ke afo aketo Abasi adi.”<verse eid="JHN 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 16:31" />Yisọs amaabọọrọ ammọ ate, <char style="wj">“Ndufo emenịm ndin? </char> <verse eid="JHN 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 16:32" /><char style="wj">Ado ini ayaadi, anyʌñ adidi ama a-ndufo ediisuana, anie afañ awaak adʌk. Eyaefeeñe eñkpọñ miin ikpọọñ. Ado ami mbaaha ikpọọñ, sia Ete mmi mmọdo ye ami.</char><verse eid="JHN 16:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 16:33" />
    <char style="wj">“Ami idọkkọ ndufo mme ñkpọ ami, nọ ndufo enie emem ke ami. Ke ederimbod ami ndufo eyaekịt ukuud. Ado isọñ esịd! Ami mmekan ederimbod.”</char><verse eid="JHN 16:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JHN 17" />
  <para style="s1">Yisọs Abọñ Akam Anọ Idem Amọ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 17:1" />Ke Yisọs amaaketañ ikọ ami ama, anye amaadịppe anyen ase hefịn anyʌñ abọñ akam ate:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="JHN 17:1">
    <char style="wj">“Ete, ini akem afo adinọ Ayịn mfo ubọọñ nọ Ayịn mfo unọ fiin ubọọñ.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 17:2" /><char style="wj">Sia afo ameyaak adudu adikara afịd awo anọ anye nọ anye anọ afịd mbon a-afo akenọọhọ anye nsi-nsi uwem.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 17:3" /><char style="wj">Ndin nsi-nsi uwem ado ami: Ammọ adudiọọñọ fiin, ukweeñe-ukweeñe Abasi akpanikọ, ye Yisọs Krais a-afo akenọọhọ adi.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 17:4" /><char style="wj">Ami mmunọ fiin ubọọñ ke isọñ ke adikweeñe utom a-afo akendọññọ abo nnam.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 17:5" /><char style="wj">Ete, nnọ miin ubọọñ idahami ke iso mfo, ukem ubọọñ ami ñkenieghe ye afo mbemiso ederimbod atọọñọ.</char><verse eid="JHN 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisọs Abọñ Akam Anọ mme Mbed Amọ</para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 17:6" />
    <char style="wj">“Ami mmeyaara anyịñ mfo nnọ mbon a-afo akesioho ke ederimbod annọọ. Ammọ ekedo ake mfo; afo akeben ammọ annọọ, ndin ammọ e-ekpono ikọ mfo.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 17:7" /><char style="wj">Idahami ammọ ediọọñọ ke afịd se afo akennoọ akuto fiin.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 17:8" /><char style="wj">Sia ami mmaanọ ammọ ikọ a-afo akennọọhọ miin ndin ammọ emaebọ. Ammọ emaediọọñọ ke ataa ayọhọ-ayọhọ akpanikọ ete ke ami ñkuto fiin ndi, ndin ammọ emaenịm ke afo akendọñ miin.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 17:9" /><char style="wj">Ami mbọñ akam mbaña ammọ, mbọññọ mbaña ederimbod, ado mbọñ mbaña mbon se afo akennọọ miin sia ammọ edo ake mfo. </char> <verse eid="JHN 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 17:10" /><char style="wj">Afịd se ami nnie ado ake mfo, ñko afịd se afo anie ado ake mmi. Ndin itooro a-ato ammọ ansịm miin.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 17:11" /><char style="wj">Ami ndiibaaha aba ke ederimbod, ado ammọ esʌk ebaba ke ederimbod, sia ami ñyaanyọñ ubịne fiin. Adisana Ete, dat adudu anyịñ mfo kpeme ammọ, anyịñ a-afo akennọọhọ miin nọ ammọ edo keed kpa naña ñnyịn ido keed.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 17:12" /><char style="wj">Idaha a-ami ñkebaaha ye ammọ, ami mmaakpeme ammọ ñnyʌñ ndat anyịñ a-afo akennọọhọ nnịm ammọ ke ifuuro. Ammọ ndomokeed ikisoppo ke imiibọhọke anye e-ekenịmme enọ nsobo nọ ikọ Abasi asu.</char><verse eid="JHN 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 17:13" />
    <char style="wj">“Ami nsʌk ñnyọñ ubịne fiin idahami, ado ntañ mme ñkpọ ami idaha a-ami nsʌkkọ mba ke ederimbod nọ ammọ enie ayọhọ idaara a-antooho miin ke esịd ammọ.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 17:14" /><char style="wj">Mmenọ ammọ ikọ mfo, ado anam ederimbod esua ammọ sia ammọ idooho ake ederimbod, kpa nte ami mmiidooho ake ederimbod.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 17:15" /><char style="wj">Akam mmi idooho nọ afo aben ammọ asio ke ederimbod, ado mbeeñe yak afo akpeme anyʌñ asio ammọ ke ubọk andidiọọk.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 17:16" /><char style="wj">Ammọ idooho ake ederimbod kpa naña ami mmiidooho ake ederimbod.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 17:17" /><char style="wj">Dat akpanikọ mfo nam ammọ esana, ikọ mfo ado akpanikọ.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 17:18" /><char style="wj">Naña afo akennọ miin ndi ederimbod, kpa ntoro ami mmenọ ammọ eka ederimbod.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 17:19" /><char style="wj">Ke ntak ammọ ami mmenam idem mmi asana, nọ ammọ ñko esana ayọhọ-ayọhọ ke akpanikọ.</char><verse eid="JHN 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisọs Abọñ Akam Anọ Afịd Mbon se Inịm ke Akpanikọ</para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 17:20" />
    <char style="wj">“Ami mbọññọ akam ami mbeeñe nnọ ammọ ikpọọñ, ado mmebọñ mbaña mbon e-ediinnịm miin ke akpanikọ ato ke ikọ ntiense ammọ,</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 17:21" /><char style="wj">nọ afịd ammọ edo keed, Ete, ukem naña afo aba ke ami, ami ñnyʌñ mba ke afo. Yak ammọ ñko eba ke ñnyịn nọ ederimbod enịm ke afo akendọñ miin.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 17:22" /><char style="wj">Mmenọ ammọ ubọọñ a-afo akennọọhọ miin nọ ammọ edo keed kpa naña ñnyịn ido keed.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 17:23" /><char style="wj">Ami ke ammọ, afo ke ami, nọ ammọ ediana keed ayọhọ-ayọhọ. Ndin ederimbod eyaediọọñọ ke afo akendọñ miin anyʌñ ama ammọ nte afo ammaaha miin.</char><verse eid="JHN 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 17:24" />
    <char style="wj">“Ete, ami ñyem mbon a-afo annọọhọ miin eba ye ami ke itie a-ami mbaaha nọ ammọ ekịt ubọọñ mmi, ubọọñ a-afo annọọhọ miin sia afo amaamma miin mbemiso afo akebot ederimbod.</char><verse eid="JHN 17:24" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 17:25" />
    <char style="wj">“Adinen Ete, akpekọm a-adooho ederimbod udiọọñọke fiin, ami mmudiọọñọ fiin, ammọ ñko ediọọñọ ke afo akendọñ miin</char>. <verse eid="JHN 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 17:26" /><char style="wj">Ami mmeyaara anyịñ mfo nnọ ammọ ndin ñyaakaa iso uyaara fiin nọ ima a-afo anieghe annọ miin aba ye ammọ ndin ami ke idem mmi mba ye ammọ.”</char><verse eid="JHN 17:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JHN 18" />
  <para style="s1">Emʌm Yisọs</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 18:1" />Ke anye amaakebọñ akam ama, Yisọs amaasaña ye mme mbed amọ aboiyo abedeñ Kidrọn. Inwañ amaaba ke edem uko, ndin anye ye mme mbed amọ emaefrọ ekaa do.<verse eid="JHN 18:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 18:2" />Ndin Yudas, a-aketappa anye, amaadiọọñọ itie ado, sia Yisọs amaasika itie ado ndin-ndin ye mme mbed amọ. <verse eid="JHN 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 18:3" />Yudas amaakaa inwañ ado, adat udịm mbon ekọñ ye mme adaaha a-mme ñkpoon aku ye mme Farisi ekenọọhọ anye. Ammọ emaekaama ikañ emuum, mme utuenikañ, ye mme ñkpọ anwan.<verse eid="JHN 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 18:4" />Sia Yisọs amaakediọọñọ afịd ñkpọ se ikidiitịppe inọ anye, amaasaña awuọ akebịp ammọ ate, <char style="wj">“Anie ke ndufo eyem?”</char><verse eid="JHN 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 18:5" />Ammọ emaebọọrọ ete, “Yisọs, Ayịn Nasared.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:5">Yisọs amaabọọrọ ammọ, <char style="wj">“Ami ndo anye.”</char> (Yudas, andikitap anye mmọdo akeda ye ammọ.) <verse eid="JHN 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 18:6" />Ke Yisọs amaakebo, <char style="wj">“Ami ndo anye,”</char> ammọ emaetiime edem eduọññọ ke isọñ.<verse eid="JHN 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 18:7" />Anye amaamaana abịp ammọ ayọhọ akañ iba ate, <char style="wj">“Ndufo ebo ke iyem anie?”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:7">Ammọ emaebo, “Yisọs, Ayịn Nasared.”<verse eid="JHN 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 18:8" />Yisọs amaabọọrọ ammọ ate, <char style="wj">“Ami mmaatatañ inọ ndufo ke ami ndo anye. Ndin akpedo eñyem miin, iyaak mbon ami enyọñọ.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 18:9" />Anye aketañ ntom nọ ikọ prọfesi amọ asu a-anye akebooho, <char style="wj">“Ami nduọhọ ndomokeed ke atu se afo akennọọ.”</char><verse eid="JHN 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 18:10" />Idahado Saimọn Pita, a-amaakekama akañkañ, amaasio akpi ayịnufọk ekamba aku utọñ nnasia adiañña. (Anyịñ ayịnufọk ado akedo Maalkus.)<verse eid="JHN 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 18:11" />Yisọs amaawuuk Pita ate, <char style="wj">“Sịn afịd mfo ke efọk! Inaaha nte ami ñnwọñ kọọb e-Ete mmi annọọhọ miin?”</char><verse eid="JHN 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 18:12" />Ndin mbon ekọñ ye adaiso ammọ ye etubom mme Yuu emaemʌm Yisọs. Emaebọp anye ubọk <verse eid="JHN 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 18:13" />enyʌñ eben anye ekaa iso Anas, ete anwaan Kaifas, a-akedooho ekamba aku ke isua ado. <verse eid="JHN 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 18:14" />Kaifas akedo awo se ikinọọ mme etubom mme Yuu item abo ke akpaafọn awo keed akpa ke iwuod afịd awo.<verse eid="JHN 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Akpa Ini a-Pita Akañña Yisọs</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 18:15" />Saimọn Pita ye mbed keed mfen emaekeene Yisọs. Sia ekamba aku amaakediọọñọ mbed anye ado, anye amaakeene Yisọs adʌk esịd akwere ekamba aku. <verse eid="JHN 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 18:16" />Ado Pita akena atuak ada ke inuausʌñ. Mbed a-akediọọñọke ekamba aku amaatịmme aditañ ikọ ye awonwaan a-akekpemeke inuaatob, anyʌñ adat Pita adʌk esịd akwere.<verse eid="JHN 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 18:17" />Ayịnufọk awonwaan ado amaabo Pita ate, “Afo ñko udooho keed ke atu mme mbed awo ami?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:17">Pita amaabọọrọ, “Ndooho.”<verse eid="JHN 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 18:18" />Akedo ini atueb, ndin nditọufọk ye mme adaaha ñko emaeda ekanna ewue ikañ a-ammọ ekebarake. Pita amaada do ñko ye ammọ awue ikañ.<verse eid="JHN 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ekamba Aku Abịp Yisọs Mbịme</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 18:19" />Ekamba aku ndin amaabịp Yisọs abaña mme mbed amọ ye ukpeebñkpọ amọ.<verse eid="JHN 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 18:20" />Yisọs amaabọọrọ anye ate, <char style="wj">“Ami mmetañ ikọ anwa-anwa nnọ afịd ederimbod; mmaakpeep mme awo ñkpọ ke mme sinakọk ye ke tembịd, a-mme Yuu ekesisooboke. Mme awo emaekop ikọ mmi, sia ami ñkikpeebe ñkpọ ndomokeed ke ndịbe.</char> <verse eid="JHN 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 18:21" /><char style="wj">Nsoo ndin inam nọ afo ambịp miin mbịme? Akpekap abịp mbon se ikikop ukpeebñkpọ mmi. Ke akpanikọ ammọ e-ediọọñọ afịd se ami ñketañ.”</char><verse eid="JHN 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 18:22" />Ke Yisọs amaaketañ ntom, adaaha ekọñ keed amaasiak anye ufia ate, “Afo abọọrọ ekamba aku ntoro?”<verse eid="JHN 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 18:23" />Yisọs amaabo anye, <char style="wj">“Adieke ami ndueghe se ntañ, ñwọt ndudue ado. Ado akpedo ami ñketañ akpanikọ, nsoo ido ntak a-afo ammiaha miin?”</char> <verse eid="JHN 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 18:24" />Anas ndin amaanọ Yisọs, mme naña ekebọp anye, ate esọk Kaifas, ekamba aku.<verse eid="JHN 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pita Akañ Yisọs Ayọhọ Akañ Iba ye Ita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 18:25" />Saimọn Pita akesʌk ada ke ndo awue ikañ. Ndin ammọ emaebịp anye ate, “Nte afo udooho awo keed ke atu mbed amọ?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:25">Anye amaakañ ate, “Ndooho.”<verse eid="JHN 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 18:26" />Ayịnufọk ekamba aku keed, ayakka awo a-Pita akediaññake utọñ, amaamaana adibo Pita ate, “Nte ami ñkukịtte fiin ke inwañ ye anye?” <verse eid="JHN 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 18:27" />Pita amaamaana akañ, ndin kpa ke ndo-ndo ado, akikọunen amaatọọñọ adikpọk.<verse eid="JHN 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisọs ke Iso Pailed</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 18:28" />Akem mme etubom mme Yuu emaeben Yisọs ekpọñ iso Kaifas ekaa akwere Pailed, iwuodukara Rom. Ayio amaakpere adisiere, ndin mbon se ikiben Yisọs ika ikikamma idʌk atʌñ Pailed. Ntak akedo mbaak ammọ edibiat mbed adinam idem asana ke ntak ndutʌm Usọrọ Nsaña Mboiyo. <verse eid="JHN 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 18:29" />Ke ntoro, Pailed amaawuọ akebịp ammọ ate, “Nsoo ido ndudue awo ami? Nsoo ke ekoot anye ikpe ebaña?”<verse eid="JHN 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 18:30" />Ammọ emaebọọrọ ete, “Akpedo awo ami ikinieghe ndudue, ñnyịn ikpikimʌmmọ anye idiyaak unọ.”<verse eid="JHN 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 18:31" />Pailed amaabo ammọ ate, “Iben anye ikaa ikikpe ikpe amọ naña mbed ndufo ado.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:31">Mme Yuu emaefaaña ete, “Ñnyịn inieghe unen adiwot awo ndomokeed.” <verse eid="JHN 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 18:32" />Ami aketịppe nọ ikọ a-Yisọs aketañña abaña utọ ñkpa a-anye adiikpa asu.<verse eid="JHN 18:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 18:33" />Pailed amaatịmme adʌk akwere amọ, akedọñ ekoot Yisọs edi, anyʌñ abịp Yisọs ate, “Afo ado adidem mme Yuu?”<verse eid="JHN 18:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 18:34" />Yisọs amaabịp anye ate, <char style="wj">“Afo atañ ikọ ami ke ifiọk idem mfo, me ado mbon awo etañ unọọ fiin embaña miin?”</char><verse eid="JHN 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 18:35" />Pailed amaabọọrọ “Ami ndo Yuu? Ñkọ mbon ndufo ye mme ñkpoon aku ndufo uben fiin ediyaak ennọọ miin! Nsoo inekke ido ndudue mfo?”<verse eid="JHN 18:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 18:36" />Yisọs amaabo anye: <char style="wj">“Ubọọñ mmi idooho ake ederimbod ami. Akpedo ubọọñ mmi akedo ake ederimbod ami, nditọufọk mmi ekpaekenwana tutu mme etubom mme Yuu ikpikikanna immʌm miin. Ado ubọọñ mmi ato itie mfen.”</char><verse eid="JHN 18:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 18:37" />Pailed ndin amaabo anye, “Ke ntoro, awuọñọ ke afo ado adidem!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:37">Yisọs amaabọọrọ anye ate, <char style="wj">“Afo abo ke ami ndo adidem. Ke aditʌm ntañ, ntak a-ami ñkemanake ndi ederimbod ado adinam ekondo ediọọñọ akpanikọ. Afịd mbon se ima akpanikọ edo mbon e-ekoppo uyio mmi.”</char><verse eid="JHN 18:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 18:38" />Do ke Pailed akebịp Yisọs abo, “Nsoo ido akpanikọ?” Ke anye amaaketañ ami, anye amaamaana awuọ abịne mme Yuu e-ekebonoke ke anwa esiin, akebo ammọ, “Ami ñkịtte ndudue ndomokeed ke idem awo ami. <verse eid="JHN 18:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 18:39" />Nte ido ndufo adooho akpena ami nsaana awo ñkpakọb keed ñyaak inọ ndufo ke ini Usọrọ Nsaña Mboiyo. Emeyem ñyaak ‘adidem mme Yuu’ inọ?”<verse eid="JHN 18:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 18:40" />Afịd ammọ emaedọñ uyio keed ebo, “Kuuyaak awo ami-o! Utu ke ado yaak Barabas.” Ndin Barabas akedo awo a-akesịnne nsọk nọ mme awo esịn ntịme ke abio.<verse eid="JHN 18:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JHN 19" />
  <para style="s1">Ebiire Adikọñ Yisọs ke Krọs</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 19:1" />Pailed amaanam emia Yisọs. <verse eid="JHN 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 19:2" />Ndin mbon ekọñ emaedọk anyanya ñkukịm eyat anye ke iwuod, esịn anye iduud-iduud afọñ ubọọñ, <verse eid="JHN 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 19:3" />enyʌñ ekebo anye ndin-ndin ete, “Itọñ uwem asọñ adidem mme Yuu!” Ammọ emaenyʌñ esiak anye ufia ke mbañ.<verse eid="JHN 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 19:4" />Ini keed mfen, Pailed amaatịmme awuọ akebo mme Yuu ate, “Ami ñyaasaana anye ñyaak inọ ndufo sia ami ñkịtte ndudue a-anye anamma.” <verse eid="JHN 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 19:5" />Yisọs amaakewuọ adi ye anyanya ñkukịm ye afọñ ubọọñ, Pailed amaabo ammọ “Se ete ado mi!”<verse eid="JHN 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 19:6" />Ado mme ñkpoon aku ye mme adaaha ammọ ekekekịt anye, ammọ emaesio ñkpo ete, “Ikọñ anye ke krọs! Ikọñ anye ke krọs!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:6">Ado Pailed amaabọọrọ ammọ, “Ndufo iben anye ikaa ikikọñ ke krọs sia ami ñkịtte ndudue a-anye anamma.”<verse eid="JHN 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 19:7" />Mme Yuu emaeyiire ete, “Ñnyịn iminie mbed, ñko ke adikeene mbed ado, ana anye akpa sia anye abo ke imọ ido Ayịn Abasi.”<verse eid="JHN 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 19:8" />Pailed akekop ami, idem amaanekke anyeñ anye, <verse eid="JHN 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 19:9" />ndin anye amaatịmme adʌk esịd akwere akebịp Yisọs ate, “Afo ato uke?” Ado Yisọs ikibọọrọke anye. <verse eid="JHN 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 19:10" />Pailed amaabo anye, “Umbọọrọke miin? Udiọọñọke ke mmenie adudu adusaana ñyaak me adukọñ fiin ke krọs?”<verse eid="JHN 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 19:11" />Yisọs amaabọọrọ anye ate, <char style="wj">“Afo ukpunieghe adudu ndomokeed ke idem mmi akpedo ukuubọọhọ adudu uto anyọñ. Ke ntak ado anye a-ambenne miin usọk fiin anam idiọọkñkpọ a-akponno akan.”</char><verse eid="JHN 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 19:12" />Tọọñọ ke idahado kaa iso, Pailed amaayem usʌñ naña anye akpesaana Yisọs ayaak, ado mme adadusʌñ mme Yuu emaekaa iso ebọñ ke akpọsọñ uyio ete, “Adieke afo asaanake awo ami ayaak, afo udooho ufan Sisa. Awo akeedodo a-abooho ke ido abọọñ anyaaña itie ubọọñ ye Sisa.”<verse eid="JHN 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 19:13" />Pailed akekop ami, anye amaaben Yisọs awuọ adi aditie ke ñkpọitie ubiideikpe e-ekoodo Esa Itiad (ke usem Aramaik ekoot Kabata). <verse eid="JHN 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 19:14" />Usen ado akedo usen mbeeñeidem Usọrọ Nsaña Mboiyo, ndin akedo ñkpọ nte ñkanika duob mme iba uweemeayio.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:14">Ndin Pailed amaabo mme Yuu, “Se Abọọñ ndufo mi.”<verse eid="JHN 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 19:15" />Ammọ emaebọọñ ete, “Ben anye kaa! Ben anye kaa! Kọñ anye ke krọs!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:15">Pailed amaabịp ammọ ate, “Ebo ñkọñ adidem ndufo ke krọs?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:15">Mme ñkpoon aku emaebọọrọ ete, “Ñnyịn inieghe abọọñ mfen ke mmiibọhọke Sisa.”<verse eid="JHN 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 19:16" />Ke akpatre Pailed amaasaana anye ayaak anọ ammọ nọ ekekọñ ke krọs.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="JHN 19:16">Ukọñ Yisọs ke Krọs</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:16">Ndin mbon ekọñ emaeben Yisọs ewuọ. <verse eid="JHN 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 19:17" />Yisọs amaabiom krọs amọ awuọ akaa itie Ñkpọkpọrọ (e-ekoodo Kọlkọta ke usem Aramaik). <verse eid="JHN 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 19:18" />Ke emaekewuọ itie ado, ammọ emaekọñ anye ke krọs ye ideen iba mfen. Yisọs akesịne ke ufọọd ideen iba ami.<verse eid="JHN 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 19:19" />Pailed amaanam ewet idiọọñọ ekedian ke krọs Yisọs. Se ekewet akedo:</para>
  <para style="pc" vid="JHN 19:19">
    <char style="sc">Yisọs awo Nasared, Adidem mme Yuu</char><verse eid="JHN 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 19:20" />Umiañ mme Yuu emaekoot se ekewet, sia itie e-ekekọññọ Yisọs ke krọs amaakpere anwa abio. Ekewet idiọọñọ ado ke usem Aramaik, Latịn ye Krik. <verse eid="JHN 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 19:21" />Mme ñkpoon aku emaebo Pailed, “Kuuwet, ‘Adidem mme Yuu’ ado wet ke anye akebo imọ ido Adidem mme Yuu.”<verse eid="JHN 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 19:22" />Pailed amaabọọrọ ammọ ate, “Se mmaakewet, mmewewet.”<verse eid="JHN 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 19:23" />Ke mbon ekọñ emaekekọñ Yisọs ke krọs, ammọ emaesiak afọñidem amọ ke itie inaañ edat keedekeed, afọñ idakidem kpọd akesʌhọ Yisọs ke idem. Afọñ idakidem amọ akedo ifre keed tọọñọ ke anyọñ tutu asịm isọñ, ikinieghe itie e-ekesiaha ekịm ke ñkañ.<verse eid="JHN 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 19:24" />Ammọ emaebo emọ-emọ ete, “Yak ñnyịn ikiiwaak afọñ ami, ado yak isịn ukañ ise me anie idiinie.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:24">Ñkpọ ami aketịppe nọ ato do ikọ Abasi e-ekewette asu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 19:24">“Ammọ emaedeeme mme afọñ mmi ke atu idem ammọ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 19:24">Enyʌñ esịn ukañ ebaña afọñidem mmi.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JHN 19:24">Se mbon ekọñ ekenam ake adodo.<verse eid="JHN 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 19:25" />Eka Yisọs, ayịneka eka amọ awonwaan, Mmeri anwaan Klopas ye Mmeri Makdalin mmọdo ekedudak ekpere krọs Yisọs. <verse eid="JHN 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 19:26" />Yisọs akewọññọ anyen akịt eka amọ naña ada ye mbed a-anye akenekkeke ama naña ada akpere, anye amaabo eka amọ, <char style="wj">“Awonwaan, se ayịn mfo mi,”</char> <verse eid="JHN 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 19:27" />ndin amaanyʌñ abo mbed ado, <char style="wj">“Se eka mfo mi.”</char> Tọọñọ ke idahado, mbed ado amaaben eka Yisọs anyọñ ufọk amọ.<verse eid="JHN 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ñkpa Yisọs</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 19:28" />Ke amaakemaana koo, sia Yisọs amaakediọọñọ ke afịd ñkpọ amaakweeñe, nọ ikọ Abasi e-ekewette asu, anye amaabo, <char style="wj">“Itọñ ansat.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 19:29" />Atu ukọd fineka amaanaa akpere, ndin ammọ emaenyiin ndọbọ ke atu ado edot ke ñkọk hisọb enyan Yisọs ke ñkpọkinua. <verse eid="JHN 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 19:30" />Ke Yisọs amaakebọ ukọd ado, anye amaabo, <char style="wj">“A-akweeñe.”</char> Ndin anye amaasuuk iwuod ke isọñ asaana ukpọñ amọ ayaak.<verse eid="JHN 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 19:31" />Ini ado akedo ini Mbeeñeidem, ndin edemusen akena ado asaña-asaña usen Sabad. Sia mme etubom mme Yuu ikiyemme mme akpo ado ekọñọ tutu usen Sabad, ammọ emaebo Pailed yak abʌñ mbon e-ekekọññọ do ukod enyʌñ ekoono akpo ammọ esịññe. <verse eid="JHN 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 19:32" />Mbon ekọñ emaedibʌñ ukod akpa awo e-ekekọññọ ediana Yisọs ye ukod awo anye ako. <verse eid="JHN 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 19:33" />Amọ ekediwuọ itie Yisọs, emaekịt ke anye amaakpakpa, ndin ammọ ikikpaaha idem adibʌñ ukod amọ aba. <verse eid="JHN 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 19:34" />Utu ke ado, awo ekọñ keed amaakịm Yisọs ñkañ ke eduad, ndin iyiib ye mmọọñ emaewuọñọ. <verse eid="JHN 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 19:35" />Awo akekịtte ñkpọ ami akenọ ikọ ntiense ami, ndin ikọ ntiense amọ ado akpanikọ. Anye a-adiọọñọ ke imọ itañ akpanikọ, ndin anye anọ ikọ ntiense nọ ndufo ñko enịm ke akpanikọ. <verse eid="JHN 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 19:36" />Mme ñkpọ ami eketịppe nọ ikọ Abasi e-ewette asu: “Akpọ amọ ndomokeed idiibʌññọke,” <verse eid="JHN 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 19:37" />ñko, kpa naña ikọ Abasi mfen abo, “Ammọ eyaeda ese anye a-ammọ ekekịmme.”<verse eid="JHN 19:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ebuuk Yisọs</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 19:38" />Akema, Yosef awo Arimatia amaadibo Pailed akpọñ akpo Yisọs inọ. Yosef akedo mbed Yisọs, ado ke ndịbe sia anye akebaabaak mme ñkpoon awo mme Yuu. Ke Pailed amaakenọ unyịmme, anye amaadiben akpo Yisọs. <verse eid="JHN 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 19:39" />Anye akesaña ye Nikodemọs, ete a-akenwọọnọnwọọn akekịt Yisọs ke akonayio. Nikodemọs amaakama anem ufịk adan e-ekewuaha mee ye mme alo a-akedoppoke ñkpọ nte paun ata mme duob mme ition<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:39 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte kilokram 34</char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 19:40" />Ammọ awo iba emaedat mme anemufịk adan ami efiọññọ Yisọs ke idem enyʌñ edat afọñ linen ewañ anye naña ido ubuuk awo mme Yuu akesido. <verse eid="JHN 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 19:41" />Ke itie ekekọññọ Yisọs, inwañ amaaba akpere. Ke inwañ ado ufa udi keed amaaba a-adooho kpaanam awo ikibʌhọke. <verse eid="JHN 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 19:42" />Sia usen ado akedooho usen Mbeeñeidem mme Yuu, ñko sia udi ado amaakpere, ammọ emaenịm akpo Yisọs do.<verse eid="JHN 19:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JHN 20" />
  <para style="s1">Ukpọk Udi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 20:1" />Ke akpa usen ke udua, ke ini ayio miikinwañake diin, Mmeri Makdalin amaadika udi, anyʌñ akekịt ke emaenək itiad esio ke inua udi. <verse eid="JHN 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 20:2" />Anye amaafeghe abịne Saimọn Pita ye mbed keed mfen, anye a-Yisọs akemaaha, akebo “Ammọ ebenne Abọọñ esio ke udi, ndin ñnyịn idiọọñọke nte eben anye ekenịm.”<verse eid="JHN 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 20:3" />Do ke Pita ye mbed anye ako ekedaaña ekaiya udi adikise. <verse eid="JHN 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 20:4" />Ammọ awo iba emaefeeñe ekaa, ado mbed anye ako amaasọp itọk akan Pita anyʌñ ato akewuọ udi. <verse eid="JHN 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 20:5" />Anye amaanʌhọ ase esịd udi anyʌñ akịt mme mbai afọñ linen nte ebono ke isọñ, ado anye ikidʌkkọ esịd udi. <verse eid="JHN 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 20:6" />Ndin Saimọn Pita a-akekeeneke ke edem amaakedisịm, amaasọiyọ ini keed adʌk esịd udi. Anye amaakịt ubaak afọñ linen a-akenaaha do, <verse eid="JHN 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 20:7" />ye afọñ udi e-ekedatta ewañ Yisọs ke iwuod. Afọñ ami akena isio, asanna akpọñ linen. <verse eid="JHN 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 20:8" />Ke akpatre, mbed a-akebemme iso akewuọ amaadʌk esịd udi. Anye amaakịt anyʌñ anịm ke akpanikọ. <verse eid="JHN 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 20:9" />(Sia ikitʌmmọ inwaña ammọ se ñwed Abasi aketañ abo ke Yisọs ayaaset ke ñkpa.) <verse eid="JHN 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 20:10" />Ndin mme mbed ado emaenyọñọ ekaiya nte ammọ ekebañña.<verse eid="JHN 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisọs Awọt Mmeri Makdalin Idem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 20:11" />Ndin Mmeri Makdalin amaada ke mben udi atua. Ke ini anye akesʌkkọ atua, anye amaanʌhọ ase esịd udi, <verse eid="JHN 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 20:12" />anyʌñ akịt mme enyere iba nte esiine mfia afọñ ke idem etie ke itie e-ekenịmme akpo Yisọs, enyere keed ke ukañ iwuod, keed ke ukañ ukod.<verse eid="JHN 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 20:13" />Ammọ emaebịp anye ete, “Mma, nsinam afo atua?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:13">Anye amaabọọrọ, “E-eben Abọọñ mmi esio, ndin ami ndiọọñọke nte ammọ eben anye ekenịm.” <verse eid="JHN 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 20:14" />Anye aketañ ami ama, ke adikanna iso anye amaakịt Yisọs nte ada, ado anye ikidiọọñọke ke Yisọs ke ado.<verse eid="JHN 20:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 20:15" />Yisọs amaabịp anye ate, <char style="wj">“Awonwaan, ntak afo atuaha-a? Anie ke afo ayem?”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:15">Sia Mmeri Makdalin akekereke ke awo ado akedo atọ inwañ, anye amaabo, “Ete, akpedo ameben anye asio, tañ nnọ nte aben anye akenịm ndin ami ñyaakeben anye.”<verse eid="JHN 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 20:16" />Yisọs amaabo anye, <char style="wj">“Mmeri.”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:16">Anye amaakanna iso ase anye, asio ñkpo ke usem Aramaik ate, <char style="tl">“Raboni”</char> (a-awuọñọke “Andikpeeb”).<verse eid="JHN 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 20:17" />Yisọs amaabo anye, <char style="wj">“Kuntuuk, sia ami ndọọhọ diin ñkeene Ete mmi. Ado kaa bịne nditọeka mmi ideen nyʌñ ke dọkkọ ammọ, ‘Ami mmedọọk mbịne Ete mmi ye Ete ndufo, Abasi mmi ye Abasi ndufo.’ ”</char><verse eid="JHN 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 20:18" />Mmeri Makdalin amaadakka abịne mme mbed ye etob ami, akebo ammọ ate, “Ami mmekịt Abọọñ!” Anye amaatañ afịd ñkpọ se Yisọs akeneme ye anye anọ ammọ.<verse eid="JHN 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisọs Awọt mme Mbed Amọ Idem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 20:19" />Ke ndubiayio akpa usen ke udua ke ini mme mbed ekebaaha itie keed, ammọ emaeyịt usʌñ ke ntak ndịk mme etubom mme Yuu, ndin Yisọs amaadʌk akeda ke ufọọd ammọ, ate, <char style="wj">“Emem aba ye ndufo!”</char> <verse eid="JHN 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 20:20" />Ke anye amaaketañ ikọ ama, anye amaawọt ammọ ubọk ye ñkañ amọ. Mme mbed emaeyọhọ ye idaara ke ammọ edikikịt Abọọñ.<verse eid="JHN 20:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 20:21" />Yisọs amaamaana abo, <char style="wj">“Emem aba ye ndufo! Nte Ete akendọññọ miin, ami mmidọñ ndufo.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 20:22" />Aketañ ami ama, anye amaanweek ibifịk aduọk ammọ anyʌñ abo, <char style="wj">“Ibọ Adisana Sịbidịd.</char> <verse eid="JHN 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 20:23" /><char style="wj">Adieke ndufo efeene mme idiọọkñkpọ awo ndomokeed, e-efeen mme idiọọkñkpọ ammọ; ndufo imiifeene inọ ammọ, awo idiinyʌññọ ifeen inọ ammọ.”</char><verse eid="JHN 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisọs Awọt Tọmọs Idem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 20:24" />Ado Tọmọs (e-esikoodo Didimọs<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:24 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Tọmọs</char><char style="ft" closed="false">ado usem Aramaik ado </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Didimọs</char><char style="ft" closed="false">ado Greek, naña iba awuọñọ </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">amanamba.</char></note>), keed ke atu mme mbed duob mme iba, ikibaaha ye mbed mbon ako naña Yisọs akediighe. <verse eid="JHN 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 20:25" />Mme mbed mbon ako emaeditañ enọ anye ete, “Ñnyịn imikịt Abọọñ.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:25">Ado anye ikinịmme, ndin anye amaabo ammọ, “Ibọhọke ami ñkịt mbọn akpohoukwak ke ubọk amọ ñnyʌñ nsịn nnuun ubọk mmi ke itie mme akpohoukwak ekewʌhọke ke ñkañ amọ, ami ndiinịmme.”<verse eid="JHN 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 20:26" />Udua keed akeboiyo, afịd mme mbed emaekem ibad ke esịd ufọk, Tọmọs ñko amaaba ye ammọ. Akpesʌkado e-emaekeyịt usʌñ, Yisọs amaadʌk adida ke ufọọd ammọ abo, <char style="wj">“Emem aba ye ndufo!”</char> <verse eid="JHN 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 20:27" />Ndin anye amaabo Tọmọs, <char style="wj">“Sịn nnuun ubọk mfo mi; se ubọk mmi. Sịn ubọk mfo ke ñkañ mmi. Kuuyịk aba ado nịm ke akpanikọ.”</char><verse eid="JHN 20:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 20:28" />Tọmọs amaabo anye, “Abọọñ mmi ye Abasi mmi!”<verse eid="JHN 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 20:29" />Ndin Yisọs amaabo anye, <char style="wj">“Sia umauñkịt, amenịm ke akpanikọ. Afọfọn anọ mbon imiikịtte ado enịm ke akpanikọ.”</char><verse eid="JHN 20:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ntak a-Yọọn Akewette Eti Etob Ami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 20:30" />Yisọs amaanam uwak utịppeñkpọ ye mme idiọọñọ mfen ke iso mme mbed amọ, a-adooho awo iwette isịn ke ñwed ami. <verse eid="JHN 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 20:31" />Ado ewet mbon ami nọ ndufo enịm<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Akeme ido </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">ekaa iso enịm</char></note> ke akpanikọ ke Yisọs ado Krais, Ayịn Abasi, ndin ke adinịm ke akpanikọ ndufo enie uwem eto Anyịñ amọ.<verse eid="JHN 20:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JHN 21" />
  <para style="s1">Yisọs ye Utịppe Umʌm Iyak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 21:1" />Mme ñkpọ ami emaekeboiyo, Yisọs amaatịmme awọt mme mbed amọ idem ke mben Akpainyañ Kalili<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke usem Greek ekoot </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Tiberias</char></note>; ndin naña anye akewọt ammọ idem akedo ntom: <verse eid="JHN 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 21:2" />Saimọn Pita, Tọmọs (e-ekesikoodo Didimọs<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:2 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Tọmọs </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ado usem Aramaik ado </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Didimọs</char><char style="ft" closed="false">ado Greek, naña iba awuọñọ </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">amanamba.</char></note>), ye Natandiel awo Kana ke Kalili, mme nditọ ideen Sebidi, ye mbed amọ iba mfen, ekeba itie keed. <verse eid="JHN 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 21:3" />Saimọn Pita amaabo ammọ ate, “Ami ñyaaka ukọ iyak.” Ammọ emaebo anye, “Ñnyịn iyaukeene fiin ika.” Ammọ emaedaaña ekedọñọ ubom, ado ke afịd akonayio ado ammọ ikimʌmmọ iyak ndomokeed.<verse eid="JHN 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 21:4" />Ke ayio amaakesiere, ammọ emaekịt Yisọs naña ada ke esʌk, ado mbed ado ikidiọọñọke ibo ke Yisọs ke ado.<verse eid="JHN 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 21:5" />Yisọs amaabịp ammọ, <char style="wj">“Mme ufan mmi, ndufo imʌmmọ iyak ndomokeed?”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:5">Ammọ emaebọọrọ, “Iyoo.”<verse eid="JHN 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 21:6" />Anye amaabo ammọ, <char style="wj">“Itop iyịre ndufo ke ukañ ubọk nnasia ubom ndin ndufo eyaemʌm iyak.”</char> Ke ammọ emaekeduọọk iyịre naña Yisọs aketemme, ammọ emaemʌm ataa uwak iyak tutu ammọ ikikanna idʌt iyịre isịn ke ubom.<verse eid="JHN 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 21:7" />Ami amaanam mbed a-Yisọs akemaaha abo Pita, “Abọọñ ke ado!” Saimọn Pita akekop naña anye abo, “Abọọñ ke ado,” anye amaatap afọñ afʌk idem (sia anye amaakpọk afọñ akebet ke isịn), anyʌñ atamma adʌk mmọọñ. <verse eid="JHN 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 21:8" />Mbed mbon ñko emaekeene ke ubom, edʌt iyịre a-akeyọhọke ye iyak, sia ammọ ikinyọọñọ usʌñ ikpọñ esʌk; akedo ñkpọ nte yaad ikie<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte mita 90</char></note> adiwuọ abod. <verse eid="JHN 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 21:9" />Ke ammọ emaekebeghe ke esʌk, ammọ emaekịt ikañ ukañ naña aduek, iyak ye mme uyo enyʌñ edoro do.<verse eid="JHN 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 21:10" />Ndin Yisọs amaabo ammọ, <char style="wj">“Iben usʌk iyak a-ndufo esʌkkọ emʌm do idi.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 21:11" />Akem Saimọn Pita amaatịmme akedʌk ubom anyʌñ adʌt iyịre adi mben esʌk; iyịre akeyọhọ ye ñkpoon iyak. Ke ammọ ekebatta, emaekịt ñkpoon-ñkpoon iyak ikie mme aba mme duob mme ita (153). Kpa ye uwak iyak a-ammọ ekemʌmmọ, iyịre ikikịppeke. <verse eid="JHN 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 21:12" />Yisọs amaabo ammọ ate, <char style="wj">“Idi ididia ndidia ubakusen.”</char> Mbed amọ ndomokeed ikideeghede ibịp anye ibo, “Afo ado anie awo?” Sia ammọ emaediọọñọ ke Abọọñ ke akedo. <verse eid="JHN 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 21:13" />Yisọs amaadi, adiben uyo anọ ammọ, anyʌñ anam ntoro ye iyak ñko. <verse eid="JHN 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 21:14" />Ami akedo ayọhọ akañ ita a-Yisọs akewọttọ mbed amọ idem tọọñọ nte anye akeset ke ñkpa.<verse eid="JHN 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisọs Atịmme Anọ Pita Ayọhọ Itie Amọ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 21:15" />Ke ammọ emaekedia ndidia ema, Yisọs amaabịp Saimọn Pita ate: <char style="wj">“Saimọn, ayịn Yọọn, nte afo amemma miin akan afịd ami?”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:15">Anye amaabọọrọ, “Ii Abọọñ, afo amediọọñọ ke ami mmuma fiin.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:15">Yisọs amaabo anye, <char style="wj">“Bọọk nditọ edọñ mmi!”</char><verse eid="JHN 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 21:16" />Yisọs amaamaana abịp Pita ate, <char style="wj">“Saimọn, ayịn Yọọn, nte afo amemma miin.”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:16">Anye amaabọọrọ, “Ii Abọọñ, afo amediọọñọ ke ami mmuma fiin.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:16">Yisọs amaabo anye, <char style="wj">“Kpeme mme edọñ mmi.”</char><verse eid="JHN 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 21:17" />Yisọs amaatịmme abịp Pita ayọhọ akañ ita ate, <char style="wj">“Saimọn, ayịn Yọọn, nte afo amemma miin?”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:17">Esịd amaabʌññọ Pita sia Yisọs akemaanake abịp anye mbuume ami ayọhọ ñke nta ate, <char style="wj">“Nte afo amemma miin?”</char> Anye ndin amaabo Yisọs ate, “Abọọñ, afo amediọọñọ afịd ñkpọ; afo amediọọñọ ke ami mmuma fiin.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:17">Yisọs amaabo anye, <char style="wj">“Bọọk mme edọñ mmi.</char> <verse eid="JHN 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 21:18" /><char style="wj">Ke ataa akpanikọ ke ami ntañ unọọ fiin, idaha a-afo akedooho akparawa, afo akesisịne afọñ ke idem mfo ikpọọñ anyʌñ asaña aka itie nte afo ama; ado afo umausọñ uduusunyanyanna ubọk, ndin awo mfen usịn fiin afọn, anyʌñ uben fiin akaa itie nte afo umuuyemme adika.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 21:19" />Yisọs aketañ ami adiwọt utọ ñkpa se Pita adiidat inọ Abasi ubọọñ. Akema, Yisọs amaabo anye, <char style="wj">“Ñkeene miin!”</char><verse eid="JHN 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 21:20" />Pita amaawọññọ iso, anyʌñ akịt ke mbed a-Yisọs akemaaha akesʌk akeene ammọ. (Anye a-akenyʌkkọke abere Yisọs ke ini akpatre ndidia ndubi, anyʌñ abịp Yisọs mbuume abo, “Abọọñ, anie ado awo se iduutap fiin?”). <verse eid="JHN 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 21:21" />Ke ini Pita amaakekịt anye, amaabịp Yisọs ate: “Abọọñ, ake amọọ?”<verse eid="JHN 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 21:22" />Yisọs amaabọọrọ anye, <char style="wj">“Adieke adooho uduak mmi adibo anye adu uwem tutu ami ntịmme ndi, ado ubeghe die fiin? Ana afo añkeene miin.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 21:23" />Ibọọrọ ami amaanam mbʌk asuana ke atu mme andinịm ke akpanikọ ke mbed ado idiikpaaha. Ado Yisọs ikibooho ke mbed ado idiikpaaha. Ado akebo, <char style="wj">“Adieke ami ñyemme nọ anye akaiso adu uwem tutu ami ntịmme ndi, ado ubeghe fiin die? Ana afo añkeene miin.”</char><verse eid="JHN 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 21:24" />Mbed ami ado anye a-atieghe ntiense abaña mme ñkpọ ami, a-akenyʌññọ awet mme ñkpọ ami anịm. Ñnyịn imidiọọñọ ke ikọ ntiense amọ ado akpanikọ.<verse eid="JHN 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 21:25" />Yisọs amaanam mme uwak ñkpọ mfen ñko. Akpedo ekebiiwewet afịd mme ñkpọ ado idọñ ke ñwed, ami mmekere ke idem ederimbod ami ikpidọñọke mme ñwed se ekpewet.<verse eid="JHN 21:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 21" />
</usx>